  <Placemark>
    <name>Arkhyz Bike Park (Russia) [3350 RUB]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Arkhyz Romantik 1655 m - valley station of the Mlechny Put gondola</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>More than 30 km of prepared bike-park trails across the south and north sectors. Green progression trails occupy the south slope, with blue and red flow and jump trails plus black expert lines and rougher northern-slope riding. Descents start in alpine terrain and continue through conifer forest; the park also hosts downhill, enduro, dual-slalom and e-MTB events.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The Mlechny Put gondola serves the south side and carries bikes in marked cabins. The 2026 one-day bike pass is 3,350 RUB adult / 2,450 RUB child; multi-day and season passes are available. Rental, workshop, instruction and guiding are available at the resort.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 16 May; closed from 16 October (published 2026 period).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-16:30<br/><small>The north sector may open later because of snow. Lift maintenance days and weather closures occur; check the official status before travelling.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Mineralnye Vody airport</td><td>Car / shuttle</td><td>3-3.5 h</td></tr><tr><td>Arkhyz village</td><td>Car / taxi</td><td>15-20 min</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://arkhyzbikepark.ru/">official bike-park site</a>, <a href="https://arkhyzbikepark.ru/contacts">published 2026 season and hours</a>, <a href="https://resort-arkhyz.ru/services/summer/bike-park/">official 2026 prices and trail information</a> and the resort's published GPS coordinate for the Mlechny Put upper station.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-blue</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>41.178601,43.542278,1653</coordinates></Point>
    <ExtendedData xmlns:mwm="https://comaps.app"><mwm:properties><mwm:value key="spot">arkhyz-bike-park</mwm:value><mwm:value key="tags">beginner expert bike-park dh enduro freeride gondola</mwm:value><mwm:value key="price_day">3350 RUB</mwm:value><mwm:value key="open_from">05-16</mwm:value><mwm:value key="closed_from">10-16</mwm:value></mwm:properties><mwm:icon>Mountain</mwm:icon><mwm:visibility>1</mwm:visibility></ExtendedData>
  </Placemark>
