  <Placemark>
    <name>Bobrovy Log Bike Park (Krasnoyarsk, Russia) [1350 RUB]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Krasnoyarsk 160 m - valley station of the K1 chairlift</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Compact lift-served gravity riding on the steep, forested edge of the Eastern Sayan. The official bike park includes a skills zone and prepared downhill trails; DH trail 8 is the main advanced line, with fast berms, technical forest sections and race features. Blue and red training trails are used by the local MTB academy, and the park regularly hosts Fun Bike Race downhill events.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The K1 detachable chairlift carries mountain bikes on designated chairs. The published 2026 bike pass costs 1,000 RUB for four hours or 1,350 RUB for the day. Operation is conditional on trail inspection, weather and the K1 schedule.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 01 June; closed from 01 October (typical snow-free operating window; check the official schedule).<br/>Daily opening hours: according to K1 lift schedule<br/><small>DH trail 8 opens only after inspection. A suitable mountain bike, helmet and protective equipment are required.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Central Krasnoyarsk</td><td>Car / taxi / bus</td><td>15-30 min</td></tr><tr><td>Krasnoyarsk airport</td><td>Car / taxi</td><td>50-70 min</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://bobrovylog.ru/services/bayk-park/">official bike-park information and 2026 prices</a>, <a href="https://bobrovylog.ru/pravila-fanparka/">official bike-park rules</a> and <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/node/1503587400">OSM K1 upper station node 1503587400</a>.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-blue</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>92.796489,55.960588,162</coordinates></Point>
    <ExtendedData xmlns:mwm="https://comaps.app"><mwm:properties><mwm:value key="spot">bobrovy-log-bike-park</mwm:value><mwm:value key="tags">beginner expert bike-park dh freeride chairlift</mwm:value><mwm:value key="price_day">1350 RUB</mwm:value><mwm:value key="open_from">06-01</mwm:value><mwm:value key="closed_from">10-01</mwm:value></mwm:properties><mwm:icon>Mountain</mwm:icon><mwm:visibility>1</mwm:visibility></ExtendedData>
  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Bobrovy Log Bike Park: top of the K1 chairlift</name>
