    <description><![CDATA[1.7 km of the Pinguiller blue bike-park trail, which the <a href="https://www.valberg.com/app/uploads/2024/03/valberg-plan-vtt-bikepark-2025.pdf">official Valberg map</a> lists at 2.8 km - only this section is mapped. Geometry simplified from <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/710341702">OpenStreetMap way 710341702</a>; indicative only, follow the signs.]]></description>
