  <Placemark>
    <name>Les Pléiades: Blonay valley station (621 m)</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Blonay station (MVR rack railway, 621 m)</b><br/><br/>
    Where the rack section starts and where most descents finish. Verified on <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/node/2827690369">OSM node 2827690369</a> - not to be confused with the Blonay-Chamby heritage railway station 70 m away. See the main Les Pléiades pin for trails, prices and access.]]></description>
