  <Placemark>
    <name>Leysin - Berneuse [28 CHF / Magic Pass]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Leysin 1265 m - village, five minutes from the Berneuse gondola</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Three runs off the Berneuse: the blue Lisin, 2.2 km of gentle natural-ground turns; Les Trois Tours, 1.5 km of red; and Nerine, 2.7 km that starts red and finishes black, steep, with obstacles and gap jumps and doubles of four to seven metres. So 1 blue, 2 red and 1 black section - small, but the black is a proper one. A second blue is being built from June 2026 with the first part due in August, and a green run suitable for handcycles is planned for 2027. Away from the park, natural enduro lines run out across the Leysin side: the red Eau froide drops 810 m over 4.7 km to the Rhone valley floor, the blue Lac d'Ai - Luan covers 3.0 km and 660 m off the Tour d'Ai shoulder, and Vers les Barmes and ETraversin fill in shorter links.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The Aigle-Leysin cog railway brings you into the village at 1265 m; the Berneuse gondola station is about five minutes away by bike. Day pass 28 CHF, and Leysin is on the Magic Pass.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from late June; closed from the end of October (operator's published window).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/><small>Typical daily estimate; check the operator schedule.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Aigle</td><td>Cog railway</td><td>~30 min</td></tr><tr><td>Lausanne</td><td>Train</td><td>~1h20</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.alpesvaudoises.ch/en/Z100/leysin/leysin-bike-park">Leysin Bike Park</a>.
    Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-blue</styleUrl>
    <Point><coordinates>7.006709,46.345636,1461</coordinates></Point>
    <ExtendedData xmlns:mwm="https://comaps.app">
      <mwm:properties>
        <mwm:value key="spot">leysin</mwm:value>
        <mwm:value key="tags">beginner intermediate expert magic-pass bike-park dh enduro rain-sensitive tested-and-approved gondola</mwm:value>
        <mwm:value key="open_from">06-20</mwm:value>
        <mwm:value key="closed_from">08-24</mwm:value>
