        <mwm:value key="spot">leysin</mwm:value>
        <mwm:value key="tags">expert magic-pass bike-park dh enduro</mwm:value>
      </mwm:properties>
      <mwm:icon>Transport</mwm:icon>
      <mwm:visibility>1</mwm:visibility>
    </ExtendedData>
  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Leysin: Les 3 Tours</name>
    <description><![CDATA[2.5 km and about 490 m of descent, from 1906 m below the Tete d'Ai down to 1413 m. The upper 1.1 km follows the connected OSM path to the official Les 3 Tours GPX start. The bike-park section then continues with tables and jumps, playful singletrack, wooden features and natural forest traverses. A few steps can surprise less experienced riders. The line skirts the Ai Ai Ai black on its east side, then carries on down the lower Les 3 Tours section. <i>Sources: <a href="https://www.alpesvaudoises.ch/en/V546/leysin/les-3-tours">Alpes Vaudoises - Les 3 Tours</a> and <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/63407951">OpenStreetMap</a>. Upper section from the official GPX joined to OSM geometry; the bypass around Ai Ai Ai follows <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/370835208">way 370835208</a>; lower section drawn in gpx.studio. Simplified to 8 m.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#line-red</styleUrl>
