  <Placemark>
    <name>Crans-Montana: Plaine Morte - Sion epic</name>
    <description><![CDATA[32.9 km high-alpine descent from the Plaine Morte glacier (2882 m) to the edge of Sion (564 m): 3101 m of descending against 783 m of climbing, over the Wysshorelücke and the Col du Rawyl, then down past Lac de Tseuzier and the Ayent villages. Long, remote terrain: check conditions before riding. <i>Source: recorded.</i>]]></description>
