  <Placemark>
    <name>Crans-Montana: Corbire Bike</name>
    <description><![CDATA[20.1 km, +1003/-1003 m. Head off on a challenging mountain bike loop starting from the centre of Crans-Montana. Alpine pastures, forests, lakes and panoramic views from Chetzeron shape this playful, varied ride. <i>Source: <a href="https://www.crans-montana.ch/en/mod_oa#ipd=807764251">Crans-Montana - Corbire Bike</a>. Official Outdooractive geometry supplied by Crans-Montana, simplified to 8 m.</i>]]></description>
