  <Placemark>
    <name>Crans-Montana: Flowtrail Arnouva</name>
    <description><![CDATA[2.5 km, +27/-221 m. This 2.5 km route is ideal for getting started in downhill mountain biking in complete safety, all set within a beautiful forest. <i>Source: <a href="https://www.crans-montana.ch/en/mod_oa#ipd=807764312">Crans-Montana - Flowtrail Arnouva</a>. Official Outdooractive geometry supplied by Crans-Montana, simplified to 8 m.</i>]]></description>
