  <Placemark>
    <name>Les Habères Bike Park (Vallée Verte) [20.50 EUR]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Darandet 944 m - valley station of the Darandet chairlift</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Three lift-served downhill tracks share about 210 m of vertical: the 2.2 km green La Daranverte for beginners, the 1.8 km blue La Darandel with tables, rollers, doubles, berms and a step-up, and the 1.4 km red La Dre Ba for riders with good to very good technical ability. The compact park mixes forest and alpine meadows, with a beginner practice area at the base.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The Darandet chairlift carries bikes Friday to Sunday in summer. Day pass 20.50 EUR adult, 14.50 EUR child; 4 hours 17 EUR / 12 EUR; single ride 7 EUR. Free with the Magic Pass.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 10 July; closed from 17 August (published 2026 dates). Spring and autumn weekend openings: check the operator schedule.<br/>Daily opening hours: 10:00-17:00<br/><small>Published operating hours; check the operator schedule.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Lausanne</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h00</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://leshaberes.com/bike-park">Les Haberes official site</a>.
    Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
