  <Placemark>
    <name>Anzere: Arnica Bike</name>
    <description><![CDATA[17.6 km intermediate enduro loop, +733/-733 m. From Anzere it climbs through the Grillesses mayens, follows the Bisse de Sion towards Les Rousses and Pra Combere, then returns through the Serin, Duez and Tsalan alpine pastures before descending via La Brune. <i>Source: <a href="https://www.anzere.ch/fr/experiences/activites-ete/velo/vtt/arnica-bike/">Anzere Tourism</a>. Official GPX geometry supplied by Anzere Tourism, simplified to 15 m.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#line-red</styleUrl>
