  <Placemark>
    <name>Anzere: Gentiane Bike Light</name>
    <description><![CDATA[7.2 km easy lift-assisted route, +67/-580 m. From the Pas de Maimbre gondola mid-station it crosses the Tsalan and Duez alpine pastures, then makes a long, direct descent to Les Grillesses and returns to Anzere on the Route des Luys. <i>Source: <a href="https://www.anzere.ch/fr/experiences/activites-ete/velo/vtt/gentiane-bike-light/">Anzere Tourism</a>. Official GPX geometry supplied by Anzere Tourism, simplified to 15 m.</i>]]></description>
