  <Placemark>
    <name>Champery: World Cup DH (black)</name>
    <description><![CDATA[2.4 km official bike-park trail. The legendary World Cup track: an exceptionally steep, technical natural descent through the forest, with fast turns, roots and rocks. <i>Source and GPX: <a href="https://www.regiondentsdumidi.ch/en/6866568-dh-track-n01-black-world-cup-63510/">Region Dents du Midi</a>.</i>]]></description>
