    <description><![CDATA[0.6 km official bike-park trail. A short, dynamic and fast alternative finish to the World Cup track, splitting into a more accessible forest section with tight turns. <i>Source and GPX: <a href="https://www.regiondentsdumidi.ch/en/6866676-dh-track-n02-red-chevreuil-63516/">Region Dents du Midi</a>.</i>]]></description>
