  <Placemark>
    <name>Verbier: Enduro 05 - La Chaux - Shlerondes - Le Chable</name>
    <description><![CDATA[10.6 km, +56/-1,432 m advanced enduro route. Varied advanced descent from La Chaux through Shlerondes and authentic hamlets. The trail to Sarreyer changes steepness and difficulty quickly; the lower section to Le Chable is gentler and finishes on rewarding singletrack. Slow down through the hamlets. <i>Source: <a href="https://www.verbier.ch/decouvrir/explore-activites/activites-sportives/balades-et-randonnees-pedestres/tous-les-itineraires-de-randonnee-et-les-balades/enduro-05-avance-la-chaux-shlerondes-le-chable-verbier-fr-2794031/">Verbier - Enduro 05</a>. Official GPX geometry, simplified to 8 m.</i>]]></description>
