  <Placemark>
    <name>Verbier: Enduro 06 - La Planie</name>
    <description><![CDATA[9.9 km, +302/-449 m beginner enduro route. Family-friendly panoramic traverse from La Chaux via Les Ruinettes to the Croix de Coeur above Verbier. The route is mostly gentle and offers broad views of the surrounding mountains. <i>Source: <a href="https://www.verbier.ch/decouvrir/explore-activites/activites-sportives/balades-et-randonnees-pedestres/tous-les-itineraires-de-randonnee-et-les-balades/enduro-06-famille-debutant-la-planie-verbier-fr-2794058/">Verbier - Enduro 06</a>. Official GPX geometry, simplified to 8 m.</i>]]></description>
