  <Placemark>
    <name>Verbier: Enduro 01 - Verbier - Le Chable</name>
    <description><![CDATA[7.7 km, +97/-799 m beginner enduro route. Easy, quick route from Verbier to Le Chable. It starts with a steep gravel-road descent to Medieres, crosses the Verbier road several times, climbs briefly to the Vernays chapel viewpoint, then finishes on a winding forest road. <i>Source: <a href="https://www.verbier.ch/decouvrir/explore-activites/activites-sportives/balades-et-randonnees-pedestres/tous-les-itineraires-de-randonnee-et-les-balades/enduro-01-debutant-verbier-le-chable-verbier-fr-2794045/">Verbier - Enduro 01</a>. Official GPX geometry, simplified to 8 m.</i>]]></description>
