  <Placemark>
    <name>Verbier: Enduro 02 - Ruinettes - Clambin - Le Chable</name>
    <description><![CDATA[17.1 km, +153/-1,483 m beginner enduro route. Beginner route from Les Ruinettes to Le Chable using forest roads throughout. It passes Hattey and Clambin, continues toward Sarreyer and Lourtier, then follows quiet roads through Champsec to Le Chable. <i>Source: <a href="https://www.verbier.ch/decouvrir/explore-activites/activites-sportives/balades-et-randonnees-pedestres/tous-les-itineraires-de-randonnee-et-les-balades/enduro-02-debutant-ruinettes-clambin-le-chable-verbier-fr-2794095/">Verbier - Enduro 02</a>. Official GPX geometry, simplified to 8 m.</i>]]></description>
