  <Placemark>
    <name>Verbier: Enduro 09 - Savoleyres - Patier - Le Chable</name>
    <description><![CDATA[12.9 km, +119/-1,595 m advanced enduro route. Long advanced descent from Savoleyres through varied terrain to Le Chable. It crosses alpine pasture below Pierre Avoi, enters wider playful forest trails near La Marlenaz, then uses the historic paved Reposoire path below Verbier. <i>Source: <a href="https://www.verbier.ch/decouvrir/explore-activites/activites-sportives/balades-et-randonnees-pedestres/tous-les-itineraires-de-randonnee-et-les-balades/enduro-09-avance-savoleyres-patier-le-chable-verbier-fr-2794033/">Verbier - Enduro 09</a>. Official GPX geometry, simplified to 8 m.</i>]]></description>
