  <Placemark>
    <name>Verbier: Enduro 11 - Vertigo</name>
    <description><![CDATA[5.7 km, +107/-1,218 m expert natural enduro route, unofficially known as Vertigo. Very steep, technical and sustained expert descent. A demanding traverse with beautiful views of the glacier reaches the Mintzet pasture before the trail enters an exposed no-fall forest ridge, drops roughly 1,000 m, and finishes along the torrent embankment into Lourtier. <i>Source: <a href="https://www.verbier.ch/decouvrir/explore-activites/activites-sportives/balades-et-randonnees-pedestres/tous-les-itineraires-de-randonnee-et-les-balades/enduro-11-expert-la-chaux-lourtier-verbier-fr-2794060/">Verbier - Enduro 11</a>. Official GPX geometry, simplified to 8 m.</i>]]></description>
