  <Placemark>
    <name>Verbier: Rodze</name>
    <description><![CDATA[2.1 km red downhill trail. Verbier's emblematic red trail from Fontanet toward La Chaux and Les Ruinettes, combining 65 jumps, berms and rocky sections with open views toward the Combins massif. <i>Source: <a href="https://www.verbier.ch/decouvrir/explore-activites/activites-sportives/balades-et-randonnees-pedestres/tous-les-itineraires-de-randonnee-et-les-balades/rodze-verbier-fr-2794059/">Verbier - Rodze</a>. Official GPX geometry, simplified to 8 m.</i>]]></description>
