  <Placemark>
    <name>Verbier: Tu cuci!</name>
    <description><![CDATA[3.3 km, +6/-590 m red downhill trail. Technical and playful red run from Les Ruinettes to Medran, built around jumps, north-shore features and opportunities for airtime. It crosses Tsopu once and intersects Tire's Fire several times. <i>Source: <a href="https://www.verbier.ch/decouvrir/explore-activites/activites-sportives/balades-et-randonnees-pedestres/tous-les-itineraires-de-randonnee-et-les-balades/tu-cuci-verbier-fr-2794012/">Verbier - Tu cuci!</a>. Official GPX geometry, simplified to 8 m.</i>]]></description>
