  <Placemark>
    <name>Verbier: Tour du Mont-Fort (Col des Gentianes descent)</name>
    <description><![CDATA[15.8 km black high-alpine descent from Col des Gentianes (2870 m) down past the Tortin glacier terrain toward Siviez, in the Mont-Fort/4 Vallees sector. <i>Source: <a href="https://map.schweizmobil.ch/">SchweizMobil map</a>.</i>]]></description>
