    <name>Verbier: Tour du Mont-Fort - Pro Rider</name>
    <description><![CDATA[61.7 km cross-country loop linking Verbier, Nendaz and La Tzoumaz, ~3.6 km of climbing and descent via Col des Gentianes; very difficult, for fit riders willing to pedal. <i>Source: <a href="https://www.verbier.ch/en/offers/tour-du-mont-fort-pro-rider-verbier-en-2794037/">Verbier - Tour du Mont-Fort Pro Rider</a>.</i>]]></description>
