  <Placemark>
    <name>Les 2 Alpes: Venosc - bottom of the Venosc side</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Venosc 963 m - valley station of the Venosc gondola</b><br/><br/>
    The bottom of the Venosc side and the low point of the resort's 2000 m of vertical - the long descents from the glacier end here, and the gondola carries bikes back up to 1622 m. See the main Les Deux Alpes pin for trails, prices and access.]]></description>
