  <Placemark>
    <name>Lenzerheide: top of the Rothorn cable car</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Parpaner Rothorn 2837 m - top of the Rothorn cable car</b><br/><br/>
    Reached in two stages from Lenzerheide: the Rothorn 1 gondola to the 1902 m mid-station, then the Rothorn 2 cable car. This is where the Bike Kingdom Park lines and the full 1400 m descent begin. See the main Lenzerheide pin for trails, prices and access.]]></description>
