  <Placemark>
    <name>Les 7 Laux - Prapoutel (Belledonne) [21.50 EUR online]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Prapoutel 1335 m - valley station of the Chamois chairlift</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Around 14 graded descents - roughly 1 to 3 green, 3 blue, 5 red and 5 black depending on which season's map you read - on natural ground rather than shaped dirt: forest, roots and genuinely technical rock. It is the Grenoble locals' park, half an hour from the city, and it rides harder than the grades suggest.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Two chairlifts from Prapoutel at 1335 m, and they alternate days in summer: Bouquetins on Monday, Wednesday and Friday, Chamois on Tuesday, Thursday and at the weekend - worth checking before you drive up. Day pass 21.50 EUR booked online.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 4 July; closed from 31 August (published 2026 main season; some weekends run either side).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:30-17:00<br/><small>Typical daily estimate; check the operator schedule.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Grenoble</td><td>Car</td><td>~45 min</td></tr><tr><td>Lyon</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h50</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.les7laux.com/summer/the-station/mountain-biking-hiking/mountain-bike/areas-dedicated-to-mountain-biking/downhill-mountain-biking/">Les 7 Laux</a>.
    Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
