    </ExtendedData>
  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>La Berra (Fribourg Prealps) [37 CHF / Magic Pass]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>La Roche 1040 m - valley station of the La Berra telemixte</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Two built descents, about 9 km of downhill between them: the blue Allieres, 5.6 km of turns, flowing sections and small jumps with the Prealps laid out in front of you, and the red La Tschaka, 3.4 km of linked berms and jumps that keeps experienced riders honest. One blue and one red, no black - which makes La Berra the sensible Fribourg option for a first bike-park day rather than a place to chase steeps. Wash-down, bike hire and mountain huts on the way.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The telemixte from La Roche at 1040 m; the cabins take bikes, so you lap without pedalling. Day pass 37 CHF, and it is on the Magic Pass.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from late May; closed from late October (typical window; check the operator and conditions).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/><small>Typical daily estimate; check the operator schedule.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Fribourg</td><td>Bus</td><td>~40 min</td></tr><tr><td>Lausanne</td><td>Train + bus</td><td>~1h30</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.laberra.ch/fr/activites-details/berra-bike-park-2">Berra Bike Park</a>.
    Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-blue</styleUrl>
    <Point><coordinates>7.154978,46.686608,1038</coordinates></Point>
