  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>La Robella: La Carabosse</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Official 3 km difficult downhill from La Robella to Buttes, with 480 m of descent: approximately 2 km of demanding singletrack and 1 km of asphalt/access track. Expect technical obstacles and large jumps, although the operator says every feature can be bypassed. A sighting lap, full-face helmet and body protection are strongly recommended.<br/><br/>Geometry follows the five MTB downhill sections mapped in OpenStreetMap ways <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/919395620">919395620</a>, <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/285345983">285345983</a>, <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/285345990">285345990</a>, <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/285341626">285341626</a> and <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/285240316">285240316</a>, joined along mapped access tracks. Indicative only; follow the signs on the ground.<br/><br/><i>Sources: <a href="https://www.robella.ch/downhill/">La Robella</a> and <a href="https://schweizmobil.ch/en/mountainbiking-in-switzerland/route-10004">SwitzerlandMobility route 10004</a>.</i>]]></description>
