  <Placemark>
    <name>Schwarzsee: Salzmatt</name>
    <description><![CDATA[2.3 km blue trail, dropping 197 m from 1631 m to 1434 m at an average 8%. A high traverse west off the Kaiseregg flank towards Riggisalp. Drawn as two sections joined across a 45 m gap. Geometry drawn in gpx.studio and supplied for this map, simplified to approximately 8 m - indicative only; follow the signs on the ground.]]></description>
