  <Placemark>
    <name>Schwarzsee: Ober Hürli</name>
    <description><![CDATA[2.5 km blue trail, dropping 320 m from 1480 m to 1160 m at an average 13%. A descent from the eastern slopes down towards the lake, the steadiest of the blue lines here. Geometry drawn in gpx.studio and supplied for this map, simplified to approximately 8 m - indicative only; follow the signs on the ground.]]></description>
