  <Placemark>
    <name>Wiriehorn - Diemtigtal [43 CHF]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Riedli 1000 m - valley station of the Wiriehornbahn chairlift</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A small park that punches above its size. Three graded descents off the chairlift: the flowing Alptrail-Lehrpfad for a first day, the medium Old T-Bar, and the demanding Der Mutz, 2.6 km of steep berms, wall rides, jumps and drops. The Weryhorny race track on the same hill has held the Swiss downhill championships more than once. So 1 easy, 1 medium and 2 hard lines. The valley station has a full beginner set-up: pumptracks at several levels, a skills park and three child-friendly trails, plus a bike school, wash-down, showers and camping.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The Wiriehornbahn chairlift from Riedli at 1000 m to 1410 m. Day pass 43 CHF adult, 38 CHF youth and senior; for children of 6 to 15 the price in francs is the child's age.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 1 April; closed from 16 November (typical window; check the operator and conditions).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/><small>Typical daytime hours; published Friday and Saturday evening service runs until 20:00 in July and August.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Oey-Diemtigen</td><td>Bus</td><td>~25 min</td></tr><tr><td>Bern</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h10</td></tr><tr><td>Lausanne</td><td>Train + bus</td><td>~2h45</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.wiriehorn.ch/bikepark">Bikepark Wiriehorn</a>. The Balmiwald line was drawn in gpx.studio and supplied for this map, simplified to ~8 m.
    Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
