  <Placemark>
    <name>Wiriehorn: Balmiwald</name>
    <description><![CDATA[2.3 km red trail, dropping 510 m from 1856 m to 1346 m at an average 22%. A steep natural descent in the Diemtigtal, starting about 2 km from the top of the Wiriehornbahn and 450 m above it, so it is reached on foot or by pedalling rather than straight off the lift. Geometry drawn in gpx.studio and supplied for this map, simplified to approximately 8 m - indicative only; follow the signs on the ground.]]></description>
