  <Placemark>
    <name>Kandersteg - Sunnbuel [cable car, price unverified]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Kandersteg 1200 m - valley station of the Sunnbueel cable car</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>One trail, and that is the point: the Sunnbueel freeride trail, 5.3 km dropping 739 m from the top station back to Kandersteg. It suits downhill riders and all-rounders equally, so there is nothing here for a beginner and nothing extreme either. Changing room and wash-down at the base station.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The Sunnbueel cable car from Kandersteg at 1200 m. Bikes go in a rack on the cabin - you load your own, the attendant checks and lashes it before departure. Prices are set by the cable car company; check the operator.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from mid-June; closed from late October (typical window; check the operator and conditions).<br/>Daily opening hours: 08:00-17:00<br/><small>Typical daily estimate; check the operator schedule.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Kandersteg station</td><td>Bus or bike</td><td>~10 min</td></tr><tr><td>Bern</td><td>Train</td><td>~1h05</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://sunnbuel.ch/">Sunnbueel cable car</a>.
    Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
