  <Placemark>
    <name>Grindelwald: Grindelwald Terminal (Eigerexpress)</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Grindelwald Terminal 937 m - valley station of the Eigerexpress</b><br/><br/>
    The gondola to Eigergletscher, and with the Wengernalpbahn the way up to Kleine Scheidegg for the Eigertrail, Romantikweg, Gemsenweg, Blackrock, Lauberhorn and Scheideggwang lines drawn here. Bike carriage and the current fare are not confirmed here - check jungfrau.ch.<br/><br/>
    <i>Pin on the OSM-mapped <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/node/299136559">Grindelwald Terminal</a> (node 299136559), measured at 937 m.</i>]]></description>
