  <Placemark>
    <name>Bellwald (Goms, above Fiesch) [from 40 CHF]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Bellwald 1624 m - valley station of the Richinen chairlift</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Seven graded lines plus a pumptrack, all on natural ground through forest and open alp rather than machine-shaped dirt: 3 blue (Forest Bump, the family flow line with berms and small jumps, Vast &amp; Furious and Line King), 2 red (Into the Wild and the enduro-style Lord of the Rims), and 2 black (Sliderman, a technical play trail through rock and roots, and Dirty Cranking, the proper downhill line). One of the better-known lift-served freeride parks in Switzerland, and quiet, because the Goms is a long way up the Rhone.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Two chairlift sections from Bellwald at 1624 m: the Richinen chair to 2077 m, then the Furggulti chair on to 2552 m. Both are tagged as carrying bikes in OpenStreetMap (ways <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/37346966">37346966</a> and <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/42692591">42692591</a>); the Fleschen t-bar beside them does not. The 2022 six-seater carries bikes on holders. Day pass from 40 CHF.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from mid-June; closed from mid-October (typical window; check the operator and conditions).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-16:45<br/><small>Typical daily estimate; check the operator schedule.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Fiesch station</td><td>Postbus</td><td>~15 min</td></tr><tr><td>Brig</td><td>Train + bus</td><td>~1h00</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.bikeparkbellwald.com/trails">Bike Park Bellwald</a>.
    Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-blue</styleUrl>
    <Point><coordinates>8.161785,46.428973,1624</coordinates></Point>
    <ExtendedData xmlns:mwm="https://comaps.app">
      <mwm:properties>
        <mwm:value key="spot">bellwald</mwm:value>
        <mwm:value key="tags">beginner expert bike-park dh freeride rain-resilient chairlift</mwm:value>
        <mwm:value key="open_from">05-20</mwm:value>
        <mwm:value key="closed_from">10-26</mwm:value>
        <mwm:value key="price_day">40 CHF</mwm:value>
      </mwm:properties>
      <mwm:icon>Mountain</mwm:icon>
      <mwm:visibility>1</mwm:visibility>
    </ExtendedData>
  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Bellwald: top of the Richinen chairlift</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Richinen 2077 m - top of the Richinen chairlift</b><br/><br/>
    Where the park's descents start, and the transfer point for the Furggulti chair. See the main Bellwald pin for trails, prices and access. Measured at the upper station of OSM <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/37346966">way 37346966</a>.]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-gray</styleUrl>
    <Point><coordinates>8.166794,46.441362,2077</coordinates></Point>
