  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Bellwald: top of the Furggulti chairlift</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Furggulti 2552 m - top of the Furggulti chairlift</b><br/><br/>
    The high point of the lift-served terrain, reached by the second chair from Richinen. See the main Bellwald pin for trails, prices and access. Measured at the upper station of OSM <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/42692591">way 42692591</a>.]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-gray</styleUrl>
