  <Placemark>
    <name>Ravin du Rank: Col de la Madone > Gorbio</name>
    <description><![CDATA[2.7 km descent from the Col de la Madone toward Gorbio, dropping 554 m. Graded T5 / E2 and the one that tests your nerves: loose limestone, stone steps and exposed sections, hyper-rough and narrow, ridden downhill only. Scout the step sections before committing. <i>Source: <a href="https://vttour.fr/sentiers/83">VTTour sentier 83</a> (T5/E2).</i>]]></description>
