  <Placemark>
    <name>Sauze d'Oulx Bike Park (Alpi Bike Resort) [lift pass]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Sportinia chairlift to Rocce Nere 2420 m</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>More than 1000 m of descent through alpine meadows and larch forest, with long flowing blue and red trails, technical black DH and natural enduro links through the wider Alpi Bike Resort.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The Sportinia chairlift carries bikes from Piazzale Prariond; Rocce Nere extends the park to 2420 m in August. The Vialattea day pass is 30 EUR in summer 2026.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 27 June; closed from 30 August (published 2026 dates).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:30-17:00<br/><small>Rocce Nere operates only from 01 to 23 August; check live lift and trail status.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Turin</td><td>Train + bus / car</td><td>~1h30</td></tr><tr><td>Oulx station</td><td>Bus</td><td>~15 min</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://sauzedoulx.net/en/summer/freeride/">Sauze d'Oulx</a>. Verify prices and lift status.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-blue</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>6.858346,45.027027,1515</coordinates></Point>
    <ExtendedData xmlns:mwm="https://comaps.app"><mwm:properties><mwm:value key="spot">sauze-doulx</mwm:value><mwm:value key="tags">beginner expert bike-park dh enduro freeride season-pass chairlift</mwm:value><mwm:value key="price_day">30 EUR</mwm:value><mwm:value key="open_from">06-27</mwm:value><mwm:value key="closed_from">08-30</mwm:value></mwm:properties><mwm:icon>Mountain</mwm:icon><mwm:visibility>1</mwm:visibility></ExtendedData>
  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Bike Park Tajare (Valle Stura) [free, no lift]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Yeti Trail 975 m - start of a representative enduro descent</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A free, volunteer-run eco bike park across Gaiola, Valloriate, Moiola, Rittana and Roccasparvera. Nine signed routes cover about 150 km of XC, all-mountain and enduro terrain; Yeti and the newer gravity trails add compact, purpose-built descending to the larger pedal network.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>No lift and no trail fee. The network is pedal-accessed, with route bases and information boards around Gaiola and the other villages; occasional paid shuttle events are announced by the association.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Rideable year-round without snow. Some trails close temporarily for forestry, chestnut harvest or maintenance, so check the operator news before travelling.<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Cuneo</td><td>Car</td><td>~25 min</td></tr><tr><td>Gaiola</td><td>Bike</td><td>Pedal access</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://tajare.it/">Bike Park Tajare</a> and its official route information; location and line cross-checked against the OSM-mapped Yeti Trail relation and trailhead. The trace is indicative and does not replace the signed route.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-brown</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>7.416849,44.358889,974</coordinates></Point>
    <ExtendedData xmlns:mwm="https://comaps.app"><mwm:properties><mwm:value key="spot">bike-park-tajare</mwm:value><mwm:value key="tags">beginner expert bike-park no-lift enduro</mwm:value></mwm:properties><mwm:icon>Mountain</mwm:icon><mwm:visibility>1</mwm:visibility></ExtendedData>
  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Bike Park Tajare: Yeti Trail</name>
    <description><![CDATA[1.2 km enduro descent. Geometry simplified from OpenStreetMap relation 12892820; check the official Bike Park Tajare site for current access and follow signs on the ground. <i>Sources: <a href="https://tajare.it/">Bike Park Tajare</a> and <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/relation/12892820">OSM relation 12892820</a>.</i>]]></description>
