  <Placemark>
    <name>Montemale Bike Park (Cuneo) [free, no lift]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>PS Enduro del Diau 1165 m - start of a signed descent</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A year-round, snow-permitting pedal bike park built around the signed Muntuben a Muntumal loops. The main Chamin Classic is about 30.6 km and 1100 m climbing, with harder red extensions; the Caluben gravity project adds six enduro and DH descents, and a short green family loop circles Montemale.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>No lift and no trail fee. Climb by bike from Montemale and use the permanent colour-coded signs.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Rideable year-round without snow; check the organizer's updates around events and maintenance.<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Cuneo</td><td>Car</td><td>~30 min</td></tr><tr><td>Montemale</td><td>Bike</td><td>Pedal access</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://www.muntubenamuntumal.it/idea.html">Montemale Bike Park project</a> and <a href="https://www.muntubenamuntumal.it/muntuben.html">official routes and GPX downloads</a>. Pin and representative descent are from the OSM-mapped PS Enduro del DIAU way, elevation checked at 1167 m.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-brown</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>7.346467,44.436098,1167</coordinates></Point>
    <ExtendedData xmlns:mwm="https://comaps.app"><mwm:properties><mwm:value key="spot">montemale-bike-park</mwm:value><mwm:value key="tags">beginner expert bike-park no-lift enduro dh</mwm:value></mwm:properties><mwm:icon>Mountain</mwm:icon><mwm:visibility>1</mwm:visibility></ExtendedData>
  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Montemale Bike Park: PS Enduro del Diau</name>
    <description><![CDATA[0.9 km advanced enduro special stage, dropping from about 1165 m toward Montemale. Geometry simplified from OpenStreetMap way 1073098839; indicative only, follow current park signs. <i>Sources: <a href="https://www.muntubenamuntumal.it/idea.html">Montemale Bike Park</a> and <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/1073098839">OSM way 1073098839</a>.</i>]]></description>
