  <Placemark>
    <name>Val d'Angrogna (Val Pellice) [no lift]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Sentiero Manfre 870 m - start of the Cuccia descent</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A broad natural MTB network between Torre Pellice, Angrogna and Colle della Vaccera. The terrain mixes old mule tracks, forest singletrack and rocky valley trails; the former Cuccia Trail, now mapped as Sentiero Manfre, gives a representative technical descent. These are shared, unpatrolled paths rather than a managed bike park.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>No lift or trail fee. Build pedal loops from Torre Pellice and Angrogna; the Colle della Vaccera and Alpe Sella access roads provide the main climbing spines.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Best in spring and autumn. Snow, leaf cover, forestry and wet roots can materially change conditions.<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Turin</td><td>Car / train + bike</td><td>~1h15</td></tr><tr><td>Torre Pellice</td><td>Bike</td><td>Pedal access</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://valpelliceoutdoor.it/attivita/mountain-bike/angrogna/">Val Pellice Outdoor - Angrogna MTB</a> and the OSM-mapped Sentiero Manfre. The line is a shared natural path, not an operator-sanctioned park trail.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-brown</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>7.257856,44.851444,872</coordinates></Point>
    <ExtendedData xmlns:mwm="https://comaps.app"><mwm:properties><mwm:value key="spot">val-angrogna</mwm:value><mwm:value key="tags">beginner expert natural no-lift enduro rain-sensitive</mwm:value></mwm:properties><mwm:icon>Mountain</mwm:icon><mwm:visibility>1</mwm:visibility></ExtendedData>
  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Val d'Angrogna: Sentiero Manfre (Cuccia Trail)</name>
    <description><![CDATA[2.5 km natural S2 descent, dropping from about 870 m to 600 m. Geometry simplified from OpenStreetMap way 919766625; indicative only and shared with walkers. <i>Sources: <a href="https://valpelliceoutdoor.it/attivita/mountain-bike/angrogna/">Val Pellice Outdoor</a> and <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/919766625">OSM way 919766625</a>.</i>]]></description>
