  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Elvo Natural Trail (Graglia) [no lift]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Graglia ridge 845 m - start of a representative natural descent</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A natural all-mountain and downhill area around Graglia, Sordevolo and the Elvo valley. Community mapping lists about 24 MTB trails and 2700 m of total descent: soil, roots, leaves and rock on existing paths that also appear on Province of Biella hiking maps. Spring, autumn and snow-free winter are the recommended windows.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>No lift or trail fee. Pedal or e-bike from the Santuario di Graglia parking area and nearby villages.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Natural shared trails with no patrol. Avoid periods of dense vegetation and poor visibility, yield to walkers and pastoral use, and check current community reports.<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Biella</td><td>Car</td><td>~20 min</td></tr><tr><td>Santuario di Graglia</td><td>Bike</td><td>Pedal access</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://www.trailforks.com/region/elvo-natural-trail/">Elvo Natural Trail community inventory</a> and <a href="https://www.atl.biella.it/en/mountain-bike">official Biellese MTB tourism information</a>. The line is an unnamed OSM S2 way in the Graglia trail cluster, included only as a representative trace.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-brown</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>7.945214,45.560193,846</coordinates></Point>
    <ExtendedData xmlns:mwm="https://comaps.app"><mwm:properties><mwm:value key="spot">elvo-natural-trail</mwm:value><mwm:value key="tags">beginner expert natural no-lift enduro rain-sensitive</mwm:value></mwm:properties><mwm:icon>Mountain</mwm:icon><mwm:visibility>1</mwm:visibility></ExtendedData>
  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Elvo Natural Trail: Graglia ridge descent</name>
    <description><![CDATA[1.2 km unnamed S2 natural path descending from about 845 m to 780 m. It is a representative OSM trace, not an official community trail geometry. Follow local signs and yield to walkers. <i>Sources: <a href="https://www.trailforks.com/region/elvo-natural-trail/">Elvo Natural Trail inventory</a> and <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/76437862">OSM way 76437862</a>.</i>]]></description>
