  <Placemark>
    <name>Prato Nevoso Bike Park (Piedmont) [lift pass]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Lift-served Maritime Alps bike park</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A major northwest Italian park with downhill, freeride and flow lines over open ski terrain and lower woods. Progression trails sit beside technical race tracks, jumps and fast machine-shaped berms.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Summer chairlifts carry bikes; check Prato Nevoso for current pricing.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 13 June; closed from 27 September (typical summer and weekend window).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/><small>Estimated hours; confirm open days and lift status.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Turin</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h45</td></tr><tr><td>Cuneo</td><td>Car</td><td>~50 min</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.pratonevoso.com/">Prato Nevoso</a>. Verify summer bike operations.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-blue</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>7.785589,44.255292,1540</coordinates></Point>
    <ExtendedData xmlns:mwm="https://comaps.app"><mwm:properties><mwm:value key="spot">prato-nevoso</mwm:value><mwm:value key="tags">beginner expert bike-park dh freeride chairlift</mwm:value><mwm:value key="open_from">06-13</mwm:value><mwm:value key="closed_from">09-27</mwm:value></mwm:properties><mwm:icon>Mountain</mwm:icon><mwm:visibility>1</mwm:visibility></ExtendedData>
  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Caldirola Bike Park (Piedmont Apennines) [lift pass]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Compact chairlift park on Monte Gropà</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A cult northern-Apennine gravity hill with fast repeated laps, roots, loam, rock, old-school downhill and shaped freeride features. Small vertical is offset by technical density and a long operating season.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The chairlift carries bikes; check Caldirola Bike for current tickets and opening days.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 01 March; closed from 01 December (typical weekend season).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/><small>Estimated hours; the park operates on selected days.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Genoa</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h30</td></tr><tr><td>Milan</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h45</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.seggioviacaldirola.it/caldirock-bike-park/">Seggiovia di Caldirola - Caldirock Bike Park</a>. Check its calendar before travel.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-blue</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>9.150383,44.728194,999</coordinates></Point>
    <ExtendedData xmlns:mwm="https://comaps.app"><mwm:properties><mwm:value key="spot">caldirola</mwm:value><mwm:value key="tags">expert bike-park dh freeride chairlift</mwm:value><mwm:value key="open_from">03-01</mwm:value><mwm:value key="closed_from">12-01</mwm:value></mwm:properties><mwm:icon>Mountain</mwm:icon><mwm:visibility>1</mwm:visibility></ExtendedData>
  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Abetone Gravity Park (Tuscany) [lift pass]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Lift-served gravity in the Tuscan Apennines</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A central-Italian reference with downhill race lines, roots, rock, flow and jump features through high beech and conifer forest. It offers beginner progression but is best known for technical expert riding.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Summer lifts carry bikes; check the park for current passes and open sectors.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 06 June; closed from 04 October (typical weekend/holiday season).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/><small>Estimated hours; check the operating calendar.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Florence</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h45</td></tr><tr><td>Lucca</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h20</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.abetonegravitypark.it/">Abetone Gravity Park</a>. Verify current operations.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-blue</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>10.664464,44.144500,1388</coordinates></Point>
    <ExtendedData xmlns:mwm="https://comaps.app"><mwm:properties><mwm:value key="spot">abetone</mwm:value><mwm:value key="tags">beginner expert bike-park dh freeride gondola</mwm:value><mwm:value key="open_from">06-06</mwm:value><mwm:value key="closed_from">10-04</mwm:value></mwm:properties><mwm:icon>Mountain</mwm:icon><mwm:visibility>1</mwm:visibility></ExtendedData>
  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Abetone Gravity Park: Pista Blu</name>
    <description><![CDATA[1.5 km red trail, dropping 251 m from 1722 m to 1471 m at an average 17%. Geometry simplified from OpenStreetMap - indicative only, follow the signs on the ground. <i>Source: <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/289696022">way 289696022</a>, <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/326134830">way 326134830</a>.</i>]]></description>
