  <Placemark>
    <name>Pralognan-la-Vanoise Bike Park (Vanoise) [15 EUR]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Pralognan 1420 m - valley station of the Mont Bochor cable car</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A small, genuinely alpine spot at the gateway to the Vanoise national park rather than a big park. Two marked downhill runs drop off the Mont Bochor plateau back to the village, and the Genepi chairlift adds the DH du Genepi and the Piste des Flottes on the far side of the valley. Everything above is national-park core where bikes are banned, so the riding is the forested 600 m between 2000 m and the village.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The Mont Bochor cable car takes bikes and reaches 1980 m in three minutes; the Genepi chairlift serves the second sector. A return on one lift is 15.00 EUR adult, 13.50 EUR reduced.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 06 June (Wednesdays, Saturdays and Sundays only), daily from 27 June; closed from 30 August.<br/>Daily opening hours: 08:15-12:45 and 13:30-17:10<br/><small>2026 published cable car calendar; verify before travelling.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Moutiers</td><td>Bus / car</td><td>~45 min</td></tr><tr><td>Chambery</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h35</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.pralognan.com/remontees-mecaniques-ete/">Pralognan official tourism - summer lifts</a>. Verify prices, lift and trail status.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-blue</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>6.722260,45.380760,1416</coordinates></Point>
    <ExtendedData xmlns:mwm="https://comaps.app"><mwm:properties><mwm:value key="spot">pralognan</mwm:value><mwm:value key="tags">intermediate expert bike-park dh enduro chairlift cable-car</mwm:value><mwm:value key="open_from">06-06</mwm:value><mwm:value key="closed_from">08-30</mwm:value></mwm:properties><mwm:icon>Mountain</mwm:icon><mwm:visibility>1</mwm:visibility></ExtendedData>
  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Pralognan: Mont Bochor cable car top</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Top of the Mont Bochor cable car at 1980 m, the start of the descents back to the village. The resort quotes 2010 m for the viewpoint just above.]]></description>
