  <Placemark>
    <name>Bike Park Valloire Galibier (Maurienne) [20 EUR]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Valloire 1410 m - valley station of the Cret de la Brive gondola</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Ten graded downhill runs plus five routes laid out for e-MTB, spread over the Cret de la Brive and Crey du Quart flanks above the village. The shaped runs carry berms, jump zones and technical sections; the network reaches over 30 km of purpose-built trail and links along the ridge toward Valmeinier. Rental, repair and a wash station sit at the gondola base.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Three lifts run in summer: the Cret de la Brive gondola from the village and two chairlifts on the Crey du Quart side. Single ride 12 EUR, day pass 20 EUR, season 190 EUR.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 27 June; closed from 13 September (late June to mid-September).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:30-17:00<br/><small>Estimated standard hours; check the published lift calendar.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Saint-Michel-de-Maurienne</td><td>Bus / car</td><td>~25 min</td></tr><tr><td>Chambery</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h30</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.valloire.net/en/profiter-de-valloire/activites-outdoor/le-velo/bike-park-en-savoie-a-valloire/">Valloire official tourism - bike park</a>. Verify prices, lift and trail status.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-blue</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>6.430910,45.164820,1408</coordinates></Point>
    <ExtendedData xmlns:mwm="https://comaps.app"><mwm:properties><mwm:value key="spot">valloire</mwm:value><mwm:value key="tags">beginner expert bike-park dh enduro freeride chairlift gondola</mwm:value><mwm:value key="open_from">06-27</mwm:value><mwm:value key="closed_from">09-13</mwm:value></mwm:properties><mwm:icon>Mountain</mwm:icon><mwm:visibility>1</mwm:visibility></ExtendedData>
  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Valloire: Cret de la Brive gondola top</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Top of the Cret de la Brive gondola at 2100 m, the main entry point into the Valloire Galibier bike park.]]></description>
