  <Placemark>
    <name>Valfrejus (Maurienne) [lift pass]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Valfrejus 1560 m - valley station of the Arrondaz gondola</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Not a shaped bike park but a set of marked enduro descents through dense forest, which is what the station is good at: Easy Rider as the blue introduction, La Valdingue and La Dejantee in red, and La Diabolique as the black. The Arrondaz gondola opens the long lines from 2220 m; the Charmasson chairlift serves the short lower laps.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>A pass covers the Arrondaz gondola and the Charmasson chairlift on their operating days; the two do not always run together, so check which is turning before buying.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 04 July; closed from 30 August (typical summer lift window).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:30-17:00<br/><small>Estimated standard hours; the station publishes operating days rather than a fixed calendar.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Modane</td><td>Bus / car</td><td>~15 min</td></tr><tr><td>Chambery</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h40</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://guide-ski.fr/valfrejus-ete-2026/">Valfrejus summer 2026 guide</a>. Verify prices, lift and trail status.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-blue</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>6.652290,45.172610,1560</coordinates></Point>
    <ExtendedData xmlns:mwm="https://comaps.app"><mwm:properties><mwm:value key="spot">valfrejus</mwm:value><mwm:value key="tags">beginner expert natural enduro dh chairlift gondola</mwm:value><mwm:value key="open_from">07-04</mwm:value><mwm:value key="closed_from">08-30</mwm:value></mwm:properties><mwm:icon>Mountain</mwm:icon><mwm:visibility>1</mwm:visibility></ExtendedData>
  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Valfrejus: Arrondaz gondola top</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Top of the Arrondaz gondola at 2220 m, the start of the long forest descents to the resort.]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-gray</styleUrl>
