  <Placemark>
    <name>La Norma Bike Park (Maurienne) [13 EUR]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>La Norma 1360 m - valley station of the Melezet gondola</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A car-free resort with a well-signed set of coloured enduro descents through the forest - Le Grand Canyon, La Sapinette, La Viperine, Les sangliers and La Bichon in red, L'avalanche in blue - plus two small bike parks, one by the lake and one in the La Repose sector, and the free Practice Park des Marmottons for skills and balance modules.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The Melezet gondola carries bikes and pedestrians; single ride 9.50 EUR, day pass 13 EUR, sold at the Maison de La Norma. The Practice Park is free and needs no lift.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 05 July; closed from 27 August (gondola runs Sunday to Thursday; the Practice Park is open 15 June to 31 October).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:40-12:15 and 13:45-16:30<br/><small>2026 published gondola calendar; closed Friday and Saturday.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Modane</td><td>Bus / car</td><td>~15 min</td></tr><tr><td>Chambery</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h40</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.la-norma.fr/en/les-activites-et-loisirs/l-ete-a-la-norma/velo-et-vtt/">La Norma official tourism - cycling and mountain biking</a>. Verify prices, lift and trail status.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-blue</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>6.696710,45.200350,1360</coordinates></Point>
    <ExtendedData xmlns:mwm="https://comaps.app"><mwm:properties><mwm:value key="spot">la-norma</mwm:value><mwm:value key="tags">beginner intermediate bike-park enduro dh gondola</mwm:value><mwm:value key="open_from">07-05</mwm:value><mwm:value key="closed_from">08-27</mwm:value></mwm:properties><mwm:icon>Mountain</mwm:icon><mwm:visibility>1</mwm:visibility></ExtendedData>
  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>La Norma: Melezet gondola top</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Top of the Melezet gondola at 1990 m, the entry point for the forest descents back to the resort.]]></description>
