  <Placemark>
    <name>Areches-Beaufort Bike Park (Beaufortain) [18 EUR]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Areches 1020 m - base of the Grand Mont chairlift</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>An FFC-certified site in the Beaufortain rather than a lift-fed park: the graded network runs to 2 blue, 2 red and 4 black enduro courses on top of a large cross-country layout, and the Bleue Arechoise and Quefinette lines are the ones ridden for speed. The lift is a bonus here, not the point - most of the riding is pedalled.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The Grand Mont chairlift lifts bikes from the village to 1710 m but runs only two to three days a week in summer, so check the calendar before planning a lift day. One lift 9 EUR, day pass 18 EUR, season 75-100 EUR.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 04 July; closed from 30 August (chairlift; the marked network rides from snowmelt to autumn).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:30-17:00<br/><small>Two to three operating days a week - the published weekly calendar is what matters, not the season dates.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Albertville</td><td>Bus / car</td><td>~40 min</td></tr><tr><td>Chambery</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h25</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://en.areches-beaufort.com/a-faire/vtt-cyclo/">Areches-Beaufort official tourism - mountain biking</a>. Verify prices, lift days and trail status.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-blue</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>6.565900,45.685290,1023</coordinates></Point>
