  <Placemark>
    <name>Megeve Bike Park (Evasion Mont-Blanc) [23 EUR]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Megeve 1150 m - valley station of the Rochebrune cable car</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Two lift-served sectors face each other across the village: Rochebrune and Mont d'Arbois on one side, Le Jaillet and the Christomet ridge on the other, with a kids' progression area at the top of the Jaillet gondola. The riding is more marked enduro and long descent than shaped park, and it plugs straight into the Portes du Mont-Blanc and Evasion Mont-Blanc networks, so lines continue into Combloux, La Giettaz and over the Mont d'Arbois shoulder to Saint-Gervais.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Four lifts run in summer and take bikes: the Rochebrune cable car, the Mont d'Arbois and Jaillet gondolas and the Petite Fontaine chairlift. The Evasion day pass is 23 EUR adult (20.50 EUR child) and covers Megeve, Saint-Gervais, Combloux, La Giettaz and Les Contamines; season 230 EUR. A single Megeve lift is 11 EUR one way, 20.30 EUR return.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 20 June; closed from 06 September (Mont d'Arbois gondola is the longest window; Rochebrune runs 04 July to 06 September, Jaillet 04 July to 30 August).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:45<br/><small>2026 published lift calendar; hours vary by lift.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Sallanches</td><td>Bus / car</td><td>~25 min</td></tr><tr><td>Geneva</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h15</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://forfait.megeve.com/ete/en/summer-pass/">Megeve summer lift passes</a>. Verify prices, lift and trail status.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-blue</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>6.615080,45.849810,1152</coordinates></Point>
