  <Placemark>
    <name>Saint-Gervais Mont-Blanc Bike Park [23 EUR]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Saint-Gervais 810 m - valley station of the Alpin gondola</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>The lowest base in the Mont-Blanc valley, which buys an unusually long vertical: the Alpin gondola climbs to Le Bettex at 1400 m and the Bettex-Arbois gondola continues to 1830 m, so a full descent is a kilometre of drop back to the village. La Wizz is the blue at the top of the Mont d'Arbois gondola, with berms, jumps and boardwalks across the peat bogs; the enduro lines run higher toward Mont Joly, facing Mont Blanc the whole way. Le Valleen gondola links down to Le Fayet at 580 m.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Alpin gondola 10.50 EUR one way, 14.50 EUR return; the Evasion day pass at 23 EUR adult (20.50 EUR child) covers Saint-Gervais, Megeve, Combloux, La Giettaz and Les Contamines, season 230 EUR. Over-80s ride the Saint-Gervais lifts free.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 26 June; closed from 30 August (gondolas run daily in that window).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:30<br/><small>2026 published calendar; the marked trails themselves are signed from late spring to October.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Le Fayet (train)</td><td>Gondola / bus</td><td>~15 min</td></tr><tr><td>Geneva</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h10</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://ete.ski-saintgervais.com/fr/e2-tarifs-ete">Saint-Gervais / Evasion Mont-Blanc summer tariffs</a>. Verify prices, lift and trail status.</i>]]></description>
