  <Placemark>
    <name>Chartreuse Bike Park (Saint-Pierre-de-Chartreuse) [lift pass]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Saint-Pierre-de-Chartreuse 1360 m - base of the Scia chairlift</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Five downhill trails and four enduro itineraries off a single chairlift, graded green through black, in the limestone Chartreuse massif half an hour from Grenoble. Two blue lines run from La Scia down to the Combe de l'Ours. Access is not uniform: the Avatar trail from Les Essarts to the village is open to all, while Alderaan from La Scia to Les Essarts is guided-only and the red and black lines are restricted - check at the resort before riding.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The Scia chairlift takes bikes to 1680 m and is the only uplift; the operator does not publish a summer MTB tariff online.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 04 July; closed from 30 August (typical summer chairlift window).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:30-17:00<br/><small>Estimated; the resort publishes operating days rather than a fixed season.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Grenoble</td><td>Bus / car</td><td>~40 min</td></tr><tr><td>Chambery</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h00</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.chartreuse-tourisme.com/en/offers/domaine-chartreuse-bike-park-saint-pierre-de-chartreuse-en-2715471/">Chartreuse Tourisme - Chartreuse Bike Park</a>. Verify prices, access rules and trail status.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-blue</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>5.834500,45.345600,1356</coordinates></Point>
    <ExtendedData xmlns:mwm="https://comaps.app"><mwm:properties><mwm:value key="spot">chartreuse-bike-park</mwm:value><mwm:value key="tags">beginner expert bike-park dh enduro chairlift</mwm:value><mwm:value key="open_from">07-04</mwm:value><mwm:value key="closed_from">08-30</mwm:value></mwm:properties><mwm:icon>Mountain</mwm:icon><mwm:visibility>1</mwm:visibility></ExtendedData>
  </Placemark>
