  <Placemark>
    <name>Bikepark Lenggries - Brauneck (Bayern, DE) [30 EUR]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Lenggries 715 m - base of the bike park's own drag lift</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A compact, heavily built park at the foot of the Brauneck, 45 minutes from Munich and one of Bavaria's established gravity venues. Nine areas ride as different lines: the Bavarian A-Line with its steep berm, jumps and wooden features is the signature, alongside the 1.5 km DownDaHill-Ride over natural ground, Fun Ride with 22 turns, Flow Ride, and Big Ball Line with road gaps and big drops. The vertical is only about 120 m, so it is lap-count riding rather than long descents.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The park runs its own easyLOOP drag lift beside the Brauneck gondola valley station - the gondola itself is not used for bike carriage. Day ticket 30 EUR, four hours 25 EUR, two hours 20 EUR.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 01 May; closed from 31 October (weather dependent).<br/>Daily opening hours: 10:00-18:00<br/><small>Estimated; the park publishes operating days week by week.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Lenggries (railway station)</td><td>Walk / bus</td><td>~15 min</td></tr><tr><td>Munich</td><td>Train / car</td><td>~1h00</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://bikepark-lenggries.com/preise/">Bikepark Lenggries - prices</a>. Verify prices, opening days and trail status.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-blue</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>11.553530,47.676150,714</coordinates></Point>
