  <Placemark>
    <name>Val Cenis Bike Park (Haute Maurienne) [10 EUR]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Lanslevillard 1450 m - valley station of the Vieux Moulin gondola</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A quieter Maurienne alternative with 19 marked trails split between downhill runs, enduro itineraries and cross-country circuits, reaching the high-alpine ground above 2000 m. It suits mixed groups while retaining technical red and black terrain.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Only one lift opens in summer: the Vieux Moulin gondola, which carries bikes and walkers from Lanslevillard to 2090 m. Single ride 7.50 EUR, day pass 10 EUR; free under 5 and over 75.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 06 July; closed from 28 August (Monday to Thursday and Sunday only - the gondola does not run Friday or Saturday).<br/>Daily opening hours: 10:00-16:30<br/><small>2026 published gondola calendar.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Modane</td><td>Bus / car</td><td>~30 min</td></tr><tr><td>Chambery</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h45</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.valcenis.com/en/les-activites-et-loisirs/l-ete-a-val-cenis/les-remontees-mecaniques/">Val Cenis - summer lifts</a>. Verify prices, lift and trail status.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-blue</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>6.904200,45.288260,1453</coordinates></Point>
