  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Gerardmer Bike Park (Vosges) [lift pass]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Lift-served forest gravity above Gerardmer</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A notable Vosges park complementing nearby La Bresse and Lac Blanc, with short repeated downhill laps, roots, rocks, berms and jump features in dense forest. The black terrain is especially technical when wet.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>A summer chairlift carries bikes; check the operator for current opening days and pricing.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 01 May; closed from 02 November (typical weekend/holiday season).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:30-17:00<br/><small>Estimated standard hours; the park is not necessarily open daily.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Epinal</td><td>Car</td><td>~45 min</td></tr><tr><td>Colmar</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h05</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://gerardmer-ski.com/">Gerardmer ski area</a>. Verify current summer bike operations before travel.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-blue</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>6.907222,48.053056,1011</coordinates></Point>
    <ExtendedData xmlns:mwm="https://comaps.app"><mwm:properties><mwm:value key="spot">gerardmer</mwm:value><mwm:value key="tags">beginner expert bike-park dh freeride chairlift</mwm:value><mwm:value key="open_from">05-01</mwm:value><mwm:value key="closed_from">11-02</mwm:value></mwm:properties><mwm:icon>Mountain</mwm:icon><mwm:visibility>1</mwm:visibility></ExtendedData>
  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Ax 3 Domaines Bike Park (Ariege Pyrenees) [lift pass]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Lift-served Pyrenean park above Ax-les-Thermes</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Long mountain descents combine bike-park shaping with natural Pyrenean roots, rock and forest. Green and blue routes support progression while the hard DH and enduro lines use the resort's substantial vertical.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Summer lifts carry bikes from the Bonascre plateau; check Ax for current tariffs.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 04 July; closed from 30 August (typical main season).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/><small>Estimated standard hours; verify the published operating calendar.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Toulouse</td><td>Train + gondola / car</td><td>~2h00</td></tr><tr><td>Ax-les-Thermes</td><td>Gondola</td><td>~10 min</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.ax.ski/">Ax 3 Domaines</a>. Verify summer bike access and lift status.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-blue</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>1.815209,42.700577,1379</coordinates></Point>
