  <Placemark>
    <name>The Mother Bikepark Winterberg: Shreddy Mörphy</name>
    <description><![CDATA[0.5 km blue trail, dropping 36 m from 759 m to 723 m at an average 7%. Geometry simplified from OpenStreetMap - indicative only, follow the signs on the ground. <i>Source: <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/1436909800">way 1436909800</a>.</i>]]></description>
