  <Placemark>
    <name>MTB Zone Bikepark Geisskopf (Bavaria, Germany) [46 EUR]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Geisskopf chairlift - Bavarian Forest gravity classic</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>16 lines totalling around 20 km, from perfectly shaped flow to technical enduro and a classic downhill track. The Flow Country Trail is the easy one and genuinely rideable by beginners and families; Evil Eye 1.0 and 2.0 add the wooden features; there are dedicated jump trails and a slopestyle area. The park does not publish a blue/red/black split - grades are marked at the trailheads.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The Geisskopf chairlift carries bikes. Adult day pass 46 EUR; season pass 418 EUR. An uphill-flow ticket is available for riders climbing by e-bike.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 01 April; closed from 09 November (typical 2026 operating window; consult the day calendar).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-16:45; last ascent 16:30<br/><small>Published operating hours; some shoulder-season weekdays are closed.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Regensburg</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h15</td></tr><tr><td>Munich</td><td>Car</td><td>~2h00</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://mtbzone-bikepark.com/geisskopf/">MTB Zone Geisskopf</a>, its <a href="https://mtbzone-bikepark.com/en/geisskopf/tickets">tickets</a> and <a href="https://mtbzone-bikepark.com/geisskopf/oeffnungszeiten">calendar</a>. Verify live status.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-blue</styleUrl>
