  <Placemark>
    <name>Bikepark Hahnenklee (Harz, Germany) [30.90 EUR]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Bocksberg chairlift - varied Harz gravity trails</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Seven named lines plus a practice loop off the 726 m Bocksberg: Boeckchen and Wilder Drache are the singletracks, Bock auf Wurzeln is the rooty enduro, Wilder Fuchs, Wilder Keiler and Wilder Bock cover downhill and enduro, and Sprung Bock is the jump line. That runs the whole span from a beginner flow trail to advanced jumps, in a small park you can lap all day.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The Bocksberg chairlift carries bikes. Adult day ticket including lift and trails 30.90 EUR; a trails-only annual pass costs 180 EUR for riders climbing independently.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 28 March; closed from 02 November (typical 2026 window).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/><small>Published standard hours; check lift status and seasonal calendar.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Hanover</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h15</td></tr><tr><td>Goslar</td><td>Bus / car</td><td>~20 min</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://bikepark-hahnenklee.de/">Bikepark Hahnenklee</a> and <a href="https://www.erlebnisbocksberg.de/sommersaison/bikepark-bikeshop/">ErlebnisBocksBerg</a>. Verify current operations.</i>]]></description>
