  <Placemark>
    <name>Knuckles Mountain Range - Riverston (Sri Lanka) [guided, no lift]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Highland adventure riding around Riverston Pass</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Long guided cross-country and enduro-style days combine steep backroads, estate tracks and permitted paths around Riverston and the edge of the Knuckles range. Expect mist, exposed viewpoints, rough surfaces and a large amount of climbing rather than a signed gravity park.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>No lift. Tours commonly use vehicle support but the riding itself includes substantial pedalling. This is a protected World Heritage landscape: do not assume hiking-only paths permit bicycles, use a knowledgeable local guide, and confirm the exact route and conservation access before riding.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 1 December; closed from 1 May (typical drier riding window; rain is possible year-round).<br/>Daily opening hours: daylight hours<br/><small>Access is route-dependent; confirm permissions, weather and guide arrangements locally.</small><br/><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://slvoyo.com/one-day-tour/knuckles-mountain-bike-adventure/">SL Voyo mountain-bike tour</a>, <a href="https://tourism.cp.gov.lk/en/destination/knuckles-range">Central Province Tourism</a> and <a href="https://travelriverston.lk/activities/">Riverston activities</a>. Conditions and permitted access can change.</i>]]></description>
