    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The Scuol gondola carries bikes, as do the Ftan and Naluns chairlifts. The operator publishes its summer tariff on bergbahnen-scuol.ch; we could not confirm a 2026 bike day rate, so check before you go.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 15 June; closed from 19 October (typical window; check the operator and conditions).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/><small>Typical daily estimate; check the operator schedule.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Zurich</td><td>Train</td><td>~3h00</td></tr><tr><td>Landeck</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h00</td></tr></table><br/><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.engadin.com/en/bike">Engadin Scuol</a>.
    Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
