  <Placemark>
    <name>Engelberg: Hells Bells Trail</name>
    <description><![CDATA[1.6 km red, difficult trail at Engelberg, dropping 259 m from 2208 m to 1950 m at an average 17%. <i>Trace drawn in gpx.studio and supplied for this map, simplified to ~8 m - indicative only; the signs on the ground are the authority.</i>]]></description>
