  <Placemark>
    <name>Braunwald: Seblengrat</name>
    <description><![CDATA[2.6 km black trail, dropping 135 m from 1894 m to 1759 m at an average 5%. A high ridge traverse east from the top of the Gumenbahn to Seblengrat. It loses very little height over 2.6 km, so the grade here comes from the rocky, exposed alpine surface rather than the gradient. Geometry drawn in gpx.studio and supplied for this map, simplified to approximately 8 m - indicative only; follow the signs on the ground.]]></description>
