  <Placemark>
    <name>Braunwald: Rotberg</name>
    <description><![CDATA[3.4 km red trail, dropping 501 m from 1838 m to 1337 m at an average 15%. The longest line here at 3.4 km, running the full height of the Rotberg flank from the Seblengrat side down towards Grotzenbuel. The signed grade is unconfirmed; red is inferred from its profile, which matches the other red lines at this spot. Geometry drawn in gpx.studio and supplied for this map, simplified to approximately 8 m - indicative only; follow the signs on the ground.]]></description>
