  <Placemark>
    <name>Braunwald: Brächalp</name>
    <description><![CDATA[1.8 km black trail, dropping 317 m from 1609 m to 1292 m at an average 17%. A steep descent on the western side above the village, from the Brachalp pastures down towards Braunwald. Geometry drawn in gpx.studio and supplied for this map, simplified to approximately 8 m - indicative only; follow the signs on the ground.]]></description>
