  <Placemark>
    <name>Flumserberg - BikerBerg (St. Gallen) [35 CHF]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Tannenboden 1225 m - valley station of the Prodalp-Express</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>13 km of easy and intermediate BikerTrails above the Walensee, which makes this the friendliest gravity day within an hour of Zurich. BlueSalamander drops from Prodalp, and Red Fox and Red Rock come off the Prodkamm chairlift higher up. Nothing here is trying to frighten you; it is a place to build confidence with a lake view.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The 12-seat Prodalp-Express gondola from Tannenheim, plus the Prodkamm chairlift. Biker day ticket 35 CHF, including both lifts and the trails.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 23 May; closed from 26 October (typical window; check the operator and conditions).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/><small>Typical daily estimate; check the operator schedule.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Zurich</td><td>Train + bus</td><td>~1h30</td></tr><tr><td>Zurich</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h00</td></tr></table><br/><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.flumserberg.ch/en">Flumserberg</a>.
    Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
