    <name>Flumserberg: Prodalp-Express top (1575 m)</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Prodalp 1575 m - top of the Prodalp-Express</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>13 km of easy and intermediate BikerTrails above the Walensee, which makes this the friendliest gravity day within an hour of Zurich. BlueSalamander drops from Prodalp, and Red Fox and Red Rock come off the Prodkamm chairlift higher up. Nothing here is trying to frighten you; it is a place to build confidence with a lake view.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The 12-seat Prodalp-Express gondola from Tannenheim, plus the Prodkamm chairlift. Biker day ticket 35 CHF, including both lifts and the trails.<br/><br/>
