  <Placemark>
    <name>Hoch-Ybrig (Schwyz) [38 CHF]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Weglosen 1035 m - valley station of the Weglosen 3S gondola</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A 100+ km network of shared mountain paths and natural singletrack across two valleys in the Schwyz Prealps. Trails are well-developed alpine ways rather than dedicated MTB routes, with the Sternen and Spirstock chairlifts adding higher access. This is a scenic trail-riding destination with good lift infrastructure, not a built bike park.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The 3S gondola from Weglosen to Seebli, plus chairlifts to Sternen and Spirstock. Summer day pass 38 CHF adult, 10 CHF child (6-16). Bike transport is included or free; no dedicated bike surcharge published.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 4 July; closed from 18 October (expected 2026 summer window).<br/>Daily opening hours: 08:30-17:00<br/><small>Published summer lift window estimate; verify the operator timetable.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Zurich</td><td>Car</td><td>~55 min</td></tr><tr><td>Winterthur</td><td>Car</td><td>~55 min</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.hoch-ybrig.ch/en/summer/adventures/mountain-biking">Hoch-Ybrig</a>.
    Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
