    <name>La Clusaz: Enduro des Tetras</name>
    <description><![CDATA[1.6 km. A moderate natural enduro line suited to riders beginning on roots, turns and forest singletrack. <i>Source and geometry: <a href="https://www.laclusaz.com/details/enduro-des-tetras-piste-vtt-enduro-n47/">official trail page</a>.</i>]]></description>
