    <description><![CDATA[<b>Samoens 1600 - top of the Grand Massif Express</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>The Grand Massif Express climbs almost 900 m out of the valley floor, which gives Samoens some of the longest continuous descents in Haute-Savoie. The bike park itself is moderate rather than extreme, but the pass covers Flaine, Les Carroz and Morillon too, so an enduro day linking four resorts is the real draw.<br/><br/>
