  <Placemark>
    <name>Tignes (Tarentaise, FR) [20 EUR]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Tignes le Lac 2090 m - base of the Toviere gondola</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>High-altitude riding at the top of the Tarentaise: the Tignes - Val d'Isere bike area counts 230 km of routes across downhill, enduro and cross-country, most of it above 2000 m and above the trees. Rocky, fast and exposed, with a short season to match. One of the cheapest big lift passes in the French Alps.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The Toviere gondola from Tignes le Lac at 2090 m, plus the Palafour and other summer lifts. Bike day pass 20 EUR, six days 80 EUR, season 160 EUR; lifts also included in the My Tignes activity card.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 4 July; closed from 30 August (published 2026 dates).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/><small>Typical daily estimate; check the operator schedule.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Lausanne</td><td>Car</td><td>~3h15</td></tr><tr><td>Chambery</td><td>Car</td><td>~2h15</td></tr></table><br/><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://en.tignes.net/">Tignes</a>.
    Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
