  <Placemark>
    <name>Pohorje: Bolfenk Trail</name>
    <description><![CDATA[0.7 km red trail, dropping 185 m from 1038 m to 853 m at an average 28%. A red hand-built trail off the top of the cable car, running the upper Bolfenk slopes with natural corners and rooty sections. Geometry drawn in gpx.studio and supplied for this map, simplified to approximately 8 m - indicative only; follow the signs on the ground.]]></description>
