  <Placemark>
    <name>Pohorje: Fury Trail</name>
    <description><![CDATA[0.7 km black trail, dropping 228 m from 579 m to 351 m at an average 31%. The steep black lower line, adding natural corners, drops and off-camber roots on the last pitch above the valley station. Geometry drawn in gpx.studio and supplied for this map, simplified to approximately 8 m - indicative only; follow the signs on the ground.]]></description>
