    <name>Pohorje: Jump Line</name>
    <description><![CDATA[0.9 km red trail, dropping 204 m from 896 m to 692 m at an average 24%. The built jump line, a sequence of tables and berms on the middle section of the mountain. Geometry drawn in gpx.studio and supplied for this map, simplified to approximately 8 m - indicative only; follow the signs on the ground.]]></description>
