  <Placemark>
    <name>Pohorje: World Cup</name>
    <description><![CDATA[2.1 km black trail, dropping 438 m from 778 m to 340 m at an average 21%. The legendary black World Cup downhill course, raced at Maribor since 1999: roots, rock, speed and large jumps top to bottom. Geometry drawn in gpx.studio and supplied for this map, simplified to approximately 8 m - indicative only; follow the signs on the ground.]]></description>
