  <Placemark>
    <name>Dajti Mountain Enduro: top of the Dajti Ekspres</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Fusha e Dajtit 1035 m - top of the Dajti Ekspres gondola</b><br/><br/>
    The plateau where the descents toward Tirana start. See the main Dajti Mountain Enduro pin for trails, prices and access. Measured at the gondola's upper station (OSM <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/103710384">way 103710384</a>).]]></description>
