  <Placemark>
    <name>Peyragudes-Loudenvielle: top of the Skyvall gondola</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Skyvall top 1601 m - Peyresourde village and the trail hub</b><br/><br/>
    Where the gondola from Loudenvielle unloads. The Privilege chairlift continues from here to 2228 m for the high trail starts. See the main Peyragudes-Loudenvielle Bike Park pin for trails, prices and access.]]></description>
