  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Peyragudes-Loudenvielle: top of the Privilege chairlift</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Privilege top 2228 m - highest lift-served trail start</b><br/><br/>
    Top of the Privilege chairlift, where the black and World Cup lines and L'integrale begin. Runs on selected days only. See the main Peyragudes-Loudenvielle Bike Park pin for trails, prices and access.]]></description>
