  <Placemark>
    <name>Sierra Nevada: Circuito Fuente Alta</name>
    <description><![CDATA[7.6 km circuit in the forest below Pradollano, the bike park's one multi-use loop - the operator lists it as suitable for cross-country riders and walkers rather than as a gravity run. It is a closed loop around 1983-2151 m with no net descent. Geometry simplified from OpenStreetMap ways 204239360, 204239362, 204239383, 224640554, 224640560, 866466786, 954754676, 974404225, 974404226, 974404228, 974404230, 974404231, 974404232, 1481716052, 1481716053 to approximately 8 m - indicative only; follow the signs on the ground.]]></description>
