  <Placemark>
    <name>Trail Park Dolni Morava (CZ) [lift price unverified]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Slamnik sector above Dolni Morava - lift-served trail and enduro park</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A modern trail park with approachable blue flow lines, longer red descents and rougher enduro options. Machine-shaped berms and rollers make it friendly for progression, while roots, rock gardens and steeper natural sections provide worthwhile riding for experienced visitors.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The Sneznik chairlift carries bikes to the upper trail network. Day bike-pass prices are dynamically presented by the resort and were not reliably verified here; check the operator before visiting.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 8 May; closed from 1 November (typical 2026 summer and autumn lift window; reduced operation outside peak season).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/><small>Typical daily estimate; check the operator schedule.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Olomouc</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h45</td></tr><tr><td>Prague</td><td>Car</td><td>~3h00</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.dolnimorava.cz/single-trails">official Dolni Morava Trail Park page</a>; verify operating days.</i>]]></description>
