  <Placemark>
    <name>Vallée de Munster: Le Linge - top of the Mémorial</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Le Linge 971 m - start of the Mémorial enduro trail</b><br/><br/>
    Top of the permanent Mémorial trail on the Linge ridge above Hohrod, reached by road and forest track from Munster or Hohrodberg. See the main Vallée de Munster pin for trails, season and access.]]></description>
