    <name>Vallée de Munster: Hohrodberg - top of Fastrod</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Hohrodberg 702 m - start of Fastrod</b><br/><br/>
    Where Fastrod leaves the Hohrodberg road for the 308 m descent into Munster. See the main Vallée de Munster pin for trails, season and access.]]></description>
