  <Placemark>
    <name>Vallée de Munster: Le Grand Hohnack</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Le Grand Hohnack 968 m - top of the Stèle and DH Grand Hohnack</b><br/><br/>
    Summit of the Grand Hohnack on the northern ridge, about 7 km from Munster above Labaroche, where the Stèle and DH Grand Hohnack lines start. See the main Vallée de Munster pin for trails, season and access.]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-gray</styleUrl>
