  <Placemark>
    <name>Vallée de Munster: Croix de Wihr</name>
    <description><![CDATA[3.4 km blue, moderate route in the Munster valley, running from 975 m to 893 m over 128 m of descent and 45 m of climbing: it rides as the rolling ridge link from the Hohrodberg side across to the Croix de Wihr saddle rather than as a descent. <i>Trace drawn in gpx.studio and supplied for this map, simplified to ~8 m - indicative only. Natural forest singletrack shared with walkers on the 1914-18 Linge battlefield - ride sighted and stay on the trail.</i>]]></description>
