  <Placemark>
    <name>Vallée de Munster: DH Grand Hohnack</name>
    <description><![CDATA[0.5 km black, extremely difficult route in the Munster valley, dropping 150 m from 974 m to 824 m at an average 32%. <i>Trace drawn in gpx.studio and supplied for this map, simplified to ~8 m - indicative only. Natural forest singletrack shared with walkers on the 1914-18 Linge battlefield - ride sighted and stay on the trail.</i>]]></description>
