    <name>Vallée de Munster: Fastrod</name>
    <description><![CDATA[2.3 km blue, moderate route in the Munster valley, dropping 308 m from 702 m to 394 m at an average 14%. <i>Trace drawn in gpx.studio and supplied for this map, simplified to ~8 m - indicative only. Natural forest singletrack shared with walkers on the 1914-18 Linge battlefield - ride sighted and stay on the trail.</i>]]></description>
