  <Placemark>
    <name>La Bresse-Hohneck Bike Park (Vosges, FR) [31 EUR]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Vologne Express summit above La Bresse - rocky Vosges DH and freeride</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Ten maintained descents split between six technical DH tracks and four freeride lines. A green trail gives newcomers a route into the park, while the red and black lines are known for rough rock, roots, braking bumps and demanding race-style riding.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The Vologne Express chairlift carries bikes. The published 2026 adult day pass is 31 EUR; equipment rental and instruction are available at the resort.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 1 May; closed from 21 September (published 2026 dates). Daily operation runs from 4 July through 30 August, with a reduced schedule outside it.<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/><small>Typical daily estimate; check the operator schedule.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Colmar</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h00</td></tr><tr><td>Nancy</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h45</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://labresse.labellemontagne.com/fr/">official La Bresse Bike Park page</a>; check trail status.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-blue</styleUrl>
    <Point><coordinates>6.972643,48.037592,915</coordinates></Point>
