  <Placemark>
    <name>Mount Kinabalu Foothills Adventure MTB (Sabah, MY) [guided, no lift]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Kundasang 1,280 m - highland base beneath Mount Kinabalu</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Highland farm roads, village tracks and rainforest connectors in the Crocker Range foothills, ridden as guided adventure days out of Kundasang. Operators put the typical day at 16-20 km of off-road on gravel, rock, mud and technical sections, with a choice of long descents or steep climbs, and the village circuit through Kinandusan, Somuru and Pinausuk keeps Kinabalu in view the whole way. This is not a formal bike park, and Kinabalu Park's hiking trails must not be assumed legal for bicycles.<br/><small>Nothing is drawn here: an mtb-tag sweep of the Kundasang bbox returns zero features.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>No lift. Use a local cycling operator for the vehicle support, the permission and a legal route; do not enter protected footpaths without approval. Day trips from Kota Kinabalu include bike, guide, lunch and transfers.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Rideable year-round, with February-April usually drier. Tropical storms and mud can close or damage routes quickly.<br/>Daily opening hours: daylight hours<br/>
    <small>Highland altitude and heavy afternoon rain: start early.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access">
      <tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr>
      <tr><td>Kota Kinabalu</td><td>Guide vehicle</td><td>~2h</td></tr>
    </table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://www.bikeandtours.com/en/malaysia/sabah/borneo-west-sabah/mount-kinabalu/cycling-mount-kinabalu-foothill">Bike and Tours on the Kinabalu foothill ride</a> for the distances and terrain, <a href="https://www.sabahtravel.com/tour/3d2n-kundasang-cycling-tour-sea-to-summit-adventurer-pack">SabahTravel's Kundasang cycling tour</a>, and <a href="https://sabahtourism.com/">Sabah Tourism</a>. Pin moved onto the OSM <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/node/1611534575">Kundasang</a> town node (1611534575), measured at 1,282 m; the previous coordinate had a whole-number latitude of 6.0000. Confirm a permitted route with a Sabah operator and the protected-area authorities. Prices, schedules and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
