  <Placemark>
    <name>Bukit Timah MTB Trail (Singapore) [no lift, free]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Dairy Farm / Bukit Timah - Singapore's oldest technical MTB loop</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A 7 km intermediate-to-advanced designated circuit with fast descents, rock gardens, drops, blind corners and technical climbs. Twenty-three named sections and multiple exits allow riders to shorten the loop.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Free pedal access; no lift. Bicycles must remain on the designated MTB trail and riders should follow NParks nature-reserve rules.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open year-round when conditions allow. <br/>Daily opening hours: 07:00-19:00<br/><small>Typical nature-reserve hours estimate; check NParks notices.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Central Singapore</td><td>Metro/bus + bike</td><td>~40 min</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.nparks.gov.sg/visit/parks/bukit-timah-nature-reserve/activities/mountain-biking">Singapore NParks MTB guide</a>.</i>]]></description>
