  <Placemark>
    <name>Quanlin Daray Bike Park (Zhongshan, CN) [cable-car price unverified]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Sanxiang, Zhongshan - year-round south-China gravity park</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A compact purpose-built park with two blue lines, a black line and a large asphalt pump track across roughly 255 m of vertical. It is one of southern China's rare bike parks with cable-car uplift.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Cable-car bike uplift is documented, but current ticket prices and operating days were not verified.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Designed for year-round riding; heat, typhoons and heavy rain can close trails. <br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/><small>Typical daily estimate; check cable-car and trail operation.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Zhuhai</td><td>Car</td><td>~45 min</td></tr><tr><td>Guangzhou</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h45</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://www.biketo.com/news/39966.html">Biketo park report</a> and <a href="https://en.zsnews.cn/Culture/Attractions/content/384/37927.html">Zhongshan city portal</a>.</i>]]></description>
