  <Placemark>
    <name>Western Sichuan / Four Sisters MTB (CN) [guided, no lift]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Rilong (Siguniangshan town) 3,160 m - the acclimatisation base for the Four Sisters range</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Expedition riding on the Qionglai rim of the Tibetan plateau, not gravity laps. Rilong sits at 3,160 m where Xiaojin and Wenchuan counties meet, 205 km and about four hours west of Chengdu, and it is where every Mount Siguniang trip acclimatises - guest houses and hostels at every budget. The classic linked routes run Wolong - Rilong - Xiaojin - Danba - Bamei - Xinduqiao; Danba to Rilong is 100 km over the Balang Shan pass, Rilong to Wolong 90 km, Wolong to Dujiangyan 75 km. Long climbs, rough surfaces and serious altitude.<br/><small>Nothing is drawn here: an mtb-tag sweep of the Rilong bbox returns zero features. The riding is roads and jeep tracks, not mapped singletrack.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>No lift. Book a local guide and support vehicle; route permissions and foreign-traveller restrictions in the Tibetan prefectures change without notice.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 1 May; closed from 1 November. Best May-June and September-October - monsoon landslides, snow and altitude are the constraints.<br/>Daily opening hours: daylight hours<br/>
    <small>3,000-4,500 m throughout: acclimatise in Rilong before riding.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access">
      <tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr>
      <tr><td>Chengdu</td><td>Guide vehicle</td><td>~4h, 205 km</td></tr>
    </table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://www.chinaculturetour.com/sihuan/travel-itinerary/cycling.htm">Sichuan cycling itineraries</a> for the linked stages, the <a href="https://www.3rdpoletour.com/siguniangshan-travel-guide/rilong-town-travel-guide.html">Rilong town guide</a> for the 3,160 m base altitude, and <a href="https://www.bikechina.com/">Bike China</a>. Pin moved onto the OSM <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/node/1703112593">Siguniangshan (Rilong) town</a> node (1703112593), measured at 3,158 m; the previous coordinate was rounded to 102.85,31.0000 and its 3,488 m altitude matched no settlement. Prices, schedules and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
