  <Placemark>
    <name>Shenzhen Wutong Mountain MTB Trails: 非常梧桐</name>
    <description><![CDATA[1.0 km black trail, dropping 431 m from 659 m to 228 m at an average 45%. Geometry simplified from OpenStreetMap - indicative only, follow the signs on the ground. <i>Source: <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/645793824">way 645793824</a>.</i>]]></description>
