  <Placemark>
    <name>Lao Wai Trails / Dadu Trail House (Taichung, TW) [no lift]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Dadu Mountain 270 m - bike station on the Blue Highway ridge road, where the descents drop off the plateau</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>An expat-built network on the edge of the Dadu plateau above Taichung. The signature line is 老外林道, the Lao Wai (foreigner) forest road, graded blue, with named sections including E*thirteen Section, Curly Hairs and Eagle's Prey; the rest is flow and cross-country built and maintained by the local MTB community. The plateau rim runs 250-300 m and the city sits at 80-100 m, so the descents are short and repeatable rather than big. Dadu Trail House is the hub: formed in 2021 out of an old Japanese restaurant, it is an MTB bar, cafe, workspace and workshop that rents bikes and gear, e-bikes included.<br/><small>Nothing is drawn here: an mtb-tag sweep of the plateau returns zero features, the trails are unsigned, and there is no formal trail map.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>No lift. Pedal up from the urban fringe or the ridge road, or start at Dadu Trail House for local knowledge and rentals. Free.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Rideable year-round; avoid typhoon rains (Jul-Sep) and the hottest summer afternoons.<br/>Daily opening hours: daylight hours<br/>
    <small>Shared-use community trails. Start at Dadu Trail House for current conditions.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access">
      <tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr>
      <tr><td>Central Taichung</td><td>Bike / taxi</td><td>~25 min</td></tr>
    </table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://www.facebook.com/DaduTrailHouse/">Dadu Trail House</a>, the <a href="https://ziraneffect.com/dadu-trail-house-and-e-bikes/">Ziran Effect write-up</a> and the <a href="https://www.trailforks.com/trails/dadu-trail--------full-sections/">Trailforks entry for the Dadu Trail</a> for the grade and the section names. Pin placed on the OSM bike-rental node <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/node/9453527987">9453527987</a> on the 大肚藍色公路 ridge road, measured at 271 m; the previous coordinate was rounded to two decimals. Trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
