  <Placemark>
    <name>Kahakapao / Makawao Forest Reserve (Maui, US) [no lift, free]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Makawao Forest Reserve 840 m - Kahakapao trailhead, above Makawao</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>The Pineapple Express one-way descent drops about 400 m over 3.4 km with tabletops, a wooden berm and beginner ride-arounds. Renegade adds mixed cross-country and downhill terrain, while three skills areas progress from novice berms and a teeter to pump tracks and expert wooden step-up jumps.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Free pedal access; no uplift. Climb the forest roads and signed trail network from the Kahakapao trailhead.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open year-round, but avoid riding when wet or muddy. <br/>Daily opening hours: 07:00-18:00<br/><small>Daylight riding estimate; closures can follow heavy rain, storms or forestry work.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Kahului</td><td>Car</td><td>~35 min</td></tr><tr><td>Makawao</td><td>Car</td><td>~15 min</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://dlnr.hawaii.gov/recreation/nah/maui/">Hawaii DLNR Na Ala Hele</a> and the <a href="https://dlnr.hawaii.gov/forestry/files/2026/03/DRAFT-Makawao-FR-Management-Plan-Public-Review.pdf">2026 Makawao Forest Reserve management plan</a>. Pin on the north end of the OSM-mapped <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/744794547">Kahakapao Loop Trail</a> (way 744794547, tagged <i>bicycle=yes</i>), measured at 840 m. The previous pin sat 2.7 km east at 1124 m, on the mountain above the reserve rather than at the trails. Trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
