  <Placemark>
    <name>Whakarewarewa Forest MTB (Rotorua, NZ) [no lift, free]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Rotorua's globally renowned volcanic-soil trail network</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Around 150 km of continually evolving, purpose-built trails range from smooth beginner forest tracks to extreme roots, drops, jumps and steep technical lines. Well-draining volcanic soil makes this one of New Zealand's most reliable large trail centres.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Forest trail access is free and has no public lift. Pedal climbing routes and commercial shuttle services are available; bike hire and guiding operate around Waipa MTB car park.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Rideable year-round, with temporary forestry, event and maintenance closures. Daylight riding is recommended. <br/>Daily opening hours: 06:00-22:30<br/><small>Waipa and Redwoods vehicle-gate hours vary; walking and cycling access remains available, but daylight riding is recommended.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Rotorua centre</td><td>Bike / car</td><td>~15 min</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://redwoods.co.nz/bike/">official Redwoods bike guide</a> and <a href="https://redwoods.co.nz/info/opening-hours/">forest opening hours</a>.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-brown</styleUrl>
    <Point><coordinates>176.2815,-38.1884,366</coordinates></Point>
    <ExtendedData xmlns:mwm="https://comaps.app">
