  <Placemark>
    <name>Levi Bike Park (Finland) [gondola / chairlift]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Lapland lift-served park with long flow and enduro trails</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Thirteen bike-park routes and a wider 114 km MTB network range from the Hidden Forest beginner skills area to technical black lines. Northern Flow runs for more than 4 km from the fell.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Gondola2000 and Express lifts carry bikes. Rental, protection and instruction are available at Gondolitie.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Published 2026 bike-park season: 19 June-20 September. <br/>Daily opening hours: 10:00-18:00<br/><small>Published 2026 bike-park and rental hours.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Kittila airport</td><td>Bus / car</td><td>~15 min</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.levi.fi/en/biking/bike-park/">official Levi Bike Park</a>.</i> Pin corrected to the valley station of the Gondola 2000 (OSM <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/23480535">way 23480535</a>), measured at 234 m: the description names Gondola2000 as the bike uplift; the pin was 760 m from its base.]]></description>
