    <name>Jonkershoek: Armageddon</name>
    <description><![CDATA[6.6 km red trail, dropping 365 m from 670 m to 305 m at an average 6%. The signature descent, running 6.6 km from 670 m down to the valley. Fed from above by the short black Armageddon 8. Drawn as two sections joined across a 7 m gap. Geometry drawn in gpx.studio and supplied for this map, simplified to approximately 8 m - indicative only; follow the signs on the ground and ride with a valid permit.]]></description>
