  <Placemark>
    <name>Jonkershoek: The Plumber</name>
    <description><![CDATA[1.7 km black trail, dropping 298 m from 600 m to 302 m at an average 18%. The steep black option off the 600 m trailhead, dropping 298 m in 1.7 km. Geometry drawn in gpx.studio and supplied for this map, simplified to approximately 8 m - indicative only; follow the signs on the ground and ride with a valid permit.]]></description>
