    <description><![CDATA[1.0 km black trail, dropping 290 m from 731 m to 441 m at an average 28%. The steepest line in this set at an average 28%, falling 290 m in barely a kilometre from the high ground at 731 m. Geometry drawn in gpx.studio and supplied for this map, simplified to approximately 8 m - indicative only; follow the signs on the ground and ride with a valid permit.]]></description>
