  <Placemark>
    <name>Schweitzer Bike Park - Sandpoint (Idaho) [check operator]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Schweitzer Village 1444 m - valley station of the Great Escape Quad, Idaho</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Over 40 miles of trail spanning scenic cross-country riding and downhill runs with 1700 ft of vertical. Every downhill trail starts at the top of the Great Escape Quad and drops the full 1700 ft back to Schweitzer Village, so the runs are long rather than lappy. The Selkirks and Lake Pend Oreille below make the top station one of the better views in Idaho.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The Great Escape Quad carries bikes. A Summer Unlimited Pass covers scenic lift rides and bike trail access for the season; day tickets are cheapest bought online in advance.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Mid to late June through to Labor Day.<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Sandpoint</td><td>Car</td><td>~25 min</td></tr><tr><td>Spokane</td><td>Car</td><td>~1 h 45</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://www.schweitzer.com/things-to-do/activities/mountain-biking">Schweitzer - mountain biking</a> and <a href="https://www.schweitzer.com/plan-your-trip/tickets-and-passes">Schweitzer - tickets and passes</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
