  <Placemark>
    <name>Howler Bike Park (Missouri) [check operator]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Howler Bike Park 308 m - shuttle-served gravity park near Branson, Missouri</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A gravity park in the Ozarks near Branson, built for downhill riding across a range of grades. Part of the wave of shuttle-served parks that have opened in the region since the Arkansas trail boom.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/><b>No lift - shuttle.</b> Check the operator for current shuttle days and rates.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>The riding season, roughly spring to late autumn.<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Branson</td><td>Car</td><td>~25 min</td></tr><tr><td>Springfield</td><td>Car</td><td>~1 h</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://howlerbikepark.com/">Howler Bike Park</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
