  <Placemark>
    <name>Mount Sunapee Bike Park (New Hampshire) [check operator]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Mount Sunapee base 385 m - valley station of the Clipper Ship Quad, Newbury, New Hampshire</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Small but well made - six trails and nearly five miles of singletrack off the Clipper Ship Quad on South Peak, and about the closest lift-served downhill to Boston. Dirt Serpent is a mile-long flow trail built to be family-friendly, with berms throughout and optional jumps for anyone wanting more. Sidewinder steps up with jumps, wooden bridges and rock gardens, with B-lines to bail onto. Rock This Way is expert only - large drop-offs, elevated bridges, big berms and giant jumps.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The Clipper Ship Quad on South Peak. A summer Mountain Bike Pass covers unlimited bike haul; day rates and full-suspension rentals are sold at the base, and the park runs guides, lessons, trail patrol and mechanical support.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>The summer months.<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>New London</td><td>Car</td><td>~15 min</td></tr><tr><td>Concord</td><td>Car</td><td>~45 min</td></tr><tr><td>Boston</td><td>Car</td><td>~2 h</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://www.mountsunapee.com/explore-the-resort/activities-and-events/mountain-biking.aspx">Mount Sunapee - mountain biking</a> and <a href="https://www.mountsunapee.com/explore-the-resort/activities-and-events/mountain-biking/three-mountain-bike-haul-pass.aspx">Mount Sunapee - mountain bike haul pass</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
