  <Placemark>
    <name>HoliMont Bike Park - Ellicottville (New York) [check operator]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>HoliMont base 525 m - valley station of the Sunset lift, Ellicottville, New York</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>25 trails over more than 14 miles - 17 downhill and 8 cross-country - covering beginner flow through technical and freeride terrain to expert descents. HoliMont is a private ski club in winter but the bike park is open to everyone in summer, which makes it one of the quieter good parks within reach of Buffalo.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Load your bike on the Sunset lift. Day passes and a season pass are sold; a standing Friday offer gives 250 minutes of riding from 14:50 for 25 USD. Rentals, food and camping on site.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Mid-June through to late October, weather permitting.<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Ellicottville</td><td>Car</td><td>~5 min</td></tr><tr><td>Buffalo</td><td>Car</td><td>~1 h 15</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://holimont.com/programs/bike-park/">HoliMont Bike Park</a> and <a href="https://holimont.com/explore/tickets-and-passes/">HoliMont - tickets and passes</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
