  <Placemark>
    <name>Lee Canyon Bike Park [lift pass]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Lift-served downhill bike park above Las Vegas</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Lee Canyon is Southern Nevada's lift-served downhill bike park, with green, blue and black trails including machine-built flow and technical natural terrain. Uphill travel is not permitted; riders must stay on designated trails.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The chairlift serves all bike-park trails. Day-ticket prices vary by demand. The 2026 Mountain Bike Power Pass includes unlimited access to Lee Canyon, Brian Head and Purgatory for the bike-park season, plus Spider Mountain access.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Summer bike-park season, with dates and operating days subject to weather and conditions. Check the live calendar before travelling.<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Las Vegas</td><td>Car</td><td>~45 min</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://www.leecanyonlv.com/mtb-lift-tickets/">Lee Canyon MTB lift tickets</a>, <a href="https://www.leecanyonlv.com/mountain-bike-season-pass/">Mountain Bike Power Pass</a> and <a href="https://www.leecanyonlv.com/mountain-biking-lee-canyon/">Lee Canyon mountain biking</a>. Verify current lift operation and trail status.</i>]]></description>
