  <Placemark>
    <name>Brown County State Park: Hesitation Point</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Hesitation Point 306 m - the park's high point and overlook</b><br/><br/>
    Overlook on West Gate Entrance Road and the top of the Hesitation Point descent. See the main Brown County State Park pin for trails, fees and access.]]></description>
