    <description><![CDATA[<b>Walden's Ridge Park lower car park 227 m - bottom of the gravity trails</b><br/><br/>
    The lower trailhead, about 230 m below the upper car park. See the main Walden's Ridge Park pin for trails and access.]]></description>
