  <Placemark>
    <name>Downieville Downhill: Butcher Ranch Trail</name>
    <description><![CDATA[6.7 km blue trail, dropping 486 m from 2016 m to 1530 m at an average 7%. Geometry simplified from OpenStreetMap - indicative only, follow the signs on the ground. <i>Source: <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/243246511">way 243246511</a>, <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/499780869">way 499780869</a>.</i>]]></description>
