  <Placemark>
    <name>Stuttgart Cerro Abajo (Germany) [urban DH event course]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>2026 Red Bull Cerro Abajo World Series final</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Event</b><br/>Stuttgart hosts the series final on 5-6 September 2026. The event brings elite urban downhill through a temporary course of steep streets, stairs, tight passages, drops and constructed obstacles; final course details may still change before race weekend.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>No bike uplift and no permanent public race trail. Follow the organizer for spectator zones and event access.<br/><br/><p class="warn">&#9888;&#65039; This pin documents an announced professional event, not a trail to ride. Do not enter construction or race areas outside authorized access.</p>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>The announced event is 5-6 September 2026. There is no public riding season.<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Stuttgart Hbf</td><td>Local transit / walk</td><td>Event dependent</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.redbull.com/my-en/events/red-bull-stuttgart-cerro-abajo/red-bull-stuttgart-cerro-abajo-2026-faqs">official 2026 event FAQ</a>. Check the organizer for the final route and access plan.</i>]]></description>
