  <Placemark>
    <name>Boschendal Trails (Banhoek, South Africa) [permit, no lift]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Wine-estate network between Stellenbosch and Franschhoek</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Flowy singletrack around the Boschendal werf and dams, with the Inferno 1-2-3 descent dropping the estate's western slopes and connector trails linking Round the Dam, the Dam trail and the climb up into Banhoek towards the Stellenbosch network. Terrain is mostly beginner to intermediate and suits progression sessions and long day rides.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/><b>No lift.</b> Pedal-up only. A Wine Lands Trails permit is required; buy it before riding.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Rideable year-round. Summer fire danger and winter storms can close trails.<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Hellsend / Helshoogte Pass</td><td>Car</td><td>~10 min</td></tr><tr><td>Stellenbosch</td><td>Car</td><td>~20 min</td></tr><tr><td>Cape Town</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: trail names and layout from <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/">OpenStreetMap</a>; permits via <a href="https://winelandstrails.com/">Wine Lands Trails</a>. Confirm current access with the estate.</i>]]></description>
