  <Placemark>
    <name>Boschendal Trails: Inferno 1-2-3</name>
    <description><![CDATA[The full Inferno descent, chained from its three mapped sections; one-way in OSM. 3.7 km, about 232 m of descent (481 m to 249 m). Mapped as separate sections with a 27 m gap between them, joined here as one line. Geometry simplified from OpenStreetMap ways 1391008710, 1391025974, 1391194685, 1391194687 - indicative only, follow the signs on the ground and ride with a valid permit.]]></description>
