  <Placemark>
    <name>Boschendal Trails: Sugar Bowl 1-2</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Two-part descent on the same western slope as Inferno, reached from the Swart Op climb. OSM does not prefix this trail with an estate name. 2.4 km, about 95 m of descent (377 m to 282 m). Geometry simplified from OpenStreetMap ways 1391301254, 1391301255 - indicative only, follow the signs on the ground and ride with a valid permit.]]></description>
