  <Placemark>
    <name>El Santisimo Downhill (Urubamba, Peru) [race course, access unverified]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Valle Sagrado downhill course at San Isidro de Chicon</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A 2.4 km race descent dropping 421 m from roughly 3548 m to 3127 m. The surface is fast-draining gravelly and sandy earth with abundant loose and embedded rock. El Santisimo hosts a COPACI- and UCI-sanctioned American Series MTB downhill event.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>No permanent lift or public day price is published. Race transport and normal public riding access are not equivalent; arrange a local guide or event entry before attempting the course.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 1 May; closed from 1 November (conservative dry-season indication). The 2026 race ran 23-26 April, but ordinary access must be confirmed locally.<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Urubamba</td><td>Car / local shuttle</td><td>~20 min</td></tr><tr><td>Cusco</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h30</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://santisimodh.com/">official El Santisimo Downhill site</a>. Confirm land access and course status locally.</i>]]></description>
