  <Placemark>
    <name>Vitosha Mountain Bike Park (Bulgaria) [chairlift]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Vitoshko Lale top 2250 m - Vitosha Mountain above Sofia</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A DH race track that has hosted Balkan and European Championships, plus enduro and technical singletrack lines through the Vitosha Nature Park above Sofia. The park runs the Home Mountain Enduro (12th edition, June 2026) and Home Mountain Bike Cup DH series. The MTB-BG Bike School offers regular training courses on the trails.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Two chairlifts (Vitoshko Lale 1 + 2) carry bikes during summer operation. Summer 2026 opening was 6-7 June. Check the current ticket price and lift status directly.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 1 June; closed from 1 October (estimated summer season).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/><small>Estimated hours; verify lift and trail status with the operator.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Sofia</td><td>Car / bus</td><td>~40 min</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://mtb-bg.com/">MTB-BG Vitosha coverage</a>. Confirm lift and trail operation before travel.</i>]]></description>
