  <Placemark>
    <name>Vratna Paseky Bike Park (Slovakia) [chairlift]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Compact lift-served enduro and downhill in Mala Fatra</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>The Paseky sector offers a roughly 2.3 km enduro trail, a 1.75 km downhill trail and a short beginner-friendly Funny Flow line. The natural mountain setting and 380 m main-trail descent provide more variety than the compact footprint suggests.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The chairlift is adapted to carry bikes. Older published indications list single rides and day tickets, but check the current official tariff before relying on those prices.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 1 June; closed from 1 October.<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-16:00<br/><small>Summer bike operation may be limited to selected days; verify the live schedule.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Terchova</td><td>Car / bike</td><td>~10 min</td></tr><tr><td>Zilina</td><td>Car</td><td>~40 min</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://vratna.sk/en/bikepark-doorbands/">official Vratna bike-park page</a> and <a href="https://www.vratna.org/vratna-mala-fatra/">Vratna resort location information</a>. Check the lift calendar before travelling.</i>]]></description>
