  <Placemark>
    <name>Monte Sao Marcos Bikepark (Caramulo, Portugal) [no lift]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Race-grade downhill in Serra do Caramulo</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>More than 5 km of purpose-built trails with varied technical levels around Monte Sao Marcos. The flagship downhill is steep, raw and natural, requiring precise bike control; the park hosts the iXS European Downhill Cup and a UCI Class 1 international downhill race.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The park has no lift. Race participants use vehicle shuttles, while ordinary visitors should reserve bikes or trail use with the operator and confirm whether transport is available. No current public day price is displayed.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 1 January with no published seasonal closure.<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-18:00<br/><small>Estimated reservation window based on local operating information; book before travelling. Races, fire danger and maintenance can close trails.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Viseu</td><td>Car</td><td>~35 min</td></tr><tr><td>Porto</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h25</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://bikepark.pt/">official Monte Sao Marcos Bikepark</a>, <a href="https://www.ixsdownhillcup.com/en/vorstellung-caramullp">iXS downhill venue profile</a> and <a href="https://www.uci.org/competition-details/2026/MTB/77675">2026 UCI event listing</a>. Reserve access and check trail status with the operator.</i>]]></description>
