  <Placemark>
    <name>Kilimanjaro Kilema MTB Route (Tanzania) [permit and guide required]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Official high-altitude cycling route on Kilimanjaro</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Kilema is the designated 19 km route for summit-bound mountain-bike expeditions, climbing through forest and moorland toward Horombo before the immense descent. TANAPA also authorizes a non-summit Shira route. This is a multi-day altitude expedition with carrying and hike-a-bike, not a bike park or casual trail ride.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>No lift. A licensed operator, park registration, guide, porters, permits and expedition support are required. Pricing varies widely with group size and summit plan; independent mountain biking is not permitted.<br/><br/><p class="warn">&#9888;&#65039; Extreme altitude, cold, exposure and acute mountain sickness can be fatal. Use a licensed specialist, acclimatize properly and follow every TANAPA instruction.</p>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 1 June; closed from 1 November (preferred drier-season indication).<br/>Daily opening hours: 06:30-18:00<br/><small>TANAPA's published general cycling window; summit movement has additional timing rules. Rain and snow can affect any departure.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Moshi</td><td>Operator vehicle</td><td>~1h</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.tanzaniaparks.go.tz/uploads/publications/en-1568756513-Guidelines%20for%20Cycling%20.pdf">Tanzania National Parks mountain-biking rules, routes and hours</a>. Book only through a licensed Kilimanjaro operator.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-brown</styleUrl>
    <Point><coordinates>37.461542,-3.243309,1982</coordinates></Point>
    <ExtendedData xmlns:mwm="https://comaps.app">
      <mwm:properties>
        <mwm:value key="spot">kilimanjaro-kilema-mtb</mwm:value>
        <mwm:value key="tags">expert natural no-lift enduro freeride</mwm:value>
        <mwm:value key="open_from">06-01</mwm:value>
