  <Placemark>
    <name>Mo'Bike Chamouny (Mauritius) [4x4 shuttle]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Mauritius's first dedicated mountain-bike park</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>More than 25 km across at least 12 professionally built and maintained trails descend about 350 m through forest toward the south coast. Green, blue and red lines range from easy flow to roots, jumps, steep technical sections and enduro race stages.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>A 4x4 carries riders and bikes uphill every 30-45 minutes. A three-hour pass provides unlimited runs; rentals and protective equipment are available, while riders with a suitable MTB can buy trail access only. Book the current package and price online.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 1 January with no seasonal closure (normally open year-round).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00 Wednesday-Sunday<br/><small>Closed Monday and Tuesday. Heavy rain or cyclonic conditions can close the park.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Sir Seewoosagur Ramgoolam Airport</td><td>Car</td><td>~50 min</td></tr><tr><td>Bel Ombre</td><td>Car</td><td>~15 min</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://mauritiusbikingtrails.com/">official Mo'Bike trail, shuttle, booking and opening-hours information</a>. Reserve a session and check weather closure status before travelling.</i>]]></description>
