  <Placemark>
    <name>Hillbilly Bike Park: top of the Parallellheisen tow</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Parallellheisen top 961 m - highest point of the lift-served terrain</b><br/><br/>
    Top of the ski centre's longest drag lift, 365 m above the base. The Fjellheisen tow reaches 1029 m higher up the hill. See the main Hillbilly Bike Park pin for trails, season and access.]]></description>
