    <description><![CDATA[<b>Wagrain - Ski Amade flow and gravity park</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Part of the Ski Amade network with chairlift-served flow lines and downhill trails through the Salzburg mountains. A well-built progression park with green, blue and red options, plus a skills area at the base.<br/><br/>
