  <Placemark>
    <name>Attitash Bike Park (New Hampshire, US) [chairlift]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Attitash 189 m - lift base, below The Mountaineer</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Part of Vail Resorts with chairlift-served downhill trails in the White Mountains near North Conway. A mix of flow and technical terrain with the Mount Washington Valley as backdrop.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Chairlift carries bikes during summer operation. Check the current bike ticket and schedule with Attitash before travelling.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from June; closed from October (estimated summer season).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/><small>Estimated hours; check the operator schedule.</small><br/><br/>
