    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.attitash.com/plan-your-trip/summer-activities/">Attitash</a>. Pin placed on the base of the OSM-mapped <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/205580574">Mountaineer chairlift</a> (way 205580574), measured at 189 m; all five Attitash lifts start within 250 m of each other here.
    Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
