  <Placemark>
    <name>Okemo Bike Park (Vermont, US) [chairlift]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Okemo 395 m - South Ridge Quad A base, by the Sugarhouse Lodge, Ludlow, Vermont</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A Vail Resorts park with chairlift-served downhill trails near Ludlow. Progressive flow and technical lines through the Green Mountain National Forest area.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Chairlift carries bikes during summer operation. Check the current bike ticket and schedule with Okemo before travelling.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from June; closed from October (estimated summer season).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/><small>Estimated hours; check the operator schedule.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Boston</td><td>Car</td><td>~2h30</td></tr><tr><td>Albany</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h30</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.okemo.com/explore-the-resort/activities/summer-activities/">Okemo</a>. Pin on the valley station of the OSM-mapped <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/52460239">South Ridge Quad A</a> (way 52460239), the lift that serves the bike park, measured at 395 m. The park operates from the Sugarhouse Lodge across from the Sunburst Six. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
