  <Placemark>
    <name>Panorama Bike Park: top of the Mile 1 Express</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Mile 1 Express top 1558 m - where the DH trails start</b><br/><br/>
    Top station of the Mile 1 Express, the bike lift. Champagne Express continues to 2156 m and Summit Quad to 2358 m for the alpine zone. See the main Panorama Bike Park pin for trails, prices and access.]]></description>
