  <Placemark>
    <name>Coronet Peak Bike Park (New Zealand) [chairlift]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Coronet Peak - Queenstown's quick-access lift-served park</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Queenstown's original lift-served bike park, just 20 minutes from town with chairlift access to downhill and enduro trails through tussock and alpine terrain. Views across the Wakatipu basin and the Remarkables range. Summer operation during the southern hemisphere season.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Chairlift carries bikes during the December-March summer season. Check the current bike ticket and schedule with Coronet Peak before travelling.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from December; closed from March (southern hemisphere summer).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-16:00<br/><small>Estimated hours; check the operator schedule.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Queenstown</td><td>Car / shuttle</td><td>~25 min</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.coronetpeak.co.nz/">Coronet Peak</a>.
    Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
