    <description><![CDATA[1.1 km trail, dropping 176 m from 948 m to 772 m at an average 16%. OpenStreetMap records no grade for it. Geometry simplified from OpenStreetMap - indicative only, follow the signs on the ground. <i>Source: <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/relation/7039107">relation 7039107</a>.</i>]]></description>
