  <Placemark>
    <name>Cerro Bayo Bike Park (Villa La Angostura, AR) [chairlift]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Cerro Bayo - Patagonian lake-district gravity park</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A lift-served bike park above Villa La Angostura in Argentina's Lake District with chairlift access to downhill and enduro trails through lenga forest. Views across Nahuel Huapi lake and the Andes make this one of South America's more scenic gravity destinations.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Chairlift carries bikes during the December-March summer season. Check the current bike ticket and schedule with Cerro Bayo before travelling.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from December; closed from March (southern hemisphere summer).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/><small>Estimated hours; check the operator schedule.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Villa La Angostura</td><td>Car</td><td>~10 min</td></tr><tr><td>Bariloche</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h15</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.cerrobayo.com.ar/">Cerro Bayo</a>.
    Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
