    <name>Bikepark Spicak: top of the Spicak chairlift</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Spicak 1198 m - top of the Spicak chairlift</b><br/><br/>
    Where the park lines start. A second chairlift climbs on to Pancir at 1214 m for the longer natural descents. See the main Bikepark Spicak pin for trails, prices and access.]]></description>
