  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Grandvalira Bike Park / E-Bike Trails - Soldeu / El Tarter (Andorra) [23 EUR]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Grandvalira: TC8 Soldeu valley station</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Lift-served riding in the Soldeu / El Tarter sector of Grandvalira. The area historically offered downhill, freeride, enduro, cross-country and rally lines. In 2026 the official summer product is the Grandvalira E-Bike Trails network (111 km), with the Bike Pass giving up to four lift ascents per day on the Soldeu, Canillo and Funicamp sectors. A small number of OSM-recorded mtb:scale descents remain in the sector.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The Bike Pass uses the TC8 Soldeu gondola from Soldeu village and the TSD6 Solana chair to reach the highest freeride start points. 2026 Bike Pass: EUR 23 for ages 6-74 (4 lift ascents per day between Encamp/Funicamp, Canillo and Soldeu); under-5 and 75+ free; optional insurance EUR 12.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 21 June; closed from 27 September (Grandvalira 2026 summer season; individual lifts have shorter calendars, e.g. Funicamp from 11 July to 8 September).<br/>Daily opening hours: check sector-specific schedules.<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Andorra la Vella</td><td>Bus / car</td><td>~20 min</td></tr><tr><td>Barcelona Airport</td><td>Car / bus</td><td>~3h</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://www.grandvalira.com/en/summer-activities/ebike-circuits">Grandvalira E-Bike Trails</a>, <a href="https://www.grandvalira.com/en/opening-times-summer">summer opening hours</a>,
    legacy Soldeu Bike Park info from <a href="https://www.btt-bike-park-andorra.andorramania.net/soldeu-bike-park-andorra.php">Andorramania</a>, and <a href="https://www.moredirt.com/trail/Andorra_Pal-la-Massana/Grandvalira-Bike-Park/1347/">MoreDirt</a>.
    Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
