  <Placemark>
    <name>China Camp State Park: Oak Ridge Drive</name>
    <description><![CDATA[2.5 km green trail, dropping 84 m from 120 m to 25 m at an average 3%. Geometry simplified from OpenStreetMap - indicative only, follow the signs on the ground. <i>Source: <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/232461611">way 232461611</a>, <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/1081263038">way 1081263038</a>.</i>]]></description>
