    <name>China Camp State Park: Maytag</name>
    <description><![CDATA[0.7 km black trail, dropping 44 m from 273 m to 229 m at an average 6%. Geometry simplified from OpenStreetMap - indicative only, follow the signs on the ground. <i>Source: <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/452592706">way 452592706</a>, <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/514047388">way 514047388</a>.</i>]]></description>
