  <Placemark>
    <name>St-Luc Bike Park / Tignousa (Val d'Anniviers) [29 CHF]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>St-Luc 1684 m - valley station of the bike-carrying funicular to Tignousa</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Three maintained, purpose-built DH runs descend about 500 vertical metres from Tignousa to St-Luc. The park totals about 7 km and combines berms, wooden features, jumps and natural forest terrain.<br/><br/>
    - <b>Ginette:</b> 2.5 km blue beginner run, wide and playful.<br/>- <b>Funi Racer:</b> 2.5 km red race run used for the Swiss DH Championships.<br/>- <b>Black Lion:</b> 2.2 km expert black run with a jump line below the Bunny Up Park.<br/>- <b>Bunny Up Park:</b> Two table-jump lines, one red and one black, at the La Foret car park.<br/><br/>
    The official 24.7 km Weisshorn Bike loop is also traced on the map. It can be shortened with the funicular and combines the Planet Trail, Hotel Weisshorn and a scenic descent through Copate.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The St-Luc-Tignousa funicular carries bikes every 30 minutes. The 2026 one-day bike-park adult fare is 29 CHF. Magic Pass 2026-2027 includes the Val d'Anniviers summer lifts and bike transport.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 23 May; closed from 1 November.<br/>Daily opening hours: 08:00-17:00, extended to 18:00 from 4 July to 23 August 2026.<br/><small>Check current trail status and the operator timetable before travelling.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Sierre</td><td>Car / bus</td><td>~30 min</td></tr><tr><td>Sion</td><td>Car</td><td>~40 min</td></tr><tr><td>Visp</td><td>Car</td><td>~45 min</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://www.valdanniviers.ch/fr/P122578/a-faire/bike-park-st-luc">Val d'Anniviers - Bike Park St-Luc</a> and <a href="https://www.valais.ch/en/explore/activities/mountain-bike/bikeparks/bikepark-st-luc">Valais/Wallis Promotion</a>.
    Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
