  <Placemark>
    <name>St-Luc: Weisshorn Bike</name>
    <description><![CDATA[24.7 km intermediate MTB loop with about 815 m of climbing and descending. From St-Luc it climbs through the Rochet and Teppes forests to Tignousa, follows the panoramic Planet Trail towards the historic Hotel Weisshorn, then returns to Chiesso before descending through Copate. The ascent can be shortened by taking the bike-carrying funicular to Tignousa. <i>Source: <a href="https://www.valais.ch/en/explore/activities/mountain-bike/mountain-bike-tours/val-d-anniviers-weisshorn-bike">Valais/Wallis Promotion - Weisshorn Bike</a>. Official GPX geometry supplied by Valais/Wallis Promotion via Outdooractive, simplified to 12 m.</i>]]></description>
