  <Placemark>
    <name>Visperterminen: Giw Enduro (Route 548)</name>
    <description><![CDATA[5.6 km of the signed Giw enduro (route 548), dropping 485 m from 1,845 m to 1,360 m. The full signed route runs 12.4 km from Giw down to Visp for about 1,300 m of descent; only these four upper ways are mapped, so the line stops on the hillside rather than in the valley. <i>Source: OpenStreetMap ways <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/860657827">860657827</a>, <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/362219950">362219950</a>, <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/61561199">61561199</a> and <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/35017266">35017266</a>.</i>]]></description>
