  <Placemark>
    <name>Ovronnaz: Lac de Fully - Beudon</name>
    <description><![CDATA[24.7 km red enduro trail near Ovronnaz. <i>Source: <a href="https://www.ovronnaz.ch/vtt/">Ovronnaz tourism MTB itineraries</a>.</i>]]></description>
