  <Placemark>
    <name>Meteoro: La Reyder</name>
    <description><![CDATA[1.3 km blue trail, dropping 56 m from 1916 m to 1860 m at an average 4%. Difficulty from the <code>mtb:scale:imba</code> grade OpenStreetMap carries on the trail - the IMBA scale, which is a difficulty rating rather than a technical-terrain one - mapped onto the three colours the park signs: IMBA 1 green, 2 blue, 3 red. No <code>colour</code> tag is present, so this is a reading of the IMBA number, not the operator's own sign; check the board at the trailhead. Geometry simplified from OpenStreetMap to approximately 8 m - indicative only, follow the signs on the ground. <i>Source: <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/1550280098">way 1550280098</a>.</i>]]></description>
