  <Placemark>
    <name>Vista Alegre Bike Park (Curitiba) [free, no lift]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Parque Natural Municipal Vista Alegre 930 m - old quarry inside Curitiba</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>An urban gravity spot in a former quarry between the Pilarzinho and Vista Alegre neighbourhoods, inside Curitiba city limits. Short, fast downhill tracks on tight tree-lined singletrack with berms, rollers and small gaps, dropping towards the park's waterfall. Pista do Parque is the longest at 476 m; Pista da Cachoeira is the other one riders name, and the Downhill Vista Alegre segment is a local Strava fixture. A quick-session spot, not a day out. The municipal park around it has parking, a playground and a deck over the waterfall, and is shared with walkers.<br/><small>Nothing here is in OpenStreetMap except the park polygon. Helmets are required by the operator's own rules; gloves, knee and elbow pads recommended.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>No lift or shuttle - pedal or push back to the top. Free: it is a public city park.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open year-round.<br/>Daily opening hours: daylight hours<br/>
    <small>Public park shared with walkers; respect local rules and trail closures.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access">
      <tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr>
      <tr><td>Curitiba downtown</td><td>Bike</td><td>~20 min</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Curitiba</td><td>Public transport + bike</td><td>~30 min</td></tr>
    </table><br/>
    <i>Sources: the local crew's <a href="https://www.facebook.com/vistaalegrebike/">Vista Alegre Bike page</a> and its <a href="https://www.trailforks.com/region/vista-alegre-bike-park-45321/">Trailforks region</a> for the trails and rules. Pin placed on the OSM <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/30050370">Parque Natural Municipal Vista Alegre</a> polygon (way 30050370), measured at 930 m. Trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
