  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Marbachegg: CKW Jump Trail</name>
    <description><![CDATA[0.6 km red trail, dropping 68 m from 1457 m to 1389 m at an average 11%. A short built jump line at the top of the Marbachegg gondola. Geometry drawn in gpx.studio and supplied for this map, simplified to approximately 8 m - indicative only; follow the signs on the ground.]]></description>
