  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Les Karellis Bike Park (Maurienne) [lift access]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Les Karellis bike park</b><br/><br/>A small Maurienne bike park with two official downhill lines: the blue Cool'Kar and red Déval'Kar. The resort is a good compact addition for riders looking for lift-served riding away from the larger Portes du Soleil parks.<br/><br/><i>Sources: <a href="https://www.karellis.com/activites-ete/location-vtt/">Les Karellis bike park information</a> and <a href="https://www.karellis.com/">Les Karellis resort</a>. Confirm lift operation and trail status before travelling.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-blue</styleUrl>
    <Point><coordinates>6.402090,45.212429,2130</coordinates></Point>
    <ExtendedData xmlns:mwm="https://comaps.app"><mwm:properties><mwm:value key="spot">les-karellis</mwm:value><mwm:value key="tags">beginner expert bike-park dh enduro chairlift</mwm:value></mwm:properties><mwm:icon>Mountain</mwm:icon><mwm:visibility>1</mwm:visibility></ExtendedData>
  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Chaumont: Mater-Haut</name>
    <description><![CDATA[4 km expert freeride descent from Chaumont to Neuchatel, with a chicken line alongside the main line. Free access; return uphill by the Chaumont funicular. <i>Source: <a href="https://www.j3l.ch/en/V2342/things-to-do/sport-leisure/mountain-bike/bike-park">Neuchatel Tourism description</a> and <a href="https://www.j3l.ch/mycity/frontend/export/visit/en/2342.gpx">official GPX trace</a>.</i>]]></description>
