  <Placemark>
    <name>Breuil-Cervinia - Cervino Bike Park (Aosta Valley) [20 EUR]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Breuil-Cervinia 2025 m - valley station of the Plan Maison gondola</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Over 50 km of descent served by three lifts, spread across roughly 5 green, 5 blue, 6 black and 1 double black. The flowing lines are a genuine way into gravity riding and the steep technical ones are not; what sets the place apart is the altitude - the riding starts above 2000 m and tops out near 2900 m, so it stays open in the heat and the Matterhorn is in front of you the whole way down. One ticket covers Cervinia, Valtournenche, Chamois and Torgnon.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The Plan Maison gondola and cable car from Breuil-Cervinia at 2025 m, then Cime Bianche Laghi and the Plan Maison chairlift for the high ground. Day pass around 20 EUR.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 4 May; closed from 7 September (published 2026 dates).<br/>Daily opening hours: 08:30-17:00<br/><small>Typical daily estimate; check the operator schedule.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Chatillon</td><td>Bus</td><td>~1h00</td></tr><tr><td>Turin</td><td>Car</td><td>~2h00</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.cervinia.it/en/impianti">Cervino Ski Paradise</a>.
    Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-blue</styleUrl>
    <Point><coordinates>7.633660,45.934280,2024</coordinates></Point>
    <ExtendedData xmlns:mwm="https://comaps.app">
