  <Placemark>
    <name>Vogel: top of the Bohinj cable car</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Vogel 1520 m - top of the cable car</b><br/><br/>Where the descents to the lake start, and the foot of the Orlove Glave and Sija chairlifts. See the main Vogel pin for trails, prices and access.]]></description>
