  <Placemark>
    <name>Bikepark Bad Wildbad (Black Forest) [26 EUR]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Bad Wildbad 440 m - valley station of the Sommerbergbahn funicular</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Six to eight lines over roughly 300 m of vertical, and a reputation that far outruns the size. Epic Downhill has hosted the German championships and is genuinely hard, big rock gardens and rough root sections; Rock Solid is the freeride line, huge berms, drops and tables over 154 m of drop; One Family Trail is the beginner run, berms, rollers and tables. Small hill, serious riding.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The historic Sommerbergbahn funicular from the town at 440 m climbs just under 300 m, or take the bike shuttle. Day ticket 20 EUR adult on weekdays and 26 EUR at weekends and on holidays; 15 to 22 EUR for youths.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from April; closed from November (typical window; check the operator and conditions).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-18:00<br/><small>Typical daily estimate; check the operator schedule.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Pforzheim</td><td>Train</td><td>~50 min</td></tr><tr><td>Stuttgart</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h15</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.bad-wildbad.de/">Bad Wildbad tourism</a>.
    Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-blue</styleUrl>
