  <Placemark>
    <name>Civetta - Val Fiorentina / Pescul (Dolomites) [34 EUR]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Pescul 1410 m - valley station of the Pescul-Fertazza chairlift</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>More than 75 km of marked mountain-bike trail on one ticket, spread over the three valleys around Monte Civetta - Alleghe, Val di Zoldo and Val Fiorentina. It is a trail area rather than a built park: long scenic loops with easy going and rest stops, and single track with genuinely technical sections for people who want it. Pescul is the Val Fiorentina access point, with two four-seat chairlifts straight into the network; the Piani di Pezze gondola at Alleghe opens the other side. The Civetta Superbike route, 41 km and 1770 m of climbing, is the hard day out.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The Pescul-Fertazza and Fertazza chairlifts from 1410 m, plus the Alleghe and Val di Zoldo lifts on the same Vibes and Bikes pass. Day pass 34 EUR.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from late June; closed from mid-September (typical window; some lifts open earlier in June).<br/>Daily opening hours: 08:30-17:00<br/><small>Typical daily estimate; check the operator schedule.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Belluno</td><td>Bus</td><td>~1h30</td></tr><tr><td>Venice</td><td>Car</td><td>~2h15</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://skicivetta.com/vibes-bikes">Civetta Vibes and Bikes</a>.
    Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-green</styleUrl>
