  <Placemark>
    <name>Bikepark Oberammergau - Kolbensattel (Bavaria) [34.50 EUR]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Oberammergau 880 m - valley station of the Kolben chairlift</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Seven lines on the Kolbensattel: the 2 km Flowtrail is the signature run, Alpina Kleiner Hobbit at 1250 m is the longest, and the rest cover the spread - the Ambit jumpline, the rooty Wurzelsepp, Switchbacker for tight hairpins, the black Scott Fichtenschreck, and the Holzwurm rookie course. Two drag lifts run an Easyloop system, so you stay on the bike instead of loading it - laps come round fast.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The Kolben chairlift from Oberammergau at 880 m to 1285 m, plus the two Easyloop drags. Day ticket 34.50 EUR adult, 26 EUR for 10 to 17, 3 EUR off for under-tens; late-shift ticket 32 EUR.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from early April; closed from November (typical window; check the operator and conditions).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/><small>Typical daily estimate; check the operator schedule.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Oberammergau station</td><td>Walk</td><td>~15 min</td></tr><tr><td>Munich</td><td>Train</td><td>~1h50</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.bikepark-oberammergau.de/bikeparkpreise/">Bikepark Oberammergau</a>.
    Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
