  <Placemark>
    <name>Bikepark Hindelang - Hornbahn (Allgaeu) [32 EUR]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Bad Hindelang 795 m - valley station of the Hornbahn gondola</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Nine kilometres of descent from the top of the Hornbahn, split between two mains. Yellow Banana is the medium line, about 6 km with its variants, jumps all rollable, with the Green Frog beginner version and the Red Chilly jumpline branching off it. Black Rock is the other 3 km: fast, rocky freeride and downhill with north shore and a real set of obstacles. Three practice courses, a pumptrack and a kids' course sit at the valley station, which makes it work as a family day as well as a hard one.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The Hornbahn, a modern eight-person gondola with bikes carried inside the cabin, five minutes from 795 m to 1315 m. Day ticket about 32 EUR adult and 24 EUR child; half-day tickets from midday.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from May; closed from November (typical window; check the operator and conditions).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-16:30<br/><small>Typical daily estimate; check the operator schedule.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Sonthofen</td><td>Bus</td><td>~20 min</td></tr><tr><td>Munich</td><td>Car</td><td>~2h00</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.hornbahn-hindelang.de/bikepark-allgaeu/">Hornbahn Hindelang</a>.
    Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
