  <Placemark>
    <name>Prali Bike Arena (Val Germanasca, Piedmont) [15 EUR]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Prali 1480 m - valley station of the Pian dell'Alpet chairlift</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Six routes and over 1000 m of lift-served vertical, which is a lot for a resort this small and this cheap. Bric Rond is the short blue at the top, 1 km; Verde Miandette is the long blue, 5 km and 800 m of drop; La Vacha is the red equivalent, also 5 km and 800 m; Gran Saret, 3.5 km, and Iclo Roc, 1.5 km, are the other reds; and Oro Bianco is the black, 3 km and 550 m for experienced riders only. Two chairlifts chain to 2490 m.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The Pian dell'Alpet chairlift from Prali at 1480 m to 2230 m, then Bric Rond to 2490 m. Day pass around 15 EUR.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from mid-June; closed from mid-September (typical window; check the operator and conditions).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/><small>Typical daily estimate; check the operator schedule.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Pinerolo</td><td>Bus</td><td>~1h15</td></tr><tr><td>Turin</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h45</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.praliskiarea.com/">Prali Ski Area</a>.
    Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
