  <Placemark>
    <name>Reallon Bike Park (Hautes-Alpes) [16 EUR]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Reallon 1555 m - valley station of the Clos des Aurans chairlift</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>The newest bike park in the southern Alps, opened in 2018, on a balcony above the Serre-Poncon reservoir with the Ecrins national park opposite. Ten runs in all: six downhill - 2 green, 1 blue, 2 red and 1 black - and five marked enduro itineraries, 1 blue, 3 red and 1 black. Shammy is the green under the first chairlift and a genuinely calm place to start; Chabrieres is the red off the second lift, with the lake in view the whole way; Diablee is the black, 500 m of drop through rock, roots and a choice of lines. A pumptrack at the car park entrance is free all year.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The Clos des Aurans chairlift from 1555 m, then Chabrieres to 2110 m. Day pass 16 EUR.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open in July and August; check the operator for shoulder-season weekends.<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:30-17:00<br/><small>Typical daily estimate; check the operator schedule.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Embrun</td><td>Car</td><td>~30 min</td></tr><tr><td>Gap</td><td>Car</td><td>~50 min</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.serreponcon.com/reallon/ete-a-reallon/bikepark-de-reallon/">Bikepark de Reallon</a>.
    Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-blue</styleUrl>
    <Point><coordinates>6.360970,44.576570,1555</coordinates></Point>
    <ExtendedData xmlns:mwm="https://comaps.app">
      <mwm:properties>
        <mwm:value key="spot">reallon</mwm:value>
        <mwm:value key="tags">beginner expert bike-park dh enduro chairlift</mwm:value>
