  <Placemark>
    <name>Bikepark Wurbauerkogel (Windischgarsten, Austria) [33 EUR]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Windischgarsten 625 m - valley station of the Wurbauerkogel chairlift</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Four runs on a small hill: one blue, two red and one black, which is a tidy spread for 230 m of vertical and makes it a good place to move up a grade rather than a destination in itself. Laps are short and come round fast.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The Wurbauerkogel chairlift from 625 m to 855 m. Day ticket 33 EUR adult, 28 EUR youth, 17.50 EUR child; four-hour and morning tickets are cheaper.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from May; closed from mid-October (typical window; check the operator and conditions).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/><small>Typical daily estimate; check the operator schedule.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Windischgarsten station</td><td>Bike</td><td>~10 min</td></tr><tr><td>Linz</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h15</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.wurbauerkogel.at/en/Wurbauerkogel-at-a-Glance/Bikepark">Bikepark Wurbauerkogel</a>.
    Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
