  <Placemark>
    <name>Frontignano Bike Park (Sibillini, Marche) [15 EUR]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Frontignano di Ussita 1350 m - valley station of the Schiancio-Saliere chairlift</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>28 trails in total, split between the lift-served park and a natural zone alongside it: 8 dedicated downhill runs off the Schiancio-Saliere and Belvedere chairlifts, and at least 20 marked enduro lines you pedal for. All of it sits inside the Monti Sibillini national park below Monte Bove, which is a long way from anywhere and rides accordingly - quiet, natural ground, very few people.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The Schiancio-Saliere chairlift from 1350 m and the Pian dell'Arco-Belvedere chairlift above it, reaching the Cristo delle Nevi refuge. Chairlift about 15 EUR a day.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from May to September; daily in the first half of August, weekends otherwise.<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-18:20<br/><small>Published hours, weather permitting; check the operator calendar.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Macerata</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h20</td></tr><tr><td>Rome</td><td>Car</td><td>~3h00</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.frontignano360.it/estate/seggiovia">Frontignano360</a>.
    Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
