  <Placemark>
    <name>Manzaneda Bike Park (Galicia, Spain) [check operator]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Manzaneda 1500 m - valley station of the TS6 chairlift</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Seven marked trails, close to 11 km in total, running through the forest with a mix of natural and built obstacles - bumps, wooden walkways, jumps, slabs and trial-style sections - graded from a genuine first-timer line up to trails for experienced riders. Everything starts at the top of Cabeza de Manzaneda where the chairlift ends. The only lift-served park in Galicia, and a long way from the Pyrenean crowds.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Two chairlifts, TS6 Manzaneda from 1500 m and TS4 Da Fontefria, both reaching about 1760 m. Prices are set by the resort each season - check before travel.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from June; closed from mid-October (typical window; check the operator and conditions).<br/>Daily opening hours: 10:00-18:00<br/><small>Typical daily estimate; check the operator schedule.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Ourense</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h15</td></tr><tr><td>Santiago</td><td>Car</td><td>~2h30</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.manzaneda.com//manzaneda-bike-park">Manzaneda Bike Park</a>.
    Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
