    <description><![CDATA[1.2 km trail, dropping 211 m from 1503 m to 1292 m at an average 17%. OpenStreetMap records no grade for it. Geometry simplified from OpenStreetMap - indicative only, follow the signs on the ground. <i>Source: <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/508508763">way 508508763</a>.</i>]]></description>
