  <Placemark>
    <name>Bike Park d'Artouste - Vallee d'Ossau (Pyrenees) [17 EUR]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Fabreges 1260 m - valley station of the Sagette gondola</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Six marked pistes over 750 m of vertical on the Sagette side of the Ossau valley: a green 4x4 run, two blues (Fougere Coaster and Forest Coaster), the red Avalanche and two blacks, HardTouste and Full Beer. Beyond the park boundary the station signs eight enduro descent itineraries and two e-bike loops across preserved high-mountain terrain. The Panoramic restaurant sits at the top of the gondola.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The Sagette gondola from Fabreges at about 1260 m. A day of gondola plus bike descents is 17 EUR with unlimited ascents.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Mid-May to early October, daily. July and August 09:00-20:00; September and October 09:30-17:00.<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Laruns</td><td>Car</td><td>~20 min</td></tr><tr><td>Pau</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h15</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://artouste.fr/ete/en/experiences/mountain-bike">Altitude Pyrenees Artouste</a> and <a href="https://www.valleedossau.com/espace-vtt-d-artouste.html">Vallee d'Ossau tourism</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
