  <Placemark>
    <name>Monte Poieto Bike Park - Aviatico (Bergamo) [8 EUR]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Aviatico 1025 m - valley station of the Monte Poieto cabinovia</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A single classic downhill piste off Monte Poieto down to Aviatico, about 300 m of vertical on the Selvino-Aviatico plateau above the Val Seriana. It hosted races almost every year from 2011 to 2017, including the Lombardy regional downhill championship, so the line is a proper race track rather than a flow trail. Food at both the bottom station and the summit, with a playground and a deer park at the top for anyone not riding.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The Aviatico-Monte Poieto cabinovia, 8 EUR with a bike.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open every weekend of the year 09:00-18:00, and daily from the last week of June to the first week of September. Out of season the lift runs by arrangement.<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Albino</td><td>Cable car + bus</td><td>~40 min</td></tr><tr><td>Bergamo</td><td>Car</td><td>~50 min</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://www.mtbbergamo.it/2019/03/poieto-dh.html">MTB Bergamo</a> and <a href="https://www.rifugi.lombardia.it/en/bergamo/aviatico/hut-monte-poieto.html">Rifugio Monte Poieto</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
