  <Placemark>
    <name>Bike Park Kope (Pohorje, Slovenia) [30 EUR]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Kope 1350 m - valley station of the Pungart chairlift</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Eight built trails on the western end of the Pohorje ridge, 5.8 km of them in the park proper and over 13 km counting the links, and the fastest-growing gravity spot in Slovenia. Green Fairy (1.2 km) and Blue Fairy (1 km) are the progression pair, with the short Pungart flow (500 m) and Meditation Station (380 m, 44 m of drop) for first laps. Wild Rooster (500 m) and The root Chakra (230 m, 36 m) are the red lines, Spicy Frog is the long blue at 1.2 km and 128 m of descent, and Black Knight is the expert run: 780 m for 164 m of drop.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>A four-seat chairlift carries riders and bikes. Day ticket 29.90 EUR adult, 23.90 EUR youth, 17.90 EUR child, 84.90 EUR family; four hours 19.90 EUR adult. Riding the trails without using the chairlift is 9.90 EUR. Every ticket includes a meal at the Zajc restaurant.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Friday to Sunday in the summer season.<br/>Daily opening hours: 10:00-18:00<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Slovenj Gradec</td><td>Car</td><td>~30 min</td></tr><tr><td>Maribor</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h10</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://www.kope.si/en/bike-park">Kope Mountain Resort</a> and <a href="https://www.pohorje-slovenija.si/kolesarjenje/bike-parki/bike-park-kope">Pohorje Slovenija</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
