  <Placemark>
    <name>MSB-X-Trail - Sankt Andreasberg (Harz) [39 EUR]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Sankt Andreasberg 535 m - valley station of the Matthias-Schmidt-Berg chairlift</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>About 12 km of trail on the Matthias-Schmidt-Berg above Sankt Andreasberg, nine lines covering the whole range: a 2.3 km flowtrail and a 2 km singletrail at the easy end, the 1.9 km Funride and an enduro trail in the middle, then the 1.1 km Freeride line, the 1.5 km downhill track and a Super Enduro for the hard end. A jump line with 16 jumps and the Kids Trail Harz round it out. North-shore woodwork and technical sections throughout - this is the Harz, so expect roots and wet rock as much as loam.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The Alberti chairlift takes riders and bikes up. Day ticket 39 EUR adult, 27 EUR child (7-17); four hours 31 EUR adult, 22 EUR child; a single ride is 6 EUR. Rental station, workshop, bike wash and food are all at the valley station.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>April to October, Wednesday to Sunday. Closed Monday and Tuesday.<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:15-17:15<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Goslar</td><td>Bus</td><td>~1h00</td></tr><tr><td>Hanover</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h45</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://www.harz-bikepark.de/bikepark-st-andreasberg/">Harz Bikepark St. Andreasberg</a> and <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/">OpenStreetMap</a> for the trail geometry. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
