    <name>Bikepark Albstadt: Schönhalden Downhill</name>
    <description><![CDATA[0.5 km red trail, dropping 83 m from 929 m to 846 m at an average 17%. Geometry simplified from OpenStreetMap - indicative only, follow the signs on the ground. <i>Source: <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/486194401">way 486194401</a>.</i>]]></description>
