  <Placemark>
    <name>Alagna Valsesia - Monterosa (Piedmont, IT) [lift pass]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Alagna Valsesia 1215 m - valley station of the Alagna-Pianalunga cablecar</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>The Piedmont side of the Monterosa, and an unusual one: three stages of lift stack up from the Walser village at 1215 m to Passo dei Salati at 2970 m and on toward Indren, so the descents start higher than almost anywhere else on this map. The marked network is graded for everyone, for the trained and for experts, running through the woods and pastures of the three valleys rather than as a shaped park - the Alagna to Scopa trail alone threads 5 km down the valley past the Walser hamlets of Balma, Gabbio and Campertogno. The Monterosa lift system links across to Gressoney and Champoluc for a three-valley day.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>All the lifts are equipped for bike carriage. Three run in summer: Alagna-Pianalunga, Pianalunga-Passo dei Salati and Passo dei Salati-Indren. Note the ticketing - a one-way is valid for the ascent only and a return for the descent only. The operator publishes the summer tariff as a PDF rather than on the page; check before travelling.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 30 May; closed from 13 September (all three lifts run daily across that window).<br/>Daily opening hours: 07:30-13:00 and 14:15-17:30<br/><small>2026 published calendar. Hours differ slightly per stage - Salati closes 17:00 and Indren 16:45 - and from 24 August the Staffal-Gabiet-Salati link to Gressoney is closed.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Varallo</td><td>Bus / car</td><td>~45 min</td></tr><tr><td>Milan</td><td>Car</td><td>~2h00</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://monterosaski.eu/en/experiences/lift-timetables-and-prices-alagna-valsesia-summer-2026-21492">Monterosa Ski - Alagna Valsesia summer 2026 timetables</a> and <a href="https://www.alagna.it/en/experiences/bike-valsesia-monterosa/">Alagna - Bike Valsesia Monterosa</a>. Verify prices, lift and trail status.</i>]]></description>
