    <name>Alagna Valsesia: Pianalunga mid-station</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Pianalunga at 2040 m, top of the Alagna cablecar and base of the Funifor on to Passo dei Salati - the change-over point and the start of the long descent back to Alagna.]]></description>
