  <Placemark>
    <name>Laveno-Mombello - Sasso del Ferro (Lago Maggiore, IT) [12 EUR return]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Laveno-Mombello 230 m - valley station of the Funivie del Lago Maggiore</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Not a bike park - a cable car that takes bikes onto unmarked mountain paths, straight above Lake Maggiore. The bucket lift climbs 685 m from the lakeshore to Poggio Sant'Elsa at 915 m, under the 1062 m Sasso del Ferro summit, and the descents drop back to the water from there. OpenStreetMap holds 13.6 km of mtb-graded trail on this hillside, most of it unnamed, and the line falling from just below the top station is tagged <b>mtb:scale 6</b> - the top of the technical scale. Riders report the network still developing and poorly waymarked, so treat it as a freeride hillside to explore rather than a signed circuit, and expect to carry.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Bikes are carried under the cable car's special-transport rules, alongside dogs and paragliders; the operator does not publish a separate bike supplement, so ask at the ticket office. Return fare about 12.00 EUR adult, 8.50 EUR reduced - published figures vary, verify before travelling. Bike and equipment rental by enquiry only.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 01 February; closed from 31 December (the lift runs year-round except January).<br/>Daily opening hours: 11:00-21:00<br/><small>Summer hours; the timetable changes by season and the lift is wind-sensitive.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Laveno-Mombello (railway station)</td><td>Walk</td><td>~15 min</td></tr><tr><td>Milan</td><td>Train / car</td><td>~1h20</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.funiviedellagomaggiore.it/en/experience">Funivie del Lago Maggiore</a>; trail grades from OpenStreetMap. The operator markets trekking and paragliding rather than MTB - verify bike carriage, prices and trail condition locally.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-blue</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>8.620920,45.912230,228</coordinates></Point>
    <ExtendedData xmlns:mwm="https://comaps.app"><mwm:properties><mwm:value key="spot">laveno-sasso-del-ferro</mwm:value><mwm:value key="tags">expert natural dh freeride cable-car</mwm:value><mwm:value key="open_from">02-01</mwm:value><mwm:value key="closed_from">12-31</mwm:value></mwm:properties><mwm:icon>Mountain</mwm:icon><mwm:visibility>1</mwm:visibility></ExtendedData>
