  <Placemark>
    <name>Sasso del Ferro: cable car top station</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Poggio Sant'Elsa at 915 m, top of the Laveno bucket lift and the start of the descents back to the lake. The Sasso del Ferro summit is 1062 m, a short push above.]]></description>
