  <Placemark>
    <name>Roubion Bike Park - les Buisses (Alpes-Maritimes) [18 EUR]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Roubion les Buisses 1430 m - valley station of the Buisses chairlift</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Nine trails off one chairlift an hour and a half from Nice: one green, two blue, three red and three black, the blacks genuinely technical. Named lines on the hill include Prom' du Berger, Bleue de Chauffe, Cobarmont and Le Goulet. A separate built area adds twelve wooden features for working on skills, and the whole place has the dry, rocky, loose character of the Mercantour rather than alpine loam.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>A four-seat chairlift. Day pass 18 EUR, 16 EUR bought online; half day 13 EUR or 12 EUR; a single ascent 7 EUR or 6 EUR; five descents 45 EUR or 40 EUR. A reloadable card costs 2 EUR on your first visit, after which you can top it up from a phone.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>May to late September, weekends and public holidays.<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:30-17:30<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Saint-Sauveur-sur-Tinee</td><td>Car</td><td>~30 min</td></tr><tr><td>Nice</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h45</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://www.roubion.com/loisirs-dete/vtt/">Roubion bike park</a>, <a href="https://www.explorenicecotedazur.com/station/bike-park-roubion-les-buisses/">Nice Cote d'Azur tourism</a> and <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/">OpenStreetMap</a> for the trail geometry. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
