  <Placemark>
    <name>Sando Bikepark (San Domenico di Varzo, Piedmont) [22 EUR]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>San Domenico 1365 m - valley station of the San Domenico - Casa Rossa gondola</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Eight signed lines over more than 1100 m of descent, at the head of the Val Divedro right under the Alpe Veglia nature park. The operator's count is 1 green, 3 blue, 2 red and 2 black. Black Pepper is the reference line, a natural track with drops, technical jumps and pitches around 25 percent, and it is explicitly for experienced riders only; Local Flow is the long red, about 4 km on the San Domenico - Casa Rossa and Casa Rossa - Alpe Ciamporino lifts; Blue Eagle and Just for Fun are the 2.5 km and 1.5 km blues; Sando Air Line is the 2.5 km jump line; Baby Line is the 0.5 km green off the Ciamporino gondola. Marked e-bike and enduro routes run out to Alpe Moiero, Passo delle Possette, Alpe Veglia and Ponte Campo, and there is a learning area for small children.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The San Domenico - Casa Rossa gondola from 1365 m, then Casa Rossa - Alpe Ciamporino to 1928 m, with two-seat chairlifts on the same alignment and the CD4 Ciamporino - Dosso chair carrying on to 2475 m. Adult day pass 22 EUR; a four-hour pass is 24 EUR for adults and 20 EUR for children 9-14, and under-8s are free.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Summer 2026: weekends only from 27 June to 19 July, daily from 20 July to 30 August, then weekends again from 5 to 27 September.<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><br/>Varzo, on the Domodossola-Brig line, is the nearest station; San Domenico is up the road above it.<br/><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://sandobikepark.com/">Sando Bikepark</a>, <a href="https://sandobikepark.com/trail/">its trail list</a> and <a href="https://www.san-domenico.com/en/activities-experiences/bikepark">San Domenico Ski</a>. Only one of the park's lines is mapped in OpenStreetMap, so the trail geometry here is incomplete. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
