  <Placemark>
    <name>Love BikePark Piazzatorre (Val Brembana, Lombardy) [22 EUR]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Piazzatorre 1105 m - valley station of the Gremei chairlift</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A small park in the upper Val Brembana, built jointly by the municipality, the Monte Torcola lift company and the 4T-Project team, running from the top of the Gremei 1 lift at about 1550 m down to the village at 1150. Gullon is the flow line - easy enough to learn on, with enough alternative lines to keep a fast rider interested - Hormiga sits in the middle, and the Ascari variant is the newest, built around corners rather than features. Back to the Roots is the real downhill track, technical and for experienced riders, and has been closed at times, so check status on arrival.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The Gremei chairlift carries bikes. Day pass 22 EUR, four hours 18 EUR, a children's rate of 10 EUR, and a season pass 240 EUR. Rental, protection and coaching through the 4T-Project.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>June, July and September at weekends; daily through August.<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:30-17:30<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>San Pellegrino Terme</td><td>Car</td><td>~40 min</td></tr><tr><td>Bergamo</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h15</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://www.altobrembo.it/en/tema/downhill-in-the-bike-trails-of-love-bike-park-in-piazzatorre/">Altobrembo Val Brembana</a>, <a href="https://www.visitbrembo.it/it/poi/piazzatorre-lovebikepark">Visit Brembo</a> and <a href="https://4tproject.com/lovebikepark">4T-Project</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
