  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Bike Park du Grand Puy - Seyne (Alpes-de-Haute-Provence) [15 EUR]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Le Grand Puy 1605 m - valley station of the Soleil drag lift</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Five graded runs off one chairlift above Seyne-les-Alpes - one green, one blue, two red and one black - plus an enduro trail along the ridges for riders who want distance rather than laps. Dry, sunny southern-Alps terrain, 45 minutes from Digne or Gap and two hours from Aix and Marseille, which makes it one of the easier gravity days to reach from the coast. A wash station and bike rental at the base.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The Cretes chairlift, 400 m of vertical. A single ascent 7.50 EUR, a day 15 EUR, a half day 11 EUR.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>3 July to the end of August, Saturday to Wednesday, plus 14 July and 15 August, then weekends in September.<br/>Daily opening hours: 10:00-17:00<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Seyne-les-Alpes</td><td>Car</td><td>~10 min</td></tr><tr><td>Gap</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h00</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://www.blancheserreponcon-tourisme.com/domaines-skiable-vtt/bike-park-du-grand-puy-seyne/">Blanche Serre-Poncon tourism</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-blue</styleUrl>
