  <Placemark>
    <name>Salen Bike Park - Lindvallen (Dalarna, Sweden) [320 SEK]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Lindvallen 575 m - valley station of the Soderasen Express</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>SkiStar's gravity park at Lindvallen, eight lift-served trails covering the whole range. Valles DH is the short green to start on; Fru Melin, Rosa Leden, Herr Melin and Honeymoon are the blues; Pipeline and Charter the reds; and Sherpa the single black. Easy Ride adds another long, gentle line off the chair. Machine-built and rolling rather than steep and rooty, which suits the hill.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>A chairlift at Lindvallen carries riders and bikes. A day lift pass is 320 SEK for an adult in the regular periods (6-28 June and 5 August to 6 October) and 335 SEK in high season (29 June to 4 August); an all-inclusive day runs 345 SEK, and a trail-only pass 161 SEK. You need either the Mellan or the Stora SalenPasset to ride the park.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Early June to early October.<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Malung</td><td>Car</td><td>~50 min</td></tr><tr><td>Stockholm</td><td>Car</td><td>~4h30</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://www.skistar.com/sv/vara-skidorter/salen/sommar-i-salen/aktiviteter/cykling/downhill/">SkiStar Salen Bike Park</a>, <a href="https://www.skistar.com/sv/vara-skidorter/salen/sommar-i-salen/bike-trailpass/">SkiStar SalenPasset</a> and <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/">OpenStreetMap</a> for the trail names and geometry. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
