  <Placemark>
    <name>Ski Montcalm Bike Park (Quebec) [52 CAD]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Rawdon 210 m - valley station of the Bebe double chairlift</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Twenty-three trails on a small Lanaudiere hill: fourteen downhill runs and nine cross-country and enduro lines, plus a skills course and a pump track at the bottom. Mapped names include La Boreale, La Bleu and Lucky in the middle grades, La Familiale and La Foret Enchantee at the easy end, and La XL, Larry's, La Tornade, La Cachette, La Grande-Allee and Les Hauteurs among the harder ones. A bistro and terrace with local beer runs daily while the lift turns.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>A chairlift serves the slopes. Day pass 52 CAD adult, 45 CAD from 13:00; 46 CAD and 38 CAD for ages 13-21; season pass 275 CAD, or 240 CAD each in a family of three - which includes two free days at partner bike parks.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>From mid-July into mid-October, weekends and holidays, weather permitting - the hill closes for rain and says so on its site.<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Rawdon</td><td>Car</td><td>~10 min</td></tr><tr><td>Montreal</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h00</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://skimontcalm.com/billets-et-abonnements/velo-de-montagne/">Ski Montcalm mountain biking</a> and <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/">OpenStreetMap</a> for the trail names and geometry. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
