  <Placemark>
    <name>Zugerberg: top of the funicular</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Zugerberg 925 m - top of the funicular</b><br/><br/>Where the descent starts. See the main Zugerberg pin for trails, prices and access.]]></description>
