  <Placemark>
    <name>Afton Alps (Minnesota) [9 USD trail fee]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Afton 215 m - valley station of the Afton Alps chairlifts</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Over seven miles of intermediate to advanced singletrack threaded through a ski area in the St Croix river valley, under an hour from the Twin Cities, with the valley in view for much of it. Not a downhill park - singletrack on ski-hill ground.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/><b>No lift-served biking</b> despite the resort's seventeen chairs. A trail fee of 9 USD a day, and helmets are required.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>May through October, sunrise to sunset.<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Saint Paul</td><td>Car</td><td>~30 min</td></tr><tr><td>Minneapolis</td><td>Car</td><td>~45 min</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://www.aftonalps.com/explore/experience-afton-alps.aspx">Afton Alps Resort</a> and <a href="https://www.aftonalps.com/the-mountain/about-the-mountain/mountain-info.aspx">Afton Alps mountain info</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
