  <Placemark>
    <name>Hovden Bike Park (Setesdal, Norway) [140 NOK]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Hovden 820 m - valley station of the Hovden-expressen</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Around 52 marked trails at the head of the Setesdal valley, at least 5 of them blue, on roughly 360 m of lift-served vertical. Bare fell above the treeline, granite slabs and long light in midsummer; Hovden sits at 820 m in a part of Norway that feels considerably higher.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The Hovden-expressen chairlift from 820 m to 1180 m, with Breive-expressen and several drags on the other side. Day pass around 140 NOK.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Roughly late June to mid-September.<br/>Daily opening hours: 10:00-16:00<br/><small>Estimated; not yet checked against the operator.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Evje</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h30</td></tr><tr><td>Kristiansand</td><td>Car</td><td>~3h00</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://hovden.com/">Hovden - Setesdal</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-blue</styleUrl>
    <Point><coordinates>7.348930,59.569660,821</coordinates></Point>
