  <Placemark>
    <name>Hovden Bike Park: Downhill Easy</name>
    <description><![CDATA[2.8 km blue trail, dropping 362 m from 1179 m to 817 m at an average 13%. Graded blue because Hovden signs only blue trails - Steinbiten, Smakebiten and Originalen - and this single OpenStreetMap way is the whole lift-top-to-base descent they share; OSM records no colour for it, only <code>mtb:scale=2</code>, which is never read as a grade on this map. Geometry simplified from OpenStreetMap - indicative only, follow the signs on the ground. <i>Sources: <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/293117154">way 293117154</a> and the <a href="https://hovden.com/en/downhill-mountain-biking">operator trail list</a>.</i>]]></description>
