  <Placemark>
    <name>Bikepark Lipno (South Bohemia, Czech Republic) [check operator]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Lipno nad Vltavou 722 m - valley station of the Promenadni chairlift</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A flow-oriented park on the Kramolin slope above the Lipno reservoir, about 10 marked runs with at least 2 green and 5 blue - jump lines, berms and a large beginner and kids area rather than steep raw downhill. Vertical is modest, roughly 170 m, so the appeal is lap count and progression, not gradient.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The Promenadni four-seat chairlift from the lakeside up to Kramolin at about 894 m, with the Strecha chair alongside. Check the operator for the summer bike ticket.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Roughly May to mid-October.<br/>Daily opening hours: 10:00-17:00<br/><small>Estimated; not yet checked against the operator.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Ceske Budejovice</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h00</td></tr><tr><td>Linz</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h30</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.lipno.info/">Lipno</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
