  <Placemark>
    <name>Skolnity Bike Park (Wisla, Poland) [125 PLN]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Wisla 467 m - valley station of the Skolnity chairlift</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Around 9 marked runs on Skolnity above Wisla, at least one green and one blue alongside harder lines. Vertical is short, about 195 m, but the Beskid forest slope holds tight, rooty riding and the town has several other lift-served hills within a few kilometres.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The Skolnity chairlift from 467 m to about 662 m. Around 125 PLN for a day.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Roughly May to mid-October.<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-18:00<br/><small>Estimated; not yet checked against the operator.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Bielsko-Biala</td><td>Car</td><td>~50 min</td></tr><tr><td>Katowice</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h20</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://skolnity.pl/">Skolnity Ski and Bike Park</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
