  <Placemark>
    <name>Slotwiny Arena Bike Park (Krynica-Zdroj, Poland) [125 PLN]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Slotwiny 682 m - valley station of the Slotwiny Arena chairlift</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Ten kilometres of one-way, continuously maintained trail above Krynica-Zdroj, laid out as four routes: one green, two blue and one red. It is a new park and it shows in the shaping - everything is built and groomed rather than natural. Rental, a bike school and food at the base.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The Slotwiny Arena chairlift. Bike passes are sold by the day and as two- and three-day tickets, with single rides valid on any day of the season; the pass card carries a 10 PLN deposit refunded in cash.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Spring through autumn.<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Nowy Sacz</td><td>Car</td><td>~50 min</td></tr><tr><td>Krakow</td><td>Car</td><td>~2h00</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://slotwinyarena.pl/en/bike-park-2/">Slotwiny Arena Bike Park</a> and <a href="https://slotwinyarena.pl/en/price-lists/bike-park-tickets/">Slotwiny Arena bike pass prices</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
