  <Placemark>
    <name>Bike Park Palenica (Ustron, Poland) [99 PLN]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Ustron 430 m - valley station of the Palenica chairlift</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Four graded downhill trails on Palenica above Ustron, and the grading is honest. The green is the shallowest, built from berms and rollers and meant for learning body position, braking and line choice. The blue adds tables for jump practice. The red is fast and technical - jumps, but also roots and stone. The black, called Twoja Stara, is a proper downhill track: rock, roots, natural walls and drops. There is also a family line that any hardtail can handle.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The Palenica chairlift from ul. Wczasowa 78, with free parking at the base. All-day pass 110 PLN, or 99 PLN; a ten-ride card the same. The lift runs weekends 10:00-18:00 for walkers and riders.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Summer weekends.<br/>Daily opening hours: 10:00-18:00<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Bielsko-Biala</td><td>Car</td><td>~30 min</td></tr><tr><td>Katowice</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h10</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://palenica.ustron.pl/">Palenica Ustron</a> and <a href="https://palenica.ustron.pl/cennik/">Palenica Ustron prices</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-blue</styleUrl>
    <Point><coordinates>18.845650,49.703510,430</coordinates></Point>
    <ExtendedData xmlns:mwm="https://comaps.app">
      <mwm:properties>
