  <Placemark>
    <name>Vallasen Bike Park (Hallandsasen, Sweden) [310 SEK]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Vallasen 62 m - valley station of the Vallasen chairlift</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Around 16 marked runs on the Hallandsasen ridge in southern Sweden, at least 1 green and 3 blue. The lift-served drop is only about 140 m, so this is a lap-count park - beech forest, built jump lines and a long season by Nordic standards.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The Vallasen chairlift from about 62 m to 202 m, with the Kobenhavn chair and several drags on the same hill. Around 310 SEK for a day.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>The directory gives a 30 April start; roughly May to late October.<br/>Daily opening hours: 10:00-18:00<br/><small>Season start from the directory listing; hours estimated.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Helsingborg</td><td>Car</td><td>~45 min</td></tr><tr><td>Copenhagen</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h45</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://vallasen.se/">Vallasen</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-blue</styleUrl>
    <Point><coordinates>13.105600,56.385480,62</coordinates></Point>
    <ExtendedData xmlns:mwm="https://comaps.app">
      <mwm:properties>
