  <Placemark>
    <name>Drammen Skisenter Bike Park (Norway) [220 NOK]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Drammen 82 m - valley station of the Albjerk Ekspressen</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Small but well regarded: nine downhill trails on about 280 m of vertical, running from machine-built beginner lines to a black-graded race course. Flytloypa is the single blue - banked turns, drops and jumps, and the one most riders warm up on. Skimore has been building here since 2005, so the trails have had two decades of shaping.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The ski centre's lift. Rental covers 13 adult bikes in 29 and 27.5 inch, four youth 26 inch and three children's 24 inch; instructors are 490 NOK an hour for up to six people, booked at least three days ahead.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Through the summer: Wednesday 12:00-19:00, Thursday to Sunday 10:00-16:00.<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Drammen centre</td><td>Car</td><td>~15 min</td></tr><tr><td>Oslo</td><td>Car</td><td>~50 min</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://drammen.skimore.no/bikepark">Skimore Drammen Bike Park</a> and <a href="https://drammen.skimore.no/priser">Skimore Drammen prices</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
