  <Placemark>
    <name>Wisp Resort Bike Park (Maryland) [check operator]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>McHenry 771 m - valley station of chair 1</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Wisp runs a full mountain-bike season on the hill above Deep Creek Lake, and the riding extends into the Fork Run Recreation Area next door - over eight miles of singletrack and logging road. Named lines include High Roller, Easy Does It, Monkey Shine and Squirrel Cage, with a jump line in the Edgewood freeride park.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The resort's lift. Trail and lift passes are sold as all-day, half-day and season options; the season pass goes on sale the previous March. Summer bike rates are not printed on the site, so check for your date.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>The full summer season, and open to non-guests.<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Pittsburgh</td><td>Car</td><td>~2h15</td></tr><tr><td>Washington DC</td><td>Car</td><td>~3h15</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://www.wispresort.com/lift-tickets/">Wisp Resort tickets</a> and <a href="https://redbarnvacations.com/a-guide-to-mountain-biking-wisp-resort/">Guide to mountain biking Wisp</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-blue</styleUrl>
    <Point><coordinates>-79.361480,39.555180,771</coordinates></Point>
    <ExtendedData xmlns:mwm="https://comaps.app">
      <mwm:properties>
        <mwm:value key="spot">wisp</mwm:value>
