  <Placemark>
    <name>Centre Vorlage Bike Park (Wakefield, Quebec) [check operator]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Wakefield 121 m - valley station of the C chairlift</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A four-season outdoor centre in the Outaouais with a lift-served trail network, bike rental and a repair station on site. Beach volleyball and the Hub bistro at the base, which opens whenever the lift turns.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>A chairlift. Tickets are sold through the centre's own shop rather than printed on the site.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>23 May to 22 June, Saturday and Sunday 10:00-18:00; 25 June to 21 August, Thursday and Friday 12:00-20:00; 28 June to 23 August, Saturday and Sunday 10:00-18:00; then 23 August to late October, Saturday and Sunday 10:00-16:00.<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Ottawa</td><td>Car</td><td>~35 min</td></tr><tr><td>Montreal</td><td>Car</td><td>~2h30</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://centrevorlage.ca/">Centre Vorlage</a> and <a href="https://tourismeoutaouais.com/attraits/centre-vorlage-lete/">Tourisme Outaouais</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
