  <Placemark>
    <name>Manara Cliff Bike Park (Upper Galilee, Israel) [cable-car fare]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Kiryat Shmona 103 m - valley station of the Manara cliff cable car</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>By most accounts the only place in Israel offering a bike-park downhill experience, on the Naftali ridge above the Hula valley. The cable car stops at three stations, and alongside the riding there are BMX trails, a climbing wall, rappelling, a zip line and a 1200 m mountain slide - it is an adventure site with downhill in it rather than a dedicated bike park.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Israel's longest cable car, 1900 m, eight-passenger cabins, ten minutes from the edge of Kiryat Shmona up to Kibbutz Manara. A combined cable-car and slide ticket has been about 105 NIS; ask for the bike rate.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Year round, weather permitting.<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Kiryat Shmona</td><td>Car</td><td>~10 min</td></tr><tr><td>Tel Aviv</td><td>Car</td><td>~2h30</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://www.enjoyingisrael.com/attractions/6601/manara-cliff">Manara Cliff</a> and <a href="https://israeltripplanner.com/galilee/lower-galilee-attractions/manara-cliff">Israel Trip Planner - Manara Cliff</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
