  <Placemark>
    <name>Manzherok: top of the Vostok chairlift</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Vostok 1185 m - upper station on Malaya Sinyukha</b><br/><br/>
    Top of the mountain and of the bike park, reached by the Vostok chairlift from 905 m. The resort and the OSM station node both label it 1,240 m; the elevation service reads 1,185 m at the mapped top pylon. See the main Manzherok Bike Park pin for trails, prices and access.]]></description>
