  <Placemark>
    <name>Lofsdalen Bikepark (Harjedalen, Sweden) [320 SEK]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Lofsdalen 632 m - valley station of the Langen Express</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>About 8 marked runs in the Harjedalen fjell, at least 1 green and 2 blue. The Langen Express gives roughly 240 m, and the Toppen Express above it reaches 1072 m, so the full mountain carries about 440 m of vertical - open, treeless terrain at the top.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The Langen Express chairlift from 632 m to about 873 m, with the Toppen Express continuing to 1072 m. Around 320 SEK for a day.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Roughly late June to mid-September - a short northern window.<br/>Daily opening hours: 10:00-16:00<br/><small>Estimated; not yet checked against the operator.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Sveg</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h00</td></tr><tr><td>Ostersund</td><td>Car</td><td>~2h30</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.lofsdalen.com/sv">Lofsdalen</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
