  <Placemark>
    <name>Tanndalen Fjallcykelpark (Harjedalen, Sweden) [290 SEK]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Tanndalen 793 m - valley station of the Tannporten Express</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Fourteen trails and two technique areas spread across the mountain plateau above Tanndalen, dropping through mountain birch with long open views - flow and speed rather than steep technical ground.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Hamra Komfort, open daily 10:00-16:00 through the bike season: hook the bike on and you are at the top in a few minutes. The lift pass is the Funasfjallen one - it also covers Ramundberget's bike park and the summer-open lifts at Funasdalsberget, and throws in climbing, swimming, disc golf and paddling across the three villages.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Lift and bike park daily from 1 July to 16 August 2026.<br/>Daily opening hours: 10:00-16:00<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Funasdalen</td><td>Car</td><td>~20 min</td></tr><tr><td>Trondheim</td><td>Car</td><td>~4h00</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://www.tanndalen.com/cykling/taenndalen-fjaellcykelpark">Tanndalen Fjallcykelpark</a> and <a href="https://www.tanndalen.com/cykling/liftpass">Tanndalen lift pass</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-blue</styleUrl>
    <Point><coordinates>12.247060,62.561600,793</coordinates></Point>
    <ExtendedData xmlns:mwm="https://comaps.app">
      <mwm:properties>
