  <Placemark>
    <name>CK Ornen Downhill Park (Ornskoldsvik, Sweden) [check operator]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Ornskoldsvik 19 m - valley station of the chairlift</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Around 11 marked runs on a club-run hill in Ornskoldsvik, at least 2 blue. Only about 90 m of vertical, starting almost at sea level on the Gulf of Bothnia.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>A single chairlift from 19 m to about 107 m. Check the operator for the summer bike ticket - the directory lists no price, which for a club hill may mean it is free or members-only.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Roughly mid-May to the end of September.<br/>Daily opening hours: evenings and weekends<br/><small>Estimated; not yet checked against the operator.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Ornskoldsvik centre</td><td>Car</td><td>~10 min</td></tr><tr><td>Umea</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h30</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.ckornen.se/">CK Ornen</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
