  <Placemark>
    <name>Divcibare Bike Park (Serbia) [2400 RSD]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Divcibare 920 m - valley station of the Crni vrh chairlift</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Four trails of different technical grades off a modern cable car, covering beginners through to experienced riders. The Crni vrh line is the one that gets talked about - 850 m for about 180 m of drop, and a genuine downhill challenge. The DivciBar restaurant sits by the park, with the Carobna Suma children's zone next door.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>A two-seat cable car fitted with dedicated bike carriers, rated at 1200 people an hour.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>The resort runs the bike park year round.<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Valjevo</td><td>Car</td><td>~40 min</td></tr><tr><td>Belgrade</td><td>Car</td><td>~2h00</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://divcibareskiresort.com/bike-park/">Divcibare Ski Resort - Bike Park</a> and <a href="https://divcibareskiresort.com/biciklisticke-staze/">Divcibare cycling trails</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
