  <Placemark>
    <name>Ski Apache (Ruidoso, New Mexico) [25 USD gondola]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Ski Apache 2973 m - valley station of the Apache Arrow gondola</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>About 5.5 miles of purpose-built trail opened in 2013 on the Sierra Blanca, running at grades of six to eight percent - which tells you the character honestly: flowing and rideable rather than steep, with easier and harder options along the way. The setting is the draw, on Mescalero Apache land at up to 11,500 ft, and New Mexico's only gondola takes you there.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The gondola, 25 USD for a scenic ride. Mountain-bike rentals on site.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Summer weekends - Saturdays and Sundays - and weather dependent.<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Ruidoso</td><td>Car</td><td>~35 min</td></tr><tr><td>El Paso</td><td>Car</td><td>~3h00</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://skiapache.com/plan-your-trip/summer-activities/mountain-biking/">Ski Apache mountain biking</a> and <a href="https://www.discoverruidoso.com/info/summer-activities-ski-apache">Discover Ruidoso</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
