  <Placemark>
    <name>Kisa MTB Park (Kinda, Sweden) [389 SEK]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Kisa 116 m - valley station of the C drag lift</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Eight trails from blue to black on a 140 m hill in Ostergotland, with offshoots along the way that let you pick harder or easier lines mid-run. The longest is 1900 m.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Two tow lifts; the Poma has you at the top in under four minutes. Youth aged 7-16 pay 315 SEK for a day and 3500 SEK for a season.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>1 May to 8 November 2026. Saturday and Sunday 10:00-16:00 with a lunch break 12:30-13:30; Thursday to Sunday 10:00-16:00 in season, and Wednesday evenings 17:00-20:00 from mid-May until the light goes.<br/>Daily opening hours: 10:00-16:00<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Linkoping</td><td>Car</td><td>~50 min</td></tr><tr><td>Stockholm</td><td>Car</td><td>~2h45</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://kisamtbpark.com/">Kisa MTB Park</a> and <a href="https://kisamtbpark.com/oppettider/">Kisa MTB Park opening hours</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
