  <Placemark>
    <name>Vasjo Bikepark (Sollentuna, Sweden) [150 SEK]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Sollentuna 26 m - valley station of the drag lift</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>About 7 marked runs on the Vasjobacken hill north of Stockholm, at least 1 blue. Roughly 70 m of drag-served vertical - a local evening hill rather than a destination.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Drag lifts from 26 m to about 94 m. Around 150 SEK for a day.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Roughly May to the end of September.<br/>Daily opening hours: 16:00-21:00<br/><small>Estimated; not yet checked against the operator.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Stockholm centre</td><td>Car</td><td>~25 min</td></tr><tr><td>Sollentuna station</td><td>Bus</td><td>~15 min</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.vasjobikepark.com/">Vasjo Bikepark</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
