  <Placemark>
    <name>Bikepark Kosutka (Slovakia) [25 EUR]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Kosutka 1205 m - valley station of the drag lift</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>About 7 marked runs in the Vepor hills of central Slovakia, at least 2 green, 3 blue and 1 double-black. Roughly 150 m of drag-served vertical, but on a base already above 1200 m - high ground for a park this small.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>A Tatrapoma drag lift from 1205 m to about 1358 m, with a second drag alongside. Around 25 EUR for a day.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Roughly June to the end of September.<br/>Daily opening hours: 10:00-17:00<br/><small>Estimated; not yet checked against the operator.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Banska Bystrica</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h00</td></tr><tr><td>Bratislava</td><td>Car</td><td>~3h15</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://penzionkosutka.sk/sk/">Penzion Kosutka</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
