  <Placemark>
    <name>Bikepark Koliba (Bratislava, Slovakia) [9 EUR / 3 rides]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Zelezna studnicka 254 m - valley station of the Kamzik chairlift</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Four signed runs on the Kamzik hillside above Bratislava, all starting from the wooden ramp by the top station and finishing near Zelezna Studnicka - close enough to the city to be an after-work lap. <b>Blue Trail</b> (blue, 1560 m, 177 m of descent) is the easy one, banked curves, rollers and doubles through meadow and forest beside the chairlift. <b>Driver 8</b> (1350 m, 177 m) is the freeride run, with big berms, a gap, doubles and a wooden bridge; it is blazed <b>orange</b> on the trees, a grade this map's palette has no colour for, so it draws red. <b>Rohatka</b> (red, 1920 m, 225 m) is the original downhill and freeride line, open since 2005 - jumps, doubles, a road gap over a culvert, two steep rocky sections and a drop to finish. <b>Kamenak</b> (black, 1480 m, 225 m) is the hard one: stones, roots, stone stairs and three long steep sections pitching to 43 degrees. Runs are marked by paint on the trees in their own colour.<br/>Two further descents are drawn here that the park does not list and does not sign: <b>Krive Jarky Trail</b> and <b>Junkyard</b>, both mapped in OpenStreetMap on the same hillside. Junkyard carries no grade anywhere, so none is shown for it.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The Kamzik chairlift, about fifteen minutes to the top, running Tuesday to Sunday in summer. Nine euros buys three rides. <b>The trails themselves are free</b> - you are only paying for the lift.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Summer season.<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Bratislava centre</td><td>Bus</td><td>~20 min</td></tr><tr><td>Vienna</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h15</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://bikeparkkoliba.sk/?lang=en">Bikepark Koliba</a>, its per-trail pages (<a href="http://bikeparkkoliba.sk/trat-blue-trail/">Blue Trail</a>, <a href="http://bikeparkkoliba.sk/trat-driver-8/">Driver 8</a>, <a href="http://bikeparkkoliba.sk/trat-rohatka/">Rohatka</a>, <a href="http://bikeparkkoliba.sk/trat-kamenak/">Kamenak</a>) and <a href="https://bratislavaregion.travel/poi/5346/bikepark-koliba">Bratislava Region tourism</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
