  <Placemark>
    <name>Rincine Trail Area (Tuscany, Italy) [shuttle, book ahead]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Rincine 1043 m - trail-area hub in the Londa forest</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A trail area cut into the state forest of Rincine, just outside the Foreste Casentinesi national park and about 45 km from Florence. Firenze Freeride built it with the Valdarno e Valdisieve union of councils, the comune of Londa and the Model Forests association, and it is a proper trail centre rather than a couple of lines - several dedicated MTB tracks, alongside 26 km of newer walking and thematic paths and a play area.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/><b>No lift.</b> A shuttle van runs at weekends and must be booked in advance; otherwise pedal.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Through the riding season, with shuttle weekends by registration.<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Florence</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h00</td></tr><tr><td>Londa</td><td>Car</td><td>~20 min</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://firenzefreeride.org/rincine-trail-area">Firenze Freeride - Rincine Trail Area</a> and <a href="https://www.uc-valdarnoevaldisieve.fi.it/eventi-notizie/i-sentieri-della-foresta-di-rincine">Unione dei Comuni Valdarno e Valdisieve</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
