        <mwm:value key="closed_from">11-30</mwm:value>
      </mwm:properties>
      <mwm:icon>Mountain</mwm:icon>
      <mwm:visibility>1</mwm:visibility>
    </ExtendedData>
  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>La Sorrera Bike Park (La Garriga, Catalonia) [shuttle forfait]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>La Garriga 311 m - trail area in the Congost valley</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Downhill and enduro half an hour from Barcelona: four tracks, one of them with four variants, which works out as a green, two blues, three reds, a black and a World Cup line. An E-MX park and a skills area sit alongside, and e-MTBs can be hired.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/><b>No lift - the forfait is the shuttle.</b> 4x4s with trailers run you to the top as many times as you like between 09:00 and 14:30.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Wednesday to Sunday 09:00-14:30. Groups of six or more can also book Monday to Wednesday.<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-14:30<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Barcelona</td><td>Car</td><td>~45 min</td></tr><tr><td>La Garriga station</td><td>Train + bike</td><td>~15 min</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://www.lasorrerabikepark.com/la-sorrera-bike-park/">La Sorrera Bike Park</a> and <a href="https://www.redbull.com/es-es/bike-spot-check-la-sorrera-bikepark">Red Bull spot check</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-brown</styleUrl>
    <Point><coordinates>2.275470,41.688940,311</coordinates></Point>
