  <Placemark>
    <name>4 Riders Bike Park (Berga, Catalonia) [30 EUR]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>4 Riders Bike Park 750 m - shuttle base at the foot of the Figuerassa</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>About 8 marked runs at the foot of the Pre-Pyrenees, at least 2 green and 1 blue. Four of the park's own lines are drawn here, the ones OpenStreetMap marks one-way and bike-designated: <b>The Wave</b> (red), <b>Hard Line</b> and <b>Intense</b> (black, both S5) and <b>Rumblebikes</b> (black), all dropping from around 900-930 m back to the base at 750 m. The graded network continues above them to about 1420 m on the Figuerassa ridge, so the full available descent is close to 700 m.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>No lift. Uplift is by shuttle, around 30 EUR for a day.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Roughly March to the end of November.<br/>Daily opening hours: daylight hours<br/><small>Estimated; not yet checked against the operator.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Berga</td><td>Car</td><td>~10 min</td></tr><tr><td>Barcelona</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h30</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://4ridersbikepark.com/">4Riders Bike Park</a>. Pin placed on the OSM-mapped <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/node/11327770197">4 Riders Bike Park</a> (node 11327770197), measured at 750 m. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
