    <name>Racepark Schulenberg: Urbaner Weg</name>
    <description><![CDATA[0.6 km blue trail, dropping 27 m from 545 m to 514 m at an average 5%. Geometry simplified from OpenStreetMap - indicative only, follow the signs on the ground. <i>Source: <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/822832716">way 822832716</a>.</i>]]></description>
