  <Placemark>
    <name>Bikepark Burladingen (Swabian Alb, Germany) [25 EUR]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Burladingen 744 m - valley station of the Skilift Burladingen</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A small park on the Swabian Alb, at least 1 green and 1 blue. Roughly 160 m of drag-served vertical on a short, wooded slope; OpenStreetMap carries a further graded network across the hill above.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The Skilift Burladingen t-bar from 744 m to about 904 m. Around 25 EUR for a day.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Roughly April to the end of October.<br/>Daily opening hours: 10:00-18:00<br/><small>Estimated; not yet checked against the operator.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Reutlingen</td><td>Car</td><td>~40 min</td></tr><tr><td>Stuttgart</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h15</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.burladingen.de/startseite">Stadt Burladingen</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
