  <Placemark>
    <name>Bikepark Beerfelden (Odenwald, Germany) [28.50 EUR]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Beerfelden 453 m - the bike park on the Krahberg</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>About 7 marked runs in the Odenwald, at least 3 blue - a long-established German park with a strong dirt-jump and freeride reputation. OpenStreetMap names the site itself Bikepark Beerfelden and carries around 40 graded ways across the hill.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>No aerialway is mapped here; the hill's ski lift serves the winter slope and uplift for bikes is by shuttle. Around 28.50 EUR for a day - confirm what that buys.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>The directory gives a 20 March start; roughly late March to mid-November, a long season on a low hill.<br/>Daily opening hours: 10:00-18:00<br/><small>Season start from the directory listing; hours estimated.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Heidelberg</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h00</td></tr><tr><td>Frankfurt</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h15</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="http://www.bikepark-beerfelden.de/de/">Bikepark Beerfelden</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
