  <Placemark>
    <name>Bikepark Osternohe (Franconia, Germany) [23 EUR]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Osternohe 411 m - the ski lift and bike park above Schnaittach</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>About 3 marked runs, at least 1 green and 1 blue, but OpenStreetMap names considerably more on the hill - a Blue Line, a Downhill, a Freeride and a Wurzeltrail, plus a dirt park and pumptrack at the base. A small, steep Franconian hill with a long-running scene.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The site is mapped as Skilift und Bikepark Osternohe, but no aerialway way is present in OpenStreetMap, so treat the uplift as unconfirmed - shuttle or the winter drag lift. Around 23 EUR for a day.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Roughly April to the end of October.<br/>Daily opening hours: 10:00-18:00<br/><small>Estimated; not yet checked against the operator.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Nuremberg</td><td>Car</td><td>~35 min</td></tr><tr><td>Schnaittach</td><td>Car</td><td>~10 min</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.bikepark-osternohe.de/">Bikepark Osternohe</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
