    <name>Flowtrail Stromberg: No Jokes Trail</name>
    <description><![CDATA[1.0 km black trail, dropping 71 m from 382 m to 297 m at an average 7%. Geometry simplified from OpenStreetMap - indicative only, follow the signs on the ground. <i>Source: <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/105490856">way 105490856</a>, <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/156923094">way 156923094</a>, <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/168256605">way 168256605</a>, <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/168256608">way 168256608</a>, <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/198505206">way 198505206</a>.</i>]]></description>
