  <Placemark>
    <name>Vangaberget Trailcenter (Kristianstad, Sweden) [check operator]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Vangaberget 166 m - the hill north of Kristianstad</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Vangaberget works as a trail centre rather than a lift-served park - the riding is there year round, and it is the uplift that is occasional. Worth confirming the day before you go.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/><b>No scheduled lift.</b> The hill has run uplift only on selected occasions, so plan on pedalling unless the operator has announced a lift day.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Trails open through the season; lift days by announcement.<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Kristianstad</td><td>Car</td><td>~25 min</td></tr><tr><td>Malmo</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h30</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://happyride.se/sveriges-basta-bikeparks/">Happyride guide to Swedish bike parks</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
