  <Placemark>
    <name>Akersjon Bikepark (Jamtland, Sweden) [150 SEK]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Akersjon 521 m - the ski slope above the lake</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>About 7 marked runs, at least 1 green and 1 blue, on a remote fjell hill in Jamtland near the Norwegian border. OpenStreetMap has the winter-sports area here as Akersjons Skidbacke, reaching about 634 m - roughly 110 m of drop, on open northern terrain with a very short season.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>No aerialway is mapped; uplift is most likely the winter drag lift or a shuttle. Around 150 SEK for a day.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Roughly late June to mid-September - the shortest window of any Swedish park here.<br/>Daily opening hours: daylight hours<br/><small>Estimated; not yet checked against the operator.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Ostersund</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h45</td></tr><tr><td>Trondheim</td><td>Car</td><td>~3h00</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://akersjon.se/">Akersjon</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
