  <Placemark>
    <name>Lake Mountain Bike Park (Victoria, Australia) [free entry, 38 AUD shuttle]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Lake Mountain 1350 m - the alpine resort plateau above Marysville</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Forty-six kilometres of trail across seven alpine summit routes - three green, two blue and two black - but the reason people come is Cascades: close to 30 km of flowing descent from the top of Lake Mountain through alpine forest all the way down to Marysville. Very few descents anywhere run that long.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/><b>No lift - a shuttle.</b> The Lake Mountain Shuttle runs from the rear car park of Peppers Hotel in Marysville and drops riders near the Cascades trailhead: 38 AUD for the first session, 19 AUD for extra runs bought on the day. <b>Entry to the resort itself is free in summer.</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>November to late April, snow permitting - the reverse of the ski season.<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Marysville</td><td>Car</td><td>~30 min</td></tr><tr><td>Melbourne</td><td>Car</td><td>~2h15</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://lakemountainresort.com.au/summer/activities/mountain-biking/">Lake Mountain Alpine Resort - mountain biking</a> and <a href="https://lakemountainresort.com.au/entry-tickets/mtb-shuttle-service/">Lake Mountain MTB shuttle service</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
