  <Placemark>
    <name>Meri-Teijo Bike Park (Teijo, Finland) [29 EUR]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Teijo 10 m - bottom of the Meri-Teijo drag lift</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>One of the best lift-served hills in southern Finland, on the edge of Teijo national park, and popular enough that it draws riders from across the region. The trail set leans downhill but leaves plenty for enduro and trail riders. Bike rental and guiding on site.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>A lift carries riders and bikes; the park sells lift tickets on their own or bundled with a bike and a guide. Prices are quoted by the park - mtbp@meriteijobikepark.com or +358 40 503 4215.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>The Finnish summer season.<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Salo</td><td>Car</td><td>~30 min</td></tr><tr><td>Turku</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h00</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://meriteijobikepark.com/">Meri-Teijo Bike Park</a> and <a href="https://ski.fi/bikeparkfinland/bikeparkit/meri-teijo-bike-park/">Bikepark Finland</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
