  <Placemark>
    <name>La Fenasosa Bike Park (Alicante, Spain) [18 EUR]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>La Fenasosa 945 m - the finca above Banyeres de Mariola</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Around 28 marked runs, at least 4 green and 9 blue. One of the best-known Spanish gravity parks, on a private estate in the Alicante hinterland - dry, dusty, fast, and high enough at 945 m to be ridable through the summer. OpenStreetMap has the site mapped as La Fenasosa Bike Park.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>No lift. Uplift is by shuttle. Around 18 EUR for a day.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>The directory gives an 11 June start; the ground is ridable most of the year, with high summer hot and the winter cool but dry.<br/>Daily opening hours: daylight hours<br/><small>Season start from the directory listing; hours estimated. Shuttle days are booked in advance.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Alcoy</td><td>Car</td><td>~30 min</td></tr><tr><td>Alicante</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h00</td></tr><tr><td>Valencia</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h30</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.lafenasosa.es/">La Fenasosa Bikepark</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-brown</styleUrl>
