  <Placemark>
    <name>Kokonniemi Bike Park (Porvoo, Finland) [25 EUR]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Porvoo 12 m - bottom of the Kokonniemi drag lifts</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A lift-up, gravity-down park on the west bank of the Porvoo river, practically in town. The winter hill has five pistes and five lifts, all floodlit, and in summer the same slopes carry bike routes graded for different abilities. It is packaged as Kokonniemi Summer alongside an adventure park, with a cafe and rental at the base.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The ski lifts carry riders and bikes.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>The Finnish summer season.<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Porvoo centre</td><td>Car</td><td>~10 min</td></tr><tr><td>Helsinki</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h00</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://www.porvooski.fi/">Porvoo Ski - Kokonniemi</a> and <a href="https://ski.fi/en/ski-resorts-in-finland/kokonniemi/">Ski.fi - Kokonniemi</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
