  <Placemark>
    <name>Armkhi Bike Park (Ingushetia, Russia) [1000 RUB]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Armkhi 1259 m - valley station of the chairlift</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A year-round bike park in the Dzheyrakh gorge with two trails: a 200 m practice line and a 1200 m intermediate descent with 250 m of drop. Its Green Line has hosted downhill competition, and the park works as a training base for beginners and racers alike.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>A chairlift and a drag lift. One ascent 150 RUB, a day pass 1000 RUB, and ten ascents on the practice line 300 RUB. Protective kit hires for 300-1000 RUB by the hour or day.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Year round.<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Vladikavkaz</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h00</td></tr><tr><td>Magas</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h30</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://www.kp.ru/russia/ingushetiya/mesta/gornolyzhnyj-kurort-armhi/">Armkhi mountain resort</a> and <a href="https://skiings.ru/armxi.html">Skiings.ru - Armkhi</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
