  <Placemark>
    <name>Cerduo Bike Park (Pucon, Chile) [3000-10000 CLP]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>El Cerduo 229 m - the bike park outside Pucon</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A private park 12 km from Pucon at the foot of the north face of Villarrica volcano, near the airfield, with trails across a range of levels and genuinely varied ground - the Puma-Carpintero loop is about 8.5 km. Entry also buys the walking trails to the Rio Turbio waterfalls, and there are pools to swim in afterwards.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/><b>No lift.</b> Entry has been quoted between 3000 and 10000 CLP a person depending on the source, and includes private parking, toilets, the waterfall trails and picnic areas. Tours, a hot tub and camping cost extra. Contact +56 9 5600 8403.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>The Chilean riding season.<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Pucon</td><td>Car</td><td>~10 min</td></tr><tr><td>Temuco</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h30</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://www.instagram.com/cerduobikepark/">Cerduo Bike Park</a> and <a href="https://www.andeshandbook.org/senderismo/ruta/1167/Cascadas_del_rio_Turbio">Andeshandbook - Parque El Cerduo</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
