    <Placemark>
    <name>Bike Park Olomouc (Moravia, Czech Republic) [free]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Moravia 233 m - Bike Park Olomouc</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A city dirt park on the eastern edge of Olomouc: several lines over clay and timber features of mixed difficulty, from rollable jumps up to bigger doubles. Free to ride, and busy on summer evenings - the operator runs coached sessions alongside open riding.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>No lift. Push or pedal back up.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>April to October. Hours shift with the daylight: 09:00-19:00 in April, 09:00-20:00 in May, 09:00-21:00 June to August, 09:00-19:00 in September and 09:00-18:00 in October.<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Olomouc</td><td>Car</td><td>~20 min</td></tr><tr><td>Brno</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h15</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://bikeparkolomouc.cz">Bike Park Olomouc</a> and <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/1169165754">OSM way 1169165754</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
