  <Placemark>
    <name>DAV Bikepark Wetzlar (Hesse, Germany) [free]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Hesse 268 m - DAV Bikepark Wetzlar</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A wave-shaped pump-style track of hills, berms and jumps that can be ridden without pedalling, built by the Wetzlar section of the German Alpine Club next to the Cube climbing centre. Suitable from beginner up. Riding in both directions is allowed, so watch for oncoming riders.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>No lift - the track is built to be pumped rather than pedalled.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>1 April to 30 October, extended in good weather. Closed after heavy rain to protect the surface. Free, with donations toward upkeep.<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Giessen</td><td>Car</td><td>~20 min</td></tr><tr><td>Frankfurt</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h00</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://www.dav-wetzlar.de/service/bikepark">DAV Sektion Wetzlar</a> and <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/1465671865">OSM way 1465671865</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
