  <Placemark>
    <name>Bike Park dell'Angelo - Tarvisio (Friuli) [chairlift fare]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Tarvisio 784 m - valley station of the Seggiovia dell'Angelo</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Two trails off the top of the Angelo chairlift above Tarvisio, split by ability: the blue Squirrel line is the medium-easy way down and the second is for riders who already have off-road experience. The flow trail here was a notable addition when it opened, and the Fun Area dell'Angelo at the base rounds out the site.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The Angelo chairlift up to Poggio del Combattente at 943 m. Access to the bike park means buying a chairlift ticket with the bike.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Monday to Saturday 09:00-17:15, Sunday 08:30-18:15.<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:15<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Tarvisio</td><td>Car</td><td>~15 min</td></tr><tr><td>Villach</td><td>Car</td><td>~40 min</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://www.tarvisiano.org/en/Summer-World/Bike-World/Bike-park">Tarvisiano - bike park</a> and <a href="https://www.turismofvg.it/it/montagna365/fun-park-dell-angelo">Turismo FVG - Fun Park dell'Angelo</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
