  <Placemark>
    <name>Velorium Bikepark (Limburg, Netherlands) [check operator]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Limburg 56 m - Velorium Bikepark</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A commercial park at Maastrichterweg 7 outside Maastricht, opened in 2023, in the one corner of the Netherlands with any relief. The operator grades its routes by colour and charges for entry, but does not publish the trail list or tariffs on a page that could be read here - contact them directly.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>No lift. Push or pedal back up.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open through the year; hours not published in a readable form.<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Maastricht</td><td>Car</td><td>~25 min</td></tr><tr><td>Aachen</td><td>Car</td><td>~30 min</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://www.velorium.nl/">Velorium</a> and <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/23856764">OSM way 23856764</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-brown</styleUrl>
    <Point><coordinates>5.727340,50.818390,56</coordinates></Point>
