  <Placemark>
    <name>Trailcenter Wien - Hohe Wand Wiese (Vienna, Austria) [12 EUR]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Vienna 253 m - bottom of the Hohe Wand Wiese drag lift</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Vienna's own trail centre, on the old ski hill at the edge of the Wienerwald, and a genuinely full offering for something inside a city: twelve to thirteen trails from beginner to professional, including a Family Uphill, an e-bike uphill, the Kenda Airline jumpline and technical lines for experienced riders.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>An MTB drag lift runs for most of the year, and an MTB shuttle operates during the summer holidays. Trail entry without the lift is 12 EUR a day; the drag lift is from 6.50 EUR a ride. Season passes are sold with and without lift access, and the NO-Card gives free entry.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>March to October.<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Vienna centre</td><td>Public transport</td><td>~45 min</td></tr><tr><td>Vienna centre</td><td>Car</td><td>~30 min</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://www.hohewandwiese.com/">Trailcenter Wien - Hohe Wand Wiese</a> and <a href="https://www.hohewandwiese.com/tickets/">Hohe Wand Wiese tickets</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
