  <Placemark>
    <name>Black Mountain Bikepark - Elstra (Saxony) [35 EUR]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Elstra 292 m - valley station of the Schwarzenberg drag lift</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Five built lines on the Schwarzenberg, a 413 m hill in the Westlausitz, and the operator sorts them by character rather than colour. Rough and fast: Parkline (1000 m), Freeride (800 m) and the Pro-Line (1200 m), which adds the airtime. Flow and style: the Jumpline, 950 m. Smooth and flowing: the Flowline at 1500 m, the longest here and the one to start on. A bistro sits at the foot of the hill.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>A drag lift climbs the 120 m from the base at 292 m to the top at 412 m. Day ticket 35 EUR, or 32 EUR for children, students, seniors and disabled riders.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>April to November, weather permitting. Saturdays, Sundays and holidays 10:00-18:00 - the site carries a live open/closed indicator worth checking before you drive.<br/>Daily opening hours: 10:00-18:00<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Kamenz</td><td>Car</td><td>~15 min</td></tr><tr><td>Dresden</td><td>Car</td><td>~50 min</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.black-mountain-bikepark.de/">Black Mountain Bikepark Elstra</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-blue</styleUrl>
    <Point><coordinates>14.114940,51.217460,292</coordinates></Point>
    <ExtendedData xmlns:mwm="https://comaps.app">
