    <name>Monarch Crest: Rainbow Trail</name>
    <description><![CDATA[17.8 km of narrow rolling singletrack from the Silver Creek junction 2886 m north-east to the western trailhead at 2589 m, where dirt road leads out to Highway 285. Geometry simplified from OpenStreetMap - indicative only. Sources: <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/105225412">way 105225412</a>.]]></description>
