  <Placemark>
    <name>Monarch Crest Trail: Marshall Pass</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Marshall Pass 3319 m - halfway point on the crest</b><br/><br/>
    Where the Monarch Crest Trail meets the old railroad grade and the Colorado Trail carries on south towards the Silver Creek turn. The bail-out: Marshall Pass Road drops east to Poncha Springs from here.]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-gray</styleUrl>
    <Point><coordinates>-106.247068,38.391290,3319</coordinates></Point>
    <ExtendedData xmlns:mwm="https://comaps.app"><mwm:properties><mwm:value key="spot">us-monarch-crest-trail</mwm:value></mwm:properties><mwm:icon>None</mwm:icon><mwm:visibility>1</mwm:visibility></ExtendedData>
  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Monarch Crest Trail: Rainbow Trail exit</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Rainbow Trail western trailhead 2589 m - end of the singletrack</b><br/><br/>
    Where the Rainbow Trail ends and dirt road runs out to Highway 285 and Poncha Springs. See the main Monarch Crest Trail pin for the route, shuttles and season.]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-gray</styleUrl>
    <Point><coordinates>-106.105040,38.445060,2589</coordinates></Point>
    <ExtendedData xmlns:mwm="https://comaps.app"><mwm:properties><mwm:value key="spot">us-monarch-crest-trail</mwm:value></mwm:properties><mwm:icon>None</mwm:icon><mwm:visibility>1</mwm:visibility></ExtendedData>
  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Sorata: Paso Illampu descent</name>
    <description><![CDATA[13.6 km descent losing 1922 m from Paso Illampu 4724 m to Sorata 2802 m, on unpaved paths, tracks and dirt roads. Geometry simplified from OpenStreetMap - indicative only, the singletrack variants used by local operators are not mapped. Sources: <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/130852014">way 130852014</a>, <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/130852017">way 130852017</a>, <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/230062862">way 230062862</a>, <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/517109619">way 517109619</a>, <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/517109621">way 517109621</a>, <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/517109754">way 517109754</a> and others.]]></description>
