  <Placemark>
    <name>Sorata MTB: Sorata town, end of the descents</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Sorata 2802 m - where the descents finish</b><br/><br/>
    The valley town below Illampu, and the base for the shuttles. See the main Sorata MTB pin for routes, shuttles and season.]]></description>
