  <Placemark>
    <name>Avoriaz Bike Park (Portes du Soleil, FR) [39 EUR]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Avoriaz 1800 m - the car-free village at the middle of the Portes du Soleil</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>19 marked downhill runs, half of them flow and half tech, over four linked sectors. Super Morzine is the biggest and the best known, with Cap Canaveral and the Grosse Bert' jump; Seraussaix is the flow side, with L'Alpage and Soylent Green; Proclou drops straight off the village, from the easy Fourmiz to the red Walibi; Lindarets is the technical one, alternating clay, roots and rock. There is also a freestyle area with an MTB airbag, two enduro / e-bike loops, and the beginners' Pop Corn Park on the Ecoles lift (5 July - 31 August, 09:30-12:00 and 13:00-17:00).<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>About a dozen lifts and no shuttle buses: the Prodains Express 3S up from the Morzine valley, then Proclou, Seraussaix, Zore, Lindarets, Prolays, Chaux Fleurie and Ardent inside the park. Portes du Soleil summer bike pass 39 EUR a day, 449 EUR a season (adult web rate) - the same ticket as Morzine, Les Gets, Chatel and Champery.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 12 June; closed from 13 September. Partial opening 12-25 June, full opening 26 June - 30 August, partial again 31 August - 13 September; the Prodains cable car runs 26 June - 30 August.<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:15 (Super Morzine gondola), Zore chairlift 09:10-17:00; both run to 19:00 on Fridays from 10 July to 21 August.<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Geneva airport</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h30</td></tr><tr><td>Morzine</td><td>Prodains Express 3S</td><td>~5 min</td></tr><tr><td>Lausanne</td><td>Car</td><td>~2h00</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://www.avoriaz.com/en/summer-activities/on-bike/dh-mtb/">Avoriaz Bike Park</a>, <a href="https://www.avoriaz.com/en/summer-activities/on-bike/timetables--openings--avoriaz-bike-park-and-portes-du-soleil/">Avoriaz lift timetables</a> and <a href="https://www.lesgets.com/forfaits/tarifs-forfaits-ete/">Portes du Soleil summer pass prices</a>. Pin on <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/node/307509261">OpenStreetMap node 307509261</a>.
    Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-blue</styleUrl>
