  <Placemark>
    <name>Trailpark Bukovka - Bukova Hora (Czechia) [check operator]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Cervena Voda 552 m - valley station of the Bukova hora chairlift</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Five built trails plus a 120 m pumptrack on the Cervena Voda side of Bukova hora, in the Orlicke mountains. Flow Trail is a 7.5 km blue built for families and first-timers, Blinduro a 2.5 km red through natural forest, and Trail Pod Lanem a 2.1 km black with the steep, technical sections; Mini Blue and Mini Red are shorter jump-and-berm lines. About 410 m of lift-served vertical.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The Bukova hora chairlift from 552 m to 960 m carries bikes. The resort publishes its summer tariff on its own price list rather than in any directory - check skibukovka.cz before travelling.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>The bike season opens 1 May. Weekends in May, then chairlift and trailpark through the summer holidays, with September and October operation announced separately each year.<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:30-17:00<br/><small>Season and hours from the resort's own operating announcements.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Pardubice</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h15</td></tr><tr><td>Prague</td><td>Car</td><td>~2h30</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.skibukovka.cz/cz/trailpark-bukovka">Horsky Resort Bukova Hora</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-blue</styleUrl>
    <Point><coordinates>16.732420,50.005940,552</coordinates></Point>
    <ExtendedData xmlns:mwm="https://comaps.app">
      <mwm:properties>
        <mwm:value key="spot">bukova-hora</mwm:value>
        <mwm:value key="tags">beginner expert bike-park dh enduro chairlift</mwm:value>
        <mwm:value key="open_from">05-01</mwm:value>
        <mwm:value key="closed_from">10-31</mwm:value>
      </mwm:properties>
      <mwm:icon>Mountain</mwm:icon>
      <mwm:visibility>1</mwm:visibility>
    </ExtendedData>
  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Trailpark Bukovka: top of the Bukova hora chairlift</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Bukova hora 960 m - top of the Bukova hora chairlift</b><br/><br/>Where the descents start. See the main Trailpark Bukovka pin for trails, prices and access.]]></description>
