  <Placemark>
    <name>Pylypets Sky &amp; Bike Park (Zakarpattia, Ukraine) [300 UAH]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Pylypets 735 m - valley station of the Borzhava chairlift</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Six downhill lines on the Borzhava ridge in the Ukrainian Carpathians, from forest doubletrack to steep technical descents with kickers, rock features and wooden bridges over the gullies. The bike park starts a few metres from the top station. About 425 m of lift-served vertical.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The Borzhava chairlift from 735 m to 1160 m, fitted with bike carriers. Around 300 UAH for a day; the lift runs daily through the summer.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>The Carpathian summer season.<br/>Daily opening hours: 10:00-18:00<br/><small>Price and hours from Ukrainian resort listings; confirm with the operator.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Mukachevo</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h30</td></tr><tr><td>Lviv</td><td>Car</td><td>~4h00</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.pylypets.com/">Pylypets</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-blue</styleUrl>
