  <Placemark>
    <name>Pylypets: top of the Borzhava chairlift</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Borzhava 1160 m - top of the Borzhava chairlift</b><br/><br/>Where the descents start; the bike park begins a few metres from the station. See the main Pylypets pin for trails, prices and access.]]></description>
