    <description><![CDATA[0.8 km red, difficult descent in the Menton hinterland, dropping 151 m from 887 m to 736 m. Difficulty from the OpenStreetMap S2 technical grade, the hardest section on the line. OpenStreetMap records no name for this trail, so it is titled for where it starts and ends. Geometry simplified from OpenStreetMap - indicative only, and these are shared public paths: check access and give way on foot traffic. Source: <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/540175319">way 540175319</a>, <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/409316063">way 409316063</a>.]]></description>
