  <Placemark>
    <name>Plein Air Sutton (Quebec) [22 CAD trails, lift extra]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Plein Air Sutton 426 m - the network's own base chalet below Mont Sutton</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Forty-seven kilometres of trail in the Eastern Townships, of which about 32 km is enduro reached by five climbs, 8 km cross-country and 7 km double-width. The operator splits the network 30% beginner, 50% intermediate and 20% advanced and expert. Character is natural Quebec hardwood singletrack - roots, granite slab and long rolling descents - rather than a groomed bike park, but there are three purpose-built jumplines, the 900 m beginner Aweille en l'air, a 725 m intermediate and a 200 m mini line. The longest single descent mapped here, Grande Seduction, runs over 5 km.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Trail access is 22 CAD for adults and 15 CAD for juniors 6-17 at the web rate, with a 62 CAD family ticket and under-5s free. The Mont Sutton chairlift carries bikes but is not included: it needs individual ride tickets or the Enduro add-on on a season pass. E-bikes are allowed. Most of the network is pedalled, using the five marked climbs.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 16 May; closed from 18 October (2026 season). Chairlift from 27 June, daily to 23 August, then weekends only until 18 October.<br/>Lift hours: 10:30-17:00<br/><small>Lift dates shift with conditions; the trails open before the chair does.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Montreal</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h30</td></tr><tr><td>Sherbrooke</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h05</td></tr></table><br/><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.pleinairsutton.ca/">Plein air Sutton</a>. Pin placed on the <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/419024045">Plein-air Sutton base building</a> (OSM way 419024045).
    Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-green</styleUrl>
    <Point><coordinates>-72.576657,45.099522,426</coordinates></Point>
