  <Placemark>
    <name>Sugarloaf: West Branch</name>
    <description><![CDATA[1.1 km blue, moderate trail on the Sugarloaf mountainside, dropping 78 m from 529 m to 451 m. Difficulty from the OpenStreetMap IMBA grade 2. This is one of the mountain's older graded trails, not one of the bike park's machine-built runs - those are not in OpenStreetMap yet - so check the park's current trail map for what is open and lift-served. Geometry simplified from OpenStreetMap - indicative only. Source: <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/372661124">way 372661124</a> and <a href="https://www.sugarloaf.com/bike-park">Sugarloaf Bike Park</a>.]]></description>
