  <Placemark>
    <name>Gorge de Coaticook: La descente du Kilomètre</name>
    <description><![CDATA[0.5 km blue, moderate trail at Parc de la Gorge de Coaticook, dropping 44 m from 353 m to 309 m. Difficulty from the OpenStreetMap IMBA grade 2, which at this park describes how technical the trail is rather than how steep. One of only three lines here with enough sustained descent to count as gravity; the rest of the 23 km network is rolling cross-country. Geometry simplified from OpenStreetMap - indicative only. Source: <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/608719553">way 608719553</a>, <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/1034340663">way 1034340663</a> and <a href="https://gorgedecoaticook.qc.ca/en/summer-activities/mountain-bike/">Parc de la Gorge de Coaticook</a>.]]></description>
