  <Placemark>
    <name>Vercorin (Valais) [39 CHF / Magic Pass]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Vercorin 1312 m - valley station of the Cret-du-Midi gondola</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Eight signed lines, 1 green, 4 blue and 3 red, stacked on one gondola for close to 1000 m of near-continuous built descent - a lot for a station this size. Flow rather than steep or technical: berms, tables and step-ups threaded between the larches, and no black line. The ridge trails traverse south towards Orzival instead of dropping. Odd one out is La Reche, a separate red in the gorge above Rechy at valley level, well below the lift. A pumptrack at Lavioz is the warm-up.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The Vercorin - Sigeroulaz - Cret-du-Midi gondola carries bikes; a day pass at the bike and paraglider rate is 39 CHF for adults, 33 CHF young adult and 24 CHF child, and a single ascent is 16 CHF. Magic Pass holders ride the Val d'Anniviers lifts free in summer with no surcharge for the bike. Note that the separate Chalais - Vercorin cable car, which is how you arrive without a car, is 7.20 CHF each way and is not covered by the Magic Pass in summer.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 13 June (weekends 13-14 and 20-21 June), then daily from 27 June; closed from 25 October (2026 season).<br/>Gondola hours: 09:00-17:00, last ascent 16:45<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Sierre</td><td>Bus + cable car</td><td>~35 min</td></tr><tr><td>Sion</td><td>Car</td><td>~35 min</td></tr></table><br/><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.vercorin.ch/en/Z15270/bikeen">Vercorin</a>. Pin placed on the OSM-mapped <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/156291724">Telecabine Vercorin - Cret-du-Midi</a> valley station (way 156291724), verified at 1312 m. Trail lines drawn in gpx.studio and supplied for this map, simplified to ~8 m.
    Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-blue</styleUrl>
