  <Placemark>
    <name>Morgins (Portes du Soleil, CH) [24 CHF, bike included]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Morgins 1316 m - valley station of the Morgins-Foilleuse gondola</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>The Swiss end of the Portes du Soleil that most riders drive past. Four signed downhill runs drop off La Foilleuse at 1850 m, each with about 480 m of vertical: n.07 La Carigole (blue, 3.2 km), n.08 La Quatreans (green to blue, 2.5 km), n.09 Le Madze (red, 2.6 km) and n.10 La Tobogane (red, 2.3 km). Morgins is known within the area for long fast berms and steep pitches rather than big jump lines. It shares the Bikepark Champery - Les Crosets - Morgins ticket, 11 runs over four bike-carrying lifts, and over the Corbeau sector it links straight into Chatel and the French half of the 600 km Portes du Soleil network - which makes it a good, quiet place to start a full circuit.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The 10-seat Morgins-Foilleuse gondola, new in 2023, replaced the old chair and carries bikes inside; a return is 24 CHF for adults and transport of one bike is included in the ticket. MultiPass holders get 30% off. A full Portes du Soleil bike day pass covering both countries and 21 lifts is 39 EUR.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 1 July; closed from 21 September (2026 season).<br/>Gondola hours: 08:45-17:15 to 30 August, then 08:45-16:45<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Monthey</td><td>Bus</td><td>~35 min</td></tr><tr><td>Aigle</td><td>Car</td><td>~40 min</td></tr></table><br/><br/>
    <small>Three of the four runs are drawn here from traces supplied for this map; OpenStreetMap has not mapped the Morgins runs itself. The named MTB routes that do sit inside this valley in OSM belong to Chatel and Avoriaz, and are already drawn under those spots.</small><br/><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://en.portesdusoleil.com/in-summer/our-5-bikeparks/bikepark-champery-les-crosets-morgins/">Portes du Soleil</a>. Pin placed on the OSM-mapped <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/8215989">Morgins-Foilleuse gondola</a> valley station (way 8215989), verified at 1316 m. Trail lines drawn in gpx.studio and supplied for this map, simplified to ~8 m.
    Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
