    The high point of the Nodo plus Deka summer chain and where the descents start, 670 m above the Nodo valley station. Measured at 2526 m on <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/368666534">OSM way 368666534</a>. See the main Bakuriani pin for trails, prices and access.]]></description>
