    The second bike-carrying lift, 1369 m to 1817 m, about 2 km south-west of Campo Smith. Verified at 1369 m on <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/44407485">OSM way 44407485</a>. See the main Bardonecchia pin for trails, prices and access.]]></description>
