  <Placemark>
    <name>Figanières / Draguignan enduro zone (Var) [no lift]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Ligne électrique 717 m - top of the highest line, where the descents start</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>An unofficial but well-established enduro zone in the hills north of Draguignan, around Figanières and Montferrat. Eleven named lines are graded in OpenStreetMap and drawn here: <b>Piste des Avals</b> and <b>Francesca</b> (green), <b>Yaya ++</b>, <b>Ligne électrique</b> and <b>Full Power Line</b> (blue), <b>Yaya</b>, <b>La Secrète</b>, <b>La Fracture</b> and <b>Descente de la Claret</b> (red) and <b>T-Rex</b> (black). Dry Provençal terrain - limestone, pine and scrub - riding well outside high summer, with drops of 70 to 240 m per line rather than big alpine vertical.<br/><small>Three of the names exist in OpenStreetMap as disconnected pieces and are drawn as parts. This is a locally built network, not a resort: nothing is patrolled or maintained on a schedule.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>No lift and nothing to pay. Pedal or shuttle the ridge road; the lines drop off it towards Figanières and the Nartuby valley.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Rideable year-round; best outside July and August.<br/><small>Snow-free at this altitude, but the limestone bakes in high summer and gets greasy in the wet. Fire-risk closures apply to the Var massifs in summer - check the prefecture's daily access map before riding.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Draguignan</td><td>Car</td><td>~20 min</td></tr><tr><td>Nice</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h15</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: trail names and grades from OpenStreetMap. Pin placed at the head of the <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/536845902">Ligne électrique</a> line (way 536845902), measured at 717 m - there is no lift station or car park to anchor to. Grades are contributors', not an operator's; ride to what you can see.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-brown</styleUrl>
    <Point><coordinates>6.494960,43.590410,717</coordinates></Point>
    <ExtendedData xmlns:mwm="https://comaps.app">
