  <Placemark>
    <name>Monts Jura Bike Park - Crozet / Lélex (Ain) [27 EUR]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Crozet 640 m - valley station of the Fierney gondola</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Thirteen graded pistes, about 24 km, across three sectors of the Monts Jura resort an hour from Geneva. <b>Crozet</b> is the main one off the Fierney gondola: 9 pistes, ~15 km - Vino Rosso (blue, 2 km/319 m), Chez Paco (red, 2.5 km/648 m), La Boutique, La Fierney Ski Club, La Sensible, La Tralala and Pole (red), DH du Ghetto (black, 2.5 km/620 m) and Jointure (expert, 1.4 km/286 m). <b>Lélex</b>, off the Catheline gondola, adds 2 pistes and ~3.5 km: À Dom (red, 2.2 km/545 m) and La Beugnée (black, 2.9 km/545 m). <b>La Faucille</b> has 2 more, La Dardagny (blue) and La Dégringolée (red). Chez Paco's 648 m is the biggest single descent on the hill.<br/><small>No trail lines are drawn: OpenStreetMap has not mapped the pistes and the resort publishes no GPX.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The Fierney gondola at Crozet lifts 640 m to 1296 m and the Catheline at Lélex 903 m to 1444 m; both carry bikes. One ride 9.50 EUR adult / 6 EUR child, Crozet-Lélex day pass 27 EUR / 18 EUR, summer 2026 season pass 162 EUR / 108 EUR.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 1 June; closed from 30 September (lifts run through June to September).<br/><small>Check the resort calendar: sectors open on different dates and not every lift runs every day.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Geneva</td><td>Car</td><td>~40 min</td></tr><tr><td>Lyon</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h45</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://skipass.paysdegex-montsjura.com/fr/bike-park">Monts Jura bike park pistes</a> and the <a href="https://www.paysdegex-montsjura.com/en/ski-mtb-area/bike-park-des-monts-jura-domaine-de-lelex/">Pays de Gex tourist office</a>. Pin placed on the valley station of the OSM-mapped <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/4866703">Fierney gondola</a> (way 4866703), measured at 640 m. Prices, schedules and trail status can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-blue</styleUrl>
    <Point><coordinates>6.006850,46.282660,640</coordinates></Point>
    <ExtendedData xmlns:mwm="https://comaps.app">
      <mwm:properties>
        <mwm:value key="spot">monts-jura</mwm:value>
        <mwm:value key="tags">beginner expert bike-park dh enduro gondola</mwm:value>
        <mwm:value key="open_from">06-01</mwm:value>
        <mwm:value key="closed_from">09-30</mwm:value>
        <mwm:value key="price_day">27 EUR</mwm:value>
      </mwm:properties>
      <mwm:icon>Mountain</mwm:icon>
      <mwm:visibility>1</mwm:visibility>
    </ExtendedData>
  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Monts Jura: Fierney gondola top - Crozet (1296 m)</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Fierney 1296 m - top of the Crozet gondola</b><br/><br/>
    Where the nine Crozet pistes start, including DH du Ghetto and Chez Paco. Verified at 1296 m on <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/4866703">OSM way 4866703</a>. See the main Monts Jura pin for trails, prices and access.]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-gray</styleUrl>
    <Point><coordinates>5.982970,46.291500,1296</coordinates></Point>
    <ExtendedData xmlns:mwm="https://comaps.app"><mwm:properties><mwm:value key="spot">monts-jura</mwm:value></mwm:properties><mwm:icon>None</mwm:icon><mwm:visibility>1</mwm:visibility></ExtendedData>
  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Monts Jura: Lélex - Catheline gondola base (903 m)</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Lélex 903 m - valley station of the Catheline gondola</b><br/><br/>
    The Lélex sector, the closer of the two to Geneva by the Faucille road. Two pistes from the top: À Dom (red) and La Beugnée (black), both 545 m of descent. Covered by the same Crozet-Lélex pass. Verified at 903 m on <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/19091762">OSM way 19091762</a>. See the main Monts Jura pin for trails, prices and access.]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-gray</styleUrl>
    <Point><coordinates>5.943790,46.304310,903</coordinates></Point>
    <ExtendedData xmlns:mwm="https://comaps.app"><mwm:properties><mwm:value key="spot">monts-jura</mwm:value></mwm:properties><mwm:icon>None</mwm:icon><mwm:visibility>1</mwm:visibility></ExtendedData>
  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Monts Jura: Catheline gondola top - Lélex (1444 m)</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Catheline 1444 m - top of the Lélex gondola</b><br/><br/>
    Where À Dom and La Beugnée start. Verified at 1444 m on <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/19091762">OSM way 19091762</a>. See the main Monts Jura pin for trails, prices and access.]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-gray</styleUrl>
