    <name>Interlaken: Pavillon Trail (upper)</name>
    <description><![CDATA[0.3 km blue, moderate trail on the Harder, dropping 37 m from 677 m to 640 m. The upper of two parts: OpenStreetMap leaves a 274 m gap in the middle of the Pavillon Trail, so it is drawn as two lines rather than bridged with a straight bar. Difficulty from the OpenStreetMap S1 technical grade. Geometry simplified from OpenStreetMap - indicative only. Source: <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/relation/5122162">relation 5122162</a>.]]></description>
