    </ExtendedData>
  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Airolo: Runcasc Trail</name>
    <description><![CDATA[2.6 km red, difficult trail at Airolo, dropping 565 m from 1741 m to 1178 m. The trail that put Airolo on the gravity map, from Pesciuem right back to the foot of the cable car. Challenging terrain the whole way, with lettered sectors A to D along it so you can tell rescue where you are. Difficulty from the operator's own trail description. Geometry from the official <a href="https://www.airolo.ch/pdfEscursioni/air_runcasc_trail_23_13.gpx">Airolo GPX export</a> - indicative only.]]></description>
