  <Placemark>
    <name>Airolo: Bosco Trail</name>
    <description><![CDATA[1.1 km blue, moderate trail at Airolo, dropping 190 m from 1745 m to 1555 m. The park's least demanding line, from the Alpe Pesciuem mid-station: small rollers and berms taken at speed rather than anything steep. The operator's own description calls it the less demanding route. Difficulty from the operator's own trail description. Geometry from the official <a href="https://www.airolo.ch/pdfEscursioni/air_bosco_trail_22_13.gpx">Airolo GPX export</a> - indicative only.]]></description>
