  <Placemark>
    <name>Airolo: Bosco Trail Variante</name>
    <description><![CDATA[0.5 km red, difficult trail at Airolo, dropping 118 m from 1651 m to 1533 m. A short link joining the Bosco Trail to the Runcasc Trail, and much harder than the trail it leaves: a steeper, exposed singletrack finish over roots and boulders with some jump sections. Difficulty from the operator's own trail description. Geometry from the official <a href="https://www.airolo.ch/pdfEscursioni/air_variante_bosco_trail_28_12.gpx">Airolo GPX export</a> - indicative only.]]></description>
