  <Placemark>
    <name>Airolo: Sasso Trail</name>
    <description><![CDATA[1.6 km red, difficult trail at Airolo, dropping 326 m from 2042 m to 1722 m. One of the newest lines, dropping from Sasso della Boggia. The first section was dug by hand; the operator aims it at experienced riders and it is technical from top to bottom. Difficulty from the operator's own trail description. Geometry from the official <a href="https://www.airolo.ch/pdfEscursioni/air_sasso_trail2_27_11.gpx">Airolo GPX export</a> - indicative only.]]></description>
