  <Placemark>
    <name>Airolo: Pineta Bike</name>
    <description><![CDATA[7.9 km blue, moderate trail at Airolo, dropping 623 m from 1741 m to 1179 m. The long easy way down, through alpine pine forest from Pesciuem to Fontana on the north side of the Bedretto valley, then the flat Strada Bassa back to the cable car. Graded lower than everything else here and meant for riders who prefer easy descents. Difficulty from the operator's own trail description. Geometry from the official <a href="https://www.airolo.ch/pdfEscursioni/air_percorso_pineta_16_12.gpx">Airolo GPX export</a> - indicative only.]]></description>
