  <Placemark>
    <name>Airolo: Pascolo Bike</name>
    <description><![CDATA[6.4 km black, extremely difficult trail at Airolo, dropping 895 m from 2056 m to 1179 m. The big one: from Sasso della Boggia at the top of the second cable car all the way to the valley, and the only trail Airolo grades Schwer. Difficulty from the operator's own trail description. Geometry from the official <a href="https://www.airolo.ch/pdfEscursioni/air_pascolo_18_12.gpx">Airolo GPX export</a> - indicative only.]]></description>
