  <Placemark>
    <name>Empire 47: Mont de la Cote du Cure summit (428 m)</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Top of the hill and the highest point of the network, about 270 m above the reception. Belzebrute, Nosferatu, Descente du Coude and Mirador all start from this ridge; a refuge and viewpoint sit just below it. Source: <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/node/1203667175">OpenStreetMap node 1203667175</a>.]]></description>
