  <Placemark>
    <name>Wind Hill Bike Park (Wiltshire, England) [paid entry]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Wind Hill 205 m - bike park on the Longleat estate, near Warminster</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A privately run gravity park hidden in a valley on the Longleat estate, and one of the better-built jump venues in southern England. Eight trails drop off both faces of the valley: four downhill-oriented lines and four with a freeride and jump emphasis, plus dirt jumps and a dual line. Chalk-and-clay soil that is fast when dry and demanding when not. Part of the B1KE group, alongside Rogate, Tidworth and Milford.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>No vehicle uplift - riders pedal a dedicated climb trail back to the top. Paid day entry; check the operator for opening days, which are not daily.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Year-round on published opening days, weather permitting.<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Warminster</td><td>Car</td><td>~10 min</td></tr><tr><td>Bristol</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h00</td></tr><tr><td>London</td><td>Car</td><td>~2h15</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://www.b1ke.com/b1keparks/wind-hill/">B1KE Wind Hill</a>, <a href="https://off.road.cc/content/trail-centres/wind-hill-b1kepark-9181">off-road.cc</a> and <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/">OpenStreetMap</a>. Prices, opening days and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
