    <name>Narvikfjellet: top of the gondola</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Narvikfjellet 620 m - upper gondola station, where the bike trails start</b><br/><br/>
    See the main Narvikfjellet pin for trails, prices and access.]]></description>
