  <Placemark>
    <name>Gerlitzen Alpe: top of the Kanzelbahn</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Gerlitzen 1440 m - top of the Kanzelbahn, kids park and start of the PROlitzen trail</b><br/><br/>
    See the main Gerlitzen Alpe pin for trails, prices and access.]]></description>
