    <name>Nassfeld: Gmanberg mid-station</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Gmanberg 1020 m - top of Millennium-Express section I, start of the Mex-Line-I flow trail</b><br/><br/>
    See the main Nassfeld pin for trails, prices and access.]]></description>
