    <description><![CDATA[<b>Sonora, Mexico 219 m - local bike park</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A flow-trail park in the dry hills of northern Sonora, near Ciudad Obregon. Built and run locally; the operator posts trail and event updates rather than keeping a website.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>No lift; a small built park, ridden in short laps. Access is normally free, but the operator publishes little - check locally before making a trip of it.<br/><br/>
