  <Placemark>
    <name>B-trails (Belgium) [free, no lift]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>East Flanders, Belgium 19 m - local bike park</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A built mountain bike park on flat Flemish ground east of Ghent, tagged for mountain biking in OpenStreetMap and paired with an adjacent dirt-jump hill. Flanders has almost no natural gravity, so parks like this are dug rather than found.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>No lift; a small built park, ridden in short laps. Access is normally free, but the operator publishes little - check locally before making a trip of it.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Not published. Built parks of this kind normally ride from spring to autumn and close when the ground is too wet.<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Ghent</td><td>Car</td><td>~30 min</td></tr><tr><td>Brussels</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h00</td></tr></table><br/>
