    <name>Lincoln Bike Park (USA) [free, no lift]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>California, USA 43 m - local bike park</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A community bike park in Lincoln, north-east of Sacramento, built on flat valley ground: jump lines, pump tracks and progression features rather than descents.<br/><br/>
