    <name>ALTIBIKE (Mexico) [free, no lift]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Tlaxcala, Mexico 2910 m - local bike park</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A bike park on the high plateau east of Mexico City at nearly 2,900 m, among the highest on this map. Recorded in OpenStreetMap as a bike park; little is published about it beyond that.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>No lift; a small built park, ridden in short laps. Access is normally free, but the operator publishes little - check locally before making a trip of it.<br/><br/>
