    <name>Bike Park of Santa Clarita (USA) [free, no lift]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>California, USA 432 m - local bike park</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A municipal bike park north of Los Angeles, tagged in OpenStreetMap for cycling, mountain biking and BMX - a built progression facility rather than a hillside, in a county with very little public gravity terrain.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>No lift; a small built park, ridden in short laps. Access is normally free, but the operator publishes little - check locally before making a trip of it.<br/><br/>
