  <Placemark>
    <name>Park4All (Switzerland) [free, no lift]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Vaud, Switzerland 826 m - local bike park</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A bike park in the Vaud pre-Alps built by the Cyclomaniacs association, designed as an all-abilities facility - the name is the brief. Built lines rather than a lift-served hill.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>No lift; a small built park, ridden in short laps. Access is normally free, but the operator publishes little - check locally before making a trip of it.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Not published. Built parks of this kind normally ride from spring to autumn and close when the ground is too wet.<br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Vevey</td><td>Car</td><td>~30 min</td></tr><tr><td>Lausanne</td><td>Car</td><td>~40 min</td></tr></table><br/>
