    <description><![CDATA[<b>Tyrol, Austria 728 m - local bike park</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A local bike park at Oberndorf in Tirol, beside St. Johann, tagged sport=mtb in OpenStreetMap. Built trails on the valley floor below the Kitzbueheler Horn.<br/><br/>
