  <Placemark>
    <name>Oaza Trail Park (Slovakia) [free, no lift]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Presov, Slovakia 414 m - local bike park</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A built trail park in the hills north of Presov, eastern Slovakia. Recorded in OpenStreetMap as a bike park; part of the same recent wave of Slovak trail building as Bikos and Koliba.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>No lift; a small built park, ridden in short laps. Access is normally free, but the operator publishes little - check locally before making a trip of it.<br/><br/>
