  <Placemark>
    <name>Sherwood Pines (Nottinghamshire, UK) [no-lift]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Sherwood Pines - fast woodland singletrack and a dirt jump park</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Fast woodland singletrack with purpose-built XC loops, over 45 km of unmarked trails, a skills area and a bike park with a set of dirt jumps. Flat by trail-centre standards, which makes it one of the better all-weather options in the East Midlands.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>No uplift - pedal-up. Free entry, parking charge.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open year-round; trails may close in heavy rain or storm damage.<br/>Daily opening hours: dawn to dusk<br/><small>Free-access forest trails; no ticket office.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Nottingham</td><td>Car</td><td>~30 min</td></tr><tr><td>Mansfield</td><td>Car</td><td>~15 min</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.forestryengland.uk/sherwood-pines">Forestry England</a>.
    Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
