  <Placemark>
    <name>Bedgebury Forest (Kent, UK) [no-lift]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Bedgebury - the south east's main trail centre</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A 9 mile red XC route through the pinetum and surrounding forest near Tunbridge Wells, plus a family blue route and a skills area. The closest proper trail centre to London.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>No uplift - pedal-up. Parking charge.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open year-round; trails may close in heavy rain or storm damage.<br/>Daily opening hours: dawn to dusk<br/><small>Free-access forest trails; no ticket office.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>London</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h30</td></tr><tr><td>Tunbridge Wells</td><td>Car</td><td>~20 min</td></tr></table><br/>
