  <Placemark>
    <name>7stanes Dalbeattie (Dumfries and Galloway, Scotland) [no-lift]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Dalbeattie - granite slabs and the Slab</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Renowned among the 7stanes for technical trails, granite features and coastal views. The red 'Hardrock' trail includes the notorious Slab, one of the most photographed features in Scottish mountain biking.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>No uplift - pedal-up. Free to ride.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open year-round; trails may close in heavy rain or storm damage.<br/>Daily opening hours: dawn to dusk<br/><small>Free-access forest trails; no ticket office.</small><br/><br/>
