  <Placemark>
    <name>7stanes Glentrool (Galloway Forest Park, Scotland) [no-lift]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Glentrool - four downhill trails in Galloway Forest Park</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>The most remote of the 7stanes, set deep in Galloway Forest Park and renowned for its four downhill trails alongside the long blue 'Green Torr' loop.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>No uplift - pedal-up. Free to ride.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open year-round; trails may close in heavy rain or storm damage.<br/>Daily opening hours: dawn to dusk<br/><small>Free-access forest trails; no ticket office.</small><br/><br/>
