  <Placemark>
    <name>Comrie Croft (Perth and Kinross, Scotland) [no-lift]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Comrie Croft - skills park and hillside singletrack</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A bike skills and fun park on a working croft in Perthshire, suitable for everyone from balance bikers and novices to experienced riders, with hillside singletrack climbing above the farm.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>No uplift - pedal-up. Small trail fee; cafe, bike shop and accommodation on site.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open year-round; trails may close in heavy rain or storm damage.<br/>Daily opening hours: dawn to dusk<br/><small>Free-access forest trails; no ticket office.</small><br/><br/>
