  <Placemark>
    <name>Learnie Red Rocks (Black Isle, Scotland) [no-lift]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Learnie Red Rocks - Black Isle sandstone trails</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A compact network above the Moray Firth. Muirhead Climb and Firth View are blue-graded with coastal views; Learnie Hill is black-graded with challenging technical climbs and descents for experienced riders.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>No uplift - pedal-up. Free to ride.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open year-round; trails may close in heavy rain or storm damage.<br/>Daily opening hours: dawn to dusk<br/><small>Free-access forest trails; no ticket office.</small><br/><br/>
