  <Placemark>
    <name>Bike Park Kernow (Cornwall, UK) [shuttle]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Bike Park Kernow - Cornwall's uplift park</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Six trails in the heart of Cornwall: two blue, two red and one black, with vehicular uplift or push-up options. Ten minutes off the A30 near Grampound Road.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Vehicle uplift on operating days, or push up. Day tickets; check the current price and uplift schedule before travelling.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open year-round; trails may close in heavy rain or storm damage.<br/>Daily opening hours: dawn to dusk<br/><small>Free-access forest trails; no ticket office.</small><br/><br/>
