  <Placemark>
    <name>Forrest Mountain Bike Trails (Victoria, Australia) [no-lift]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Forrest - one of Australia's oldest MTB destinations, rebuilt</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A long-standing network in the Otway Ranges given a major revamp. The breadth of the trail network makes it a good destination for a whole family of riders regardless of skill or fitness, with flowing descents through wet eucalypt forest.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>No uplift - pedal-up. Free to ride.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open year-round; wettest months are winter.<br/>Daily opening hours: dawn to dusk<br/><small>Estimated hours; check the operator schedule.</small><br/><br/>
