  <Placemark>
    <name>Ourimbah State Forest (NSW, Australia) [no-lift]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Ourimbah - the Central Coast's long-running network</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A long-established network in Ourimbah State Forest between Sydney and Newcastle. The main loop is around 10 km with a mix of flowing and technical singletrack, and the forest has hosted national-level racing for decades.<br/><br/>
