  <Placemark>
    <name>Gap Creek Reserve (Brisbane, Australia) [no-lift]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Gap Creek - Brisbane's local go-to on Mount Coot-tha</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>The Brisbane local's default ride on the flank of Mount Coot-tha. The trails have enough character to build beginner confidence while still providing a playground for experts, with rocky technical lines alongside flowing descents.<br/><br/>
