  <Placemark>
    <name>Nerang National Park (Gold Coast, Australia) [no-lift]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Nerang - rocky technical trails twelve minutes from Surfers</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Many kilometres of rocky, natural, hand-built trail just 12 km from Surfers Paradise. Technical and rocky rather than manufactured, and best suited to XC and trail riding, with a long-standing local club network.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>No uplift - pedal-up. Free to ride.<br/><br/>
