  <Placemark>
    <name>The Gorge Mountain Bike Park (Nelson, New Zealand) [shuttle]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Wairoa Gorge - 70 km of hand-built shuttle-served trail</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Over 70 km of world-class hand-built singletrack deep in the Wairoa Valley south of Nelson. Trails run from grade 3 to grade 6 with almost 1000 m of descending on every top-to-bottom run. Originally built as a private park by Ken Dart and now run with shuttle access and on-site accommodation.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Shuttle uplift included in the day rate; the park is accessed by booking only. Check current rates and availability before travelling.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open year-round; wettest months are winter.<br/>Daily opening hours: dawn to dusk<br/><small>Estimated hours; check the operator schedule.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Nelson</td><td>Car</td><td>~45 min</td></tr><tr><td>Blenheim</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h30</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://mtbtrails.nz/">The Gorge Mountain Bike Park</a>.
    Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-blue</styleUrl>
