  <Placemark>
    <name>Hanmer Springs Forest Park (Canterbury, New Zealand) [no-lift]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Hanmer Springs - a large forest network above the hot pools</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A vast array of trails nestled amid the hills and plantation forest above the Hanmer Springs village, catering to every level from beginner to seasoned rider, with the thermal pools in the village as the obvious post-ride stop.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>No uplift - pedal-up. Free to ride.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open year-round; wettest months are winter.<br/>Daily opening hours: dawn to dusk<br/><small>Estimated hours; check the operator schedule.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Christchurch</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h45</td></tr><tr><td>Hanmer Springs</td><td>Bike</td><td>~5 min</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://visithanmersprings.co.nz/things-to-do/hanmer-trails/mountain-biking">Visit Hanmer Springs</a>.
    Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
