  <Placemark>
    <name>Ride Kanuga (North Carolina, USA) [no-lift]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Ride Kanuga - eMTB-friendly bike park near Pisgah</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>Eight downhill mountain bike trails with about 500 ft of vertical on the Kanuga property near Hendersonville. There is no lift or shuttle, but unlike the trails in nearby Pisgah National Forest e-bikes are permitted, and eMTBs can be rented on site - which is the point of the place.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>No lift or shuttle; climb under your own power or on an e-bike. Day pass required; e-bike rental available.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open year-round; trails may close in heavy rain or storm damage.<br/>Daily opening hours: dawn to dusk<br/><small>Free-access forest trails; no ticket office.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Asheville</td><td>Car</td><td>~40 min</td></tr><tr><td>Hendersonville</td><td>Car</td><td>~10 min</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://ridekanuga.com/">Ride Kanuga</a>.
    Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
