  <Placemark>
    <name>Wexl Trails (St. Corona am Wechsel, Austria) [t-bar]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Wexl Trails - family flow an hour from Vienna</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A family-friendly trail area in the Vienna Alps, roughly an hour from both Vienna and Graz. The centrepiece is a 4.5 km blue-graded flowtrail with gentle rolls, high berms and waves. The Insta360 Line is one of Austria's safest jumplines with 15 features, and technical singletracks such as the Herrgottschnitzer add bite. A mini bike park with a conveyor belt and a pumptrack serve the youngest riders.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Bike lift (surface lift) from the base station; free parking at the base. Day and multi-day tickets; check current prices.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from March; closed from November. The panorama trails do not open until mid-May.<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/><small>Estimated hours; check the operator schedule.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Vienna</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h</td></tr><tr><td>Graz</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h15</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.wexltrails.at/">Wexl Trails</a>.
    Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
