  <Placemark>
    <name>Iso-Syote Bike Park (Pudasjarvi, Finland) [t-bar]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Iso-Syote - lift-served riding in Finnish Lapland</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>One of the top destinations for lift-accessed mountain biking in Finland, opened in summer 2020. More than 10 trails each providing 1-2 km of rideable terrain, from beginner to expert, mixing flow routes, enduro trails, drops and jumps.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>T-bar lift, with staff fitting a rack behind the saddle tube for the bike. Lifts run from June. Downhill bikes, protective equipment and lift tickets available from the resort rental shop as three-hour or full-day packages.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from June; closed from September.<br/>Daily opening hours: 10:00-17:00<br/><small>Estimated hours; check the operator schedule.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Oulu</td><td>Car</td><td>~2h</td></tr><tr><td>Pudasjarvi</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.isosyote.fi/en/BikePark">Iso-Syote</a>.
    Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
