  <Placemark>
    <name>Luchon-Superbagneres (Haute-Garonne, France) [gondola]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Luchon-Superbagneres - 1200 m of vertical by cable car</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>The cable car from Luchon to Superbagneres opens up descents of up to 1,200 m of vertical from 1,800 m. The offer spans enduro courses, technical high-mountain circuits, forest trails and fast descents, each with a distinct character.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Cable car from Bagneres-de-Luchon carries bikes. Check current bike pass prices and operating days.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from May; closed from October.<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/><small>Estimated hours; check the operator schedule.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Bagneres-de-Luchon</td><td>Cable car</td><td>~10 min</td></tr><tr><td>Toulouse</td><td>Car</td><td>~2h</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.mairie-luchon.fr/explorez-les-pistes-de-descente-de-luchon-superbagneres/">Mairie de Luchon</a>.
    Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
