  <Placemark>
    <name>Flaine (Grand Massif, France) [gondola]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Flaine - 1800 m of descent off the Grandes Platieres</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A VTT-FFC labelled station in the Grand Massif with 200 km of marked circuits, from gentle forest rides to serious descents off the summits. The Descente des Grandes Platieres is a 12.5 km black reserved for confident riders, with very good grip, fast sections and exceptional Mont Blanc views. Chaining the Grandes Platieres cable car allows up to 1,800 m of descent over 13.5 km, finishing in Sixt.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Grandes Platieres cable car carries bikes in summer on selected days. Check the lift calendar and current prices before travelling.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from May; closed from October.<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/><small>Estimated hours; check the operator schedule.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Cluses</td><td>Car</td><td>~35 min</td></tr><tr><td>Geneva</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h15</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.flaine.com/en/mountain-bike/">Flaine</a>.
    Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
