  <Placemark>
    <name>La Pierre Saint-Martin (Pyrenees-Atlantiques, France) [chairlift]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>La Pierre Saint-Martin - a Bearn bike park at 1650 m</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A bike park in the Bearn Pyrenees designed for XC, enduro, downhill, e-mountain bikes and scooters, on high open karst terrain above the Aspe valley.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Chairlift carries bikes during the summer season. Check current bike pass prices and operating days.<br/><br/>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from May; closed from October.<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/><small>Estimated hours; check the operator schedule.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Oloron-Sainte-Marie</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h</td></tr><tr><td>Pau</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h30</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://www.n-py.com/fr/pierre-saint-martin/bike-park">N'PY</a>.
