    <description><![CDATA[<b>Meiringen-Hasliberg - a long freeride descent to the valley</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A downhill and freeride trail running between Reuti above Hasliberg and Meiringen in the valley, made up of hiking paths and natural shortcuts rather than manufactured berms - an old-school Swiss descent.<br/><br/>
