    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open year-round; conditions vary with the season.<br/>Daily opening hours: dawn to dusk<br/><small>Access and hours not published; verify locally.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Karlovy Vary</td><td>Car</td><td>local</td></tr></table><br/>
    <i>Source: <a href="https://trailparksaporo.webnode.cz/">Trail Park Saporo</a>, <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/relation/21104978">OpenStreetMap relation 21104978</a>.
    Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
