    <description><![CDATA[5.1 km red trail, dropping 261 m from 1407 m to 1146 m at an average 5%. Graded mtb:scale 2-3 in OpenStreetMap: a rideable forest track along the ridge, technical in its lower half. Geometry simplified from OpenStreetMap - indicative only, follow the ground. <i>Source: <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/494856350">way 494856350</a> and <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/494856351">way 494856351</a>.</i>]]></description>
