    </ExtendedData>
  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Monte Cornizzolo: trailhead parking (307 m)</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Parcheggio inizio sentiero Cornizzolo, 307 m</b><br/><br/>
    The marked trailhead parking above Civate, at the foot of the climb and where the Pozzo-side descents come out. Measured at 307 m; mapped as <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/691999342">OSM way 691999342</a>. See the main Monte Cornizzolo pin for trails and access.]]></description>
