  <Placemark>
    <name>Imlil: Aroumd (1979 m)</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Aroumd 1979 m - the highest village in the valley</b><br/><br/>
    The last settlement above Imlil on the Toubkal approach, 259 m higher, and where the village-side descents drop from. Mapped as <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/node/3078936779">OSM node 3078936779</a>. See the main Imlil pin for trails and access.]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-gray</styleUrl>
