    <description><![CDATA[0.5 km trail, dropping 59 m from 569 m to 510 m at an average 11%. OpenStreetMap records no grade for it. In OpenStreetMap this is mapped as the ski trail of the same name; Sugarbush's summer map signs that corridor as a numbered downhill bike trail. Geometry simplified from OpenStreetMap to approximately 8 m - indicative only, follow the signs on the ground. <i>Source: <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/44972508">way 44972508</a> and <a href="https://www.sugarbush.com/-/media/sugarbush/maps/Summer/SugarbushSummerTrailMap.pdf">Sugarbush summer trail map</a>.</i>]]></description>
