    <description><![CDATA[1.1 km blue trail, dropping 117 m from 349 m to 232 m at an average 10%. Graded blue by Blue Mountain's own trail list, which puts it in the lower-mountain downcountry set; OpenStreetMap tags it <code>description=Downhill Bike Trail</code> with <code>bicycle=yes</code>, <code>foot=no</code> and <code>access=permit</code>, but records no colour. Geometry simplified from OpenStreetMap to approximately 8 m - indicative only, follow the signs on the ground. <i>Source: <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/978862773">way 978862773</a>.</i>]]></description>
