  <Placemark>
    <name>Coldwater Mountain: Tortoise</name>
    <description><![CDATA[4.3 km green trail, dropping 163 m from 436 m to 273 m at an average 4%. Difficulty from the <code>mtb:scale:imba</code> grade OpenStreetMap carries on the trail - the IMBA scale, which is a difficulty rating rather than a technical-terrain one. Coldwater is a Forever Wild trail system built for mountain biking: every line here is <code>bicycle=designated</code> + <code>mtb=designated</code>, most of them one-way. Geometry simplified from OpenStreetMap to approximately 8 m - indicative only, follow the signs on the ground. <i>Source: <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/368752310">way 368752310</a>.</i>]]></description>
