  <Placemark>
    <name>Canmore Nordic Centre: Top Gun</name>
    <description><![CDATA[0.6 km black trail, dropping 55 m from 1428 m to 1373 m at an average 9%. Difficulty from the <code>mtb:scale:imba=3</code> grade OpenStreetMap carries on it. Top Gun is the one bike-designated descent OpenStreetMap holds inside the Nordic Centre itself; the rest of the venue's race network is mapped as ski trails with no bike tagging. Geometry simplified from OpenStreetMap to approximately 8 m - indicative only, follow the signs on the ground. <i>Source: ways <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/1546816550">1546816550</a>, <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/1546818288">1546818288</a>.</i>]]></description>
