  <Placemark>
    <name>Phil's Trail Complex: Mrazek Trail #32</name>
    <description><![CDATA[6.9 km blue trail, dropping 277 m from 1604 m to 1327 m at an average 4%. Difficulty from the <code>mtb:scale:imba=2</code> grade OpenStreetMap carries on it. Mrazek is the classic long descent of the Bend network and sits about 5 km north-west of the Phil's trailhead - the rest of the complex (Phil's, Ben's, Marvin's Garden, Grand Slam) is fully mapped and bike-designated but runs at 1-3%, too flat to draw as a descent. Geometry simplified from OpenStreetMap to approximately 8 m - indicative only, follow the signs on the ground. <i>Source: <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/1098448178">way 1098448178</a>.</i>]]></description>
