  <Placemark>
    <name>Flat Rock Ranch (Texas) [from 10 USD]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Flat Rock Ranch 483 m - trailhead and camp, 346 Flat Rock Creek Road, Comfort, Texas</b><br/><br/>
    <b>Trails</b><br/>A privately owned Hill Country ranch with around 28 miles of purpose-built singletrack, long regarded as some of the best cross-country riding in Texas. The network is built as two stacked loops: the Lower Loop rolls through long descents broken by steep, sometimes technical climbs, and the 11-mile Upper Loop is the rockier of the two, with long rock gardens, more drops and steeper descents. Since 2024 the ranch has also cut a dozen Texas-style enduro lines down the escarpment - Salalom, Cowabunga, Black Sheep, Pucker, Goat, Speed, Mad Bomber, Finally, All The Way Down, Da Dip and Frito Way among them - dropping 50-90 m at 8-11%, which is steep for this part of the state. Creek crossings, spectacular views and a race calendar that closes the trails on event days.<br/><br/>
    <b>Getting up / price</b><br/>No uplift: you pedal the loops. Single day ride from 10 USD, paid at the self-serve station or via the QR code on the gate. 2026 season passes: 240 USD day-ride only, 290 USD family ride, 390 USD family ride and camp. A one-time waiver is required and helmets are mandatory. Primitive camping on site.<br/><br/>
    <p class="warn">&#9888;&#65039; Closed November and December for hunting. Some events close the trails to daily riding - check the event schedule before you drive out. No dogs.</p>
    <b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 1 January; closed from 1 November for the hunting season (operator's published window).<br/>Daily opening hours: sun up to sun down, seven days a week<br/>
    <small>Published operating hours; weather permitting.</small><br/><br/>
    <b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Comfort</td><td>Car</td><td>~15 min</td></tr><tr><td>San Antonio</td><td>Car</td><td>~1 h</td></tr><tr><td>Austin</td><td>Car</td><td>~1 h 30</td></tr></table><br/>
    <small>Pin on the trailhead car park mapped in OpenStreetMap (<a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/881074581">way 881074581</a>), beside the toilets, showers and bike repair stands, measured at 483 m.</small><br/><br/>
    <i>Sources: <a href="https://www.flatrockranchtx.com/">Flat Rock Ranch</a> and its <a href="https://www.flatrockranchtx.com/fees">fees page</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-brown</styleUrl>
    <Point><coordinates>-98.870350,30.015730,483</coordinates></Point>
