  <Placemark>
    <name>Courchevel: Crête du Mont Charvet</name>
    <description><![CDATA[4.4 km black, extremely difficult route in the Courchevel backcountry, following the Crete du Mont Charvet ridge north before the switchbacks into the Vallee des Avals, dropping 792 m from 2391 m to 1599 m at an average 18%. <i>Trace drawn in gpx.studio and supplied for this map, simplified to ~8 m - indicative only. Pedal or hike-in above the Vallee des Avals - neither line is a marked bike-park run and no summer lift reaches the start.</i>]]></description>
