  <Placemark>
    <name>Courchevel: Traversée de la réserve</name>
    <description><![CDATA[4.8 km red, difficult route in the Courchevel backcountry, dropping 575 m from 2458 m to 1883 m at an average 12%. <i>Trace drawn in gpx.studio and supplied for this map, simplified to ~8 m - indicative only. Pedal or hike-in above the Vallee des Avals - neither line is a marked bike-park run and no summer lift reaches the start. Most of this line lies inside the Reserve biologique dirigee du Petit Mont Blanc, managed by the ONF - check local restrictions before riding it.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#line-red</styleUrl>
