    <name>Saint-Honore 1500: La petite derniere</name>
    <description><![CDATA[1.0 km black run, dropping 314 m from 1502 m to 1188 m at an average 32%. Difficulty from OpenStreetMap's record of the signed colour; check locally before riding, these are steep unpatrolled tracks. OpenStreetMap maps this run as 3 named sections, chained here into one line. Geometry simplified from OpenStreetMap (ODbL) to approximately 8 m - indicative only, follow the signs on the ground. <i>Source: relations <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/relation/19446678">19446678</a>, <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/relation/19446679">19446679</a>, <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/relation/19446680">19446680</a>.</i>]]></description>
