<Placemark>
    <name>Sasso del Ferro: Sasso del Ferro freeride line (mtb:scale 6)</name>
    <description><![CDATA[1.6 km unnamed line falling from 980 m to 586 m, 394 m of descent at an average 24%, starting just below the cable car top station. OpenStreetMap records no signed colour for it but tags it <b>mtb:scale 6</b> - the top of the technical scale, meaning long unrideable sections for all but a handful of riders. It is not a marked bike-park run and nothing here is patrolled. Geometry simplified from OpenStreetMap (ODbL) to approximately 8 m - indicative only. <i>Source: ways <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/760606906">760606906</a>, <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/364739463">364739463</a>.</i>]]></description>
