<Placemark>
    <name>Alagna Valsesia: DH Sasso del Diavolo</name>
    <description><![CDATA[5.7 km red, difficult route in the Monterosa above Alagna, dropping 1019 m from 2948 m to 1928 m at an average 18%. <i>Trace drawn in gpx.studio and supplied for this map, simplified to ~8 m - indicative only. Lift-served at both ends: the Funifor reaches Passo dei Salati at 2970 m and the line finishes beside the Pianalunga mid-station, so it rides as one long lap. High alpine ground above the treeline for its whole upper half - check the lift calendar and the forecast before committing.</i>]]></description>
